<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">Baebu Thyaa</book>
  <para style="h">MATTHAI</para>
  <para style="toc1">Matthew</para>
  <para style="toc2">MATTHAI</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mat</para>
  <para style="mt1">MATTHAI</para>
  <para style="mt2">KYATE THEHOYPAW</para>
  <para style="mt2">Matthew</para>
  <para style="imt">Byalaanmaw</para>
  <para style="im">
    <char style="bk">Thehoypaw Matthai </char> nynh oun hopyapaw tuh Byakin Ryn ccyh lya a ccungccaw hae kya Pachia nynh byakinnaw a raepaw a ccingsahnawpaw Jesu tuh kinpaw Khumtu thehoypaw kha nynh thua. Hynh-e thehoypaw tuh Jesu a puinaw te a hiinnaw tuh Judah ccungccaw hae hanlan kyalya thua khyh, laephi pynpi hanlan nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Matthai</char> nynh raeringkuh tacite a zeipaw ccaw nynh thua. Jesu puinaw kyate tho zah, baptisma a innaw te tuhounaw, tukoute phunghonaw, ryalawnaw, ccangpyanaw, te Galilee kya a dansahnaw hae balyn kha nynh thua. Hynh-e hae a zei koute Galilee kyate Jerusalem lang khua a ccongnaw, athangnaw kya vaelantahnaw te a thoothuinaw hae nynh athua hae.</para>
  <para style="ip">E Thehoypaw nynh Jesu tuh alepaw Ccangpahtu, Pachia Kawbya ccaesahpyanaw kya kawhoitu, te Pachia peenaw a ccangpahtu nynh thua cite a langsah. A ccangpyanaw balyn kha phu pangaw lan phia kho athua:</para>
  <para style="ip">(1) mua vaw ccangpyanaw kya vaawlang Peenaw lungkhu e zia, ryalaw, ccou lanpaw te paccynku lanpaw kong a ho (byaria hae 5-7); (2) mih ryalawnaw hanlan zuitu hae lu haw lae ning kya ccangpyanaw hae (byaria 10); (3) vaawlang Peenaw kong tousenaw (byaria 13); (4) zuitu thuanawpaw asuilan (byaria 18); (5) te atu e she athangnaw te yn thua cih paw vaawlang Peenaw kong ccangpyanaw (byaria 24-25).</para>
  <para style="iot">Alungkhu Umpaw</para>
  <para style="io1">Jesu a thokeinaw te a puinaw — 1.1—2.23</para>
  <para style="io1">Baptisma pyatu Johan ryalawnaw — 3.1-12</para>
  <para style="io1">Jesu baptisma innaw te tuhounaw — 3.13—4.11</para>
  <para style="io1">Galilee kya Jesu nynh zapi kya ryalawnaw — 4.12—18.35</para>
  <para style="io1">Galilee kyate Jerusalem lang — 19.1—20.34</para>
  <para style="io1">Jerusalem pepan te nyathya lonaw kya — 21.1—27.66</para>
  <para style="io1">Bawipaw a thoothuinaw te a langkunaw — 28.1-20</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Jesu Khri Thokeinaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 3:23-38">Luk 3.23-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abraham Ccapaw, David Ccapaw Jesu Khri a thokeinaw tuh hynhte nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Abraham ccaaw Isak; Isak ccaaw Jakob; Jakob nynh Judah te a uno hae kha a saah hae; <verse number="3" style="v" />Judah nynh Perez te Zerah a saah hae (mih nung tuh Tamar nynh thua); te Perez nynh Hezron a saah; Hezron nynh Ram; <verse number="4" style="v" />Ram nynh Amminadab; Amminadab nynh Nahshon a saah; Nahshon nynh Shalmon a saah; <verse number="5" style="v" />Shalmon nynh Boaz a saah (a nung tuh Rahab nynh thua); Boaz ccaaw Obed (a nung tuh Ruth nynh thua); Obed ccaaw Jessi; <verse number="6" style="v" />Jessi ccaaw tuh David Siapharan nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">David ccapaw tuh Solomon nynh thua (a nung tuh Uriah zu nynh thua); <verse number="7" style="v" />Solomon ccaaw Rehoboam; Rehoboam ccaaw Abijah; Abijah ccaaw Asa; <verse number="8" style="v" />Asa ccaaw Jehoshafat; Jehoshafat ccaaw Joram; Joram ccaaw Uzziah; <verse number="9" style="v" />Uzziah ccaaw Jotham; Jotham ccaaw Ahaz; Ahaz ccaaw Hezekiah; <verse number="10" style="v" />Hezekiah ccaaw Manasseh; Manasseh ccaaw Amon; Amon ccaaw Josiah; <verse number="11" style="v" />Josiah ccaaw Jekoniah te a uno hae; e ccyh loukaw hin nynh Babilon ram lang see lang a cciakhae hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.11. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:14-15">2Si 24.14-15</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:10">2Sh 36.10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 27:20">Jer 27.20</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Babilon see lang a cciakhae kou hae te Jekoniah nynh Shealtiel a saah; Shealtiel ccaaw Zerubbabel; <verse number="13" style="v" />Zerubbabel ccaaw Abiud; Abiud ccaaw Eliakim; Eliakim ccaaw Azor; <verse number="14" style="v" />Azor ccaaw Zadok; Zadok ccaaw Akhim; Akhim ccaaw Eliud; <verse number="15" style="v" />Eliud ccaaw Eliezer; Eliezer ccaaw Matthan; Matthan ccaaw Jakob; <verse number="16" style="v" />Jakob ccaaw Josef; Josef tuh Messiah a ci hae paw Jesu nung Mary a vawpaw kha nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuhcite Abraham kyate David kyacia she haw lae pali, David kyate Babilon see lang a tangnaw hae cia she haw lae pali, see lang a tangnaw hae te Messiah kyacia she haw lae pali acih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Jesu Khri Puinaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 2:1-7">Luk 2.1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jesu Khri a puinaw tuh hynhte nynh thua: a nung Mary kha Josef nynh a haaw, thuasalama a umkheih maw hae ze Mary tuh Thyaa Muisaw liate ccaaw a poi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.18. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:27">Luk 1.27</ref></char></note> <verse number="19" style="v" />A vawpaw Josef tuh adingpaw ccungccaw thua zah Mary kha zapi malang thethyasah lan ry khyh zah aruh lante zya mya lan a tuaku. <verse number="20" style="v" />Thuasalama tuhcite a tuaku lyakhe a maan kya Bawipaw vaawpaw nynh yn langkuh zah, “David ccapaw Josef, na zu lang Mary hoiku lanpaw kha rih nan. Pawccecize aning nynh a poipaw ccaaw tuh Thyaa Muisaw liate nynh a poi. <verse number="21" style="v" />Aning nynh ccapaw yn saah cih zah Jesu cite min na phu cih, pawccecize a ccungccaw hae kha mih seinaw kyate a khum cih hae,”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.21. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:31">Luk 1.31</ref></char></note> a cipya. <verse number="22" style="v" />Bawipaw nynh profeh kyate a hopaw kha accing nawlan nynh hynh-e balyn hynh acyiku.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Dotua, liaccady nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">ccaaw yn poi cih zah</para>
  <para style="q1">ccapaw yn saah cih, a min tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">Immanuel yn cikuh cih,”</para>
  <para style="m">(asuilan tuh, “Pachia kae kya a um,” cipaw nynh thua).<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.23. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 7:14">Isa 7.14</ref></char></note> <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuinte Josef nynh inaw kyate he yn thaekuh tuh, Bawipaw vaawpaw nynh kaw a pya hawte cyih zah Mary kha a zu lang a hoiku. <verse number="25" style="v" />Thuasalama ccapaw a pui mawlaezung tuh-e nung tuh ikhae khyh; te Josef nynh Jesu cite min a phu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.25. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 2:21">Luk 2.21</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Nithua langte Mihaw hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Herod siapharan lang a tang lya Judea ram Bethlehem khua kya Jesu a pui koute nithua langte awsi dothya hae paw mihaw hae tuh Jerusalem khua oun thua hae zah, <verse number="2" style="v" />“Judah siapharan lang a puipaw imua tuh teisangmou a um? Nithua langte yn thuapaw amaw awsi kha kae muih zah amaw beik lan nynh kae thua,” a ci hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Herod siapharan nynh e bya kha he a thae tuh a thinphang zah Jerusalem khuaccaaw hae balyn mah mih thinphang. <verse number="4" style="v" />Aning nynh ranpibawi lepaw hae mih balyn te ccungccaw hae kyaze kawbya sazae hae balyn kha pynkheihlan ko hae zah, “Teisangmou Messiah tuh a pui cih?” cite a khia hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Minmin nynh, “Judea ram Bethlehem khua kya nynh a pui cih; pawccecize profeh nynh hynhte a zei:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />‘Judah ram umpaw Bethlehem,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 5:2">Mik 5.2</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2">nang tuh Judah ram</para>
  <para style="q1">khuapi hae lakuze</para>
  <para style="q2">adih huapaw na thua khyh;</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize na kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">ka ccungccaw Israel hae</para>
  <para style="q1">tuurintu yn pou cih!’ a ci,” cite a hopya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tetuh Herod nynh mihaw hae kha aruh lante ko hae zah, hohtuh ccyh kya mou awsi yn langku cite akaw-aleih a khia hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuinte minmin kha Bethlehem lang saw hae zah, “La cceih oh lah imua kha thawte oun ccung oh; amaw kha nae muih oh te, nae hopah bua cih oh, kae mah kae cceih cih zah ka beikbua ccaw,” a cipya hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Siapharan bya he a thae kou hae te minmin tuh a pou hae; te nithua lang a muih hae paw awsi tuh mih malang khe cceih zah imua a umnaw luki khe a thadyn. <verse number="10" style="v" />Awsi a thadynpaw kha a muih hae tuh myaryamaw mih lungtua. <verse number="11" style="v" />Te inn lungkhu lang tee hae zah imua te a nung Mary kha a muih hae, te ccukharutungte amaw kha a beik hae; minmin nynh mih sisua bawng hae kha hung hae zah sui, frankinsen te mura kha lasung lang a pya hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Minmin tuh Herod kalan a ki vae khyh nawlan hae Pachia nynh mih maan kya raeringnaw a pya hae keiccuze laanpi ccanglang te mih ram lang a ki hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Izip lang Ccuekhaenaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Minmin he a cceih kou hae te, Bawipaw vaawpaw tuh Josef a maan kya yn langkuh zah, “Thokuh lah imua te a nung kha hoei hae lah Izip ram lang ccuekhae hae, bya kae hopya makhia tuin kya la um, pawccecize Herod nynh imua kha chia khylan yn ccung vae cih,” a cipya. <verse number="14" style="v" />Josef nynh thokuh zah imua te a nung kha hoei hae zah khuazi khe Izip ram lang a cciakhae hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Herod a chi mawlaezung tuin kya nynh a um. E tuh Bawipaw nynh profeh kyate, “Ka ccapaw kha Izip ram kyate ka ko vae,” cite a hopaw kha accingnawpaw nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 11:1">Hos 11.1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mihaw hae nynh yn ling vae hae cipaw kha Herod nynh he a nyh tuh myaryamaw a thinria, te mihaw hae nynh a ho hae paw accyh kha a khyase koute ccungccaw saw zah Bethlehem khua te a pepan umpaw, kum ning te akaw lang e pise imua hae balyn kha marya a chiasah hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuhcite profeh Jeremiah nynh a la hopaw bya tuh accing vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Ramah khua kya</para>
  <para style="q2">rawkhuinaw te</para>
  <para style="q1">myarya ccihpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">rawnaw roi kha thae athua.</para>
  <para style="q1">Rachel tuh a ccaaw hae hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">rawkhuite a um;</para>
  <para style="q1">a ccaaw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">a um vae khyh hae keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q1">soihbiaku ry vae khyh.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:15">Jer 31.15</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Izip Ram kyate A Ki hae</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 2:39-40">Luk 2.39-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Herod he a chih te, Bawipaw vaawpaw tuh Izip ram kya Josef a maan kya yn langkuh zah, <verse number="20" style="v" />“Thokuh lah imua te a nung kha hoei hae lah Israel ram lang kikhae ccavae hae, pawccecize imua hiinnaw a ccung hae paw tuh phe chih vae hae,” a cipya. <verse number="21" style="v" />Te Josef tuh thokuh zah imua te a nung kha hoei hae zah Israel ram lang a kikhae hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Thuasalama Arkhelaus nynh a paaw Herod ccelang Judea ram kha a uk cipaw Josef nynh he a thae tuh tuh-e ram lang ccia lan a rih; tuhzemah Pachia nynh a maan kya a hopya thyhte Galilee ram lang a cceih. <verse number="23" style="v" />Te Nazareth cikuhpaw khua kyakhe a um. “Aning tuh Nazareth khuapaw cite ko athua cih,” cite profeh hae nynh a ho hae paw kha accingnawpaw nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 1:24">Mar 1.24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 2:39">Luk 2.39</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:45">Joh 1.45</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Laanpi Paccynpyanaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mar 1.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk 3.1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Joh 1.19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuh ccyh lyakhe Baptisma pyatu Johan tuh yn langkuh zah Judea pee ramkaw khe phungho zah, <verse number="2" style="v" />“Ngaesikuh oh, pawccecize vaawlang peenaw tuh anae vae,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:17">Mat 4.17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:15">Mar 1.15</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />Profeh Isaiah nynh,</para>
  <para style="q2">“Ramkaw kya a siapaw</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw lu kheitpaw roi nynh,</para>
  <para style="q2">‘Bawipaw laanpi kha paccynpah oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">a ccianaw laanpi kha</para>
  <para style="q2">lawbabin lan raepah oh,’ a ci,”</para>
  <para style="m">cite a honuathepaw kha Johan nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3">Isa 40.3</ref> (LXX)</char></note> <verse number="4" style="v" />Johan tuh kalauh ming te kuakuhpaw boeining kha lawkuh zah a tae kya saphua taeccia a cciaku; a aepaw tuh tungkhipaw te ramkaw e khoitui nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 1:8">2Si 1.8</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" />Te Jerusalem, Judea pee te Jordan vahue a um hae paw ccungccaw hae balyn tuh Johan kalan oun cceih hae zah, <verse number="6" style="v" />mih seinaw hae kha phykuh hae zah Johan nynh Jordan vaw khe baptisma a pya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thuasalama baptisma in lan oun thua hae paw Farasi hae te Sadusi hae patae kha Johan nynh he a muih hae tuh minmin kha, “Pou huparepaw ciihan hae, yn thua cih paw thinrianaw kyate ccue lan hum nynh mou raeringnaw ae pya oh?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:34">Mat 12.34</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 23:33">23.33</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v" />Ngaesikunaw te angaekuhpaw athae kha langsakuh oh; <verse number="9" style="v" />‘Abraham tuh kae paaw nynh thua,’ cite tuakuh nan oh. Pawccecize Pachia tuh hynh-e lung hae kyate Abraham ccaaw hae kha a rae kho cipaw kae hopya oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:33">Joh 8.33</ref></char></note> <verse number="10" style="v" />Te atu mah hae tuh thingku leihpaw kya nungde athua vae; tukeiccuze ahoypaw athae thae leipaw thingku miakaw tuh nge thua zah maee lungkhu lang phung athua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:19">Mat 7.19</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Ngaesikunaw hanlan kae nynh tui kya baptisma kae insah oh; thuasalama kamaw koute yn thua lanpaw aning tuh kae laeze a lesaehua, kae tuh tuh-e paw a phanah ccyngpya lan heize ka ngaekuh khyh; aning nynh nanning kha Thyaa Muisaw kya te maee kya baptisma ae insah cih oh. <verse number="12" style="v" />A kuih kya paraw ccyngkute a huihmin kha thyaapaping lan a cciccae koute a chanvuih kha byng lungkhu lang a ruin cih, thuasalama asipaw kha tuh a chih kho leipaw maee te a u cih,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu Baptisma Innaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mar 1.9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luk 3.21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Te Jesu tuh Galilee kyate Jordan vaw lang Johan kalan baptisma yn pya ccaw cite yn thua. <verse number="14" style="v" />Thuasalama Johan nynh, “Kae nynh khaw nang na kya baptisma in lan ka ccan, nang nynh tou ka kalan nae cceih?” cipah zah amaw kha a khee. <verse number="15" style="v" />Thuasalama Jesu nynh, “Atu tuh hynhcite cyihkuh hin sah, pawccecize dingnaw balyn marya accing nawlan aening nynh hynhcimawte cyi lanpaw nynh thua,” a cipya. Tetuh Johan tuh a nawccah. <verse number="16" style="v" />Te Jesu tuh baptisma a in koute tui kyate yn pou lyakhe vaawlang tuh vaekheihmawte yn hungkuh zah Pachia Muisaw tuh vahu hawte yn rungbung zah a tungvaw yn ccupaw kha a muih. <verse number="17" style="v" />Vaawlang te roi nynh, “E paw tuh a tungvaw ka lungryccingpaw, ka sungsahpaw ka Ccapaw nynh thua,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:2">Gen 22.2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 2:7">Sam 2.7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:1">Isa 42.1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:18">Mat 12.18</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 17:5">17.5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mar 1.11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:35">Luk 9.35</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Jesu Tuhounaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mar 1.12-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Luk 4.1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Te Satan nynh a tuhou ccaw cite Muisaw nynh Jesu kha ramkaw lang a cciakhae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 2:18">Heb 2.18</ref>, <ref loc="HEB 4:15">4.15</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Jesu tuh nin sung pali te zi sung pali looh-ae sung zah myarya a vuelaw. <verse number="3" style="v" />Te tuhoutu tuh a kalan yn thua zah, “Pachia Ccapaw na thua ze hynh-e lung hae hynh sanlou lang tang lan kawpyatua,” a cipya. <verse number="4" style="v" />Thuasalama Jesu nynh, “Ccathyaa kya,</para>
  <para style="q2">‘Ccungccaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">sanlou kyalya te hiin khyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">thuasalama Pachia munglae kyate</para>
  <para style="q1">yn toikuhpaw bya miakaw</para>
  <para style="q2">te nynh a hiin,’ cite azeikuh,” a cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 8:3">Deu 8.3</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Te Satan nynh Jesu kha athyaapaw khuapi lungkhu lang cciakhae zah beikinn ahang huanaw ccukaly kya a umsah. <verse number="6" style="v" />Te Jesu kha, “Nang tuh Pachia Ccapaw na thua ze toiku tua; pawccecize Ccathyaa kya,</para>
  <para style="q2">‘Nang te asekuh lante Pachia nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">a vaawccungccaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">kaw a pya cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">lung kya na ccu na thuhku khyh nawlan</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin nynh mih kuih te</para>
  <para style="q1">ae hoeilang cih hae,’ cite azeikuh,” a cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:11-12">Sam 91.11-12</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jesu nynh, “Ccathyaa kya, ‘Bawipaw na Pachia kha syntawtua nan,’ cite bua azeikuh,” a cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:16">Deu 6.16</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tukoute Satan nynh myarya hangpaw mua langkhe kaekhae zah laephi peenaw hae te phu-e lesaenaw balyn kha muihsah zah, <verse number="9" style="v" />“Bakhungte nae beik zetuh hynh-e hae balyn hynh marya kae pya cih,” a cipya. <verse number="10" style="v" />Tetuh Jesu nynh, “Satan, cceih ccavae! Pawccecize Ccathyaa kya,</para>
  <para style="q1">‘Bawipaw na Pachia kha</para>
  <para style="q2">beik lah amaw kyalya kha</para>
  <para style="q1">ryalawpah,’ cite azeikuh,” a cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:13">Deu 6.13</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Te Satan nynh Jesu kha a cciataw; te vaaw hae nynh oun thuanua hae zah amaw kha a do-oih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Galilee kya Jesu Ryalaw Thonaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mar 1.14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luk 4.14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Johan kha thong a saw hae cipaw Jesu nynh he a thae tuh Galilee pee lang a cceih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:3">Mat 14.3</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:17">Mar 6.17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:19-20">Luk 3.19-20</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v" />Te Nazareth khua kha cciataw zah Zebulun phin te Naftali phin hae ram kya rili kin umpaw Kapernaum khua khe a um.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:12">Joh 2.12</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuh-e acyikupaw tuh profeh Isaiah nynh a hopaw kha accingnawpaw nynh thua. A hopaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Zebulun ram te Naftali ram,</para>
  <para style="q2">rili kin e laanpi pe,</para>
  <para style="q1">Jordan vaw khuraw,</para>
  <para style="q2">Zenta hae umnaw Galilee ram:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.15-16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 9:1-2">Isa 9.1-2</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mohnaw kya umpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">awnaw alepaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a muih vae hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">chinaw mynlyh ram lungkhu</para>
  <para style="q2">a um hae paw kya</para>
  <para style="q1">awnaw yn langkuh vae,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuin ccyh kyate Jesu nynh, “Ngaesikuh oh, pawccecize vaawlang peenaw tuh anae vae,” cite phungho lan a tho takaw vae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:2">Mat 3.2</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Masaty Jesu Zuitu hae Konaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mar 1.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Luk 5.1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Te Jesu nynh Galilee Rili kin kya a ccia lyakhe Peter a ci hae paw Simon te a neitaw Andru, ngasaw kyngtu hae uno lu ning, rili lungkhu mia a vua hae paw kha a muih. <verse number="19" style="v" />Te Jesu nynh minmin kha, “Kae hynh yn zui oh lah ccungccaw kyngtu lang kae rae cih oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Vaekheihmawte mih mia kha cciataw hae zah amaw kha a zui hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuin kyate cceih zah ccangpaw uno lu ning, Zebedi ccapaw hae James te a neitaw Johan tuh mih paaw Zebedi ryte kohlung kya mih mia a thuekuh hae paw kha muih zah a ko hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Vaekheihmawte kohlung te mih paaw kha cciataw hae zah Jesu kha a zui hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Ccangpya, Phungho, Dansah</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:17-19">Luk 6.17-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jesu tuh Galilee pee balyn khe khua po ccong zah mih sinakok hae kya ccangpah hae zah peenaw thehoypaw bya kha a hopya hae, ccungccaw hae kya-e ccinaw aphuinphuin te ccihawnaw aphuinphuin kha a dansah.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:35">Mat 9.35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:39">Mar 1.39</ref></char></note> <verse number="24" style="v" />Tukeiccuze a minthaannaw tuh Siria pee balyn po a pazaekuh; ccihawnaw te ccinaw aphuinphuin a teing hae paw, raerangsaro bahkuh hae paw, a dung hae paw te mih kuihccuchih hae paw kha amaw kalan oun cciakhae hae zah minmin kha marya a dansah hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Te Galilee pee kyate, Dekapolis pee kyate, Jerusalem kyate, Judea pee kyate, Jordan vaw khuraw langte oun thua hae paw ccungccaw zapi myarya lung hae paw nynh amaw kha a zui hae.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Mua Vaw Ccangpyanaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:1-7:29">5.1—7.29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesu nynh ccungccaw zapi kha he a muih hae te, mua lang kaethung zah a haung; a zuitu hae tuh amaw kalan oun thua hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Te a byaho kha tho zah minmin kha a ccangpya hae:</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thinlung zakawsangsakuh hae paw tuh lungtua hae paw nynh thua; pawccecize vaawlang peenaw tuh minmin kya-e nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A rah a khui hae paw tuh lungtua hae paw nynh thua; pawccecize minmin tuh soihbia athua cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 61:2">Isa 61.2</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lungne hae paw tuh lungtua hae paw nynh thua; pawccecize minmin tuh laephi rho a ccou cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 37:11">Sam 37.11</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Dingnaw kha vuelaw tuihaw hawte a ry hae paw tuh lungtua hae paw nynh thua; pawccecize mih rynaw kha ccingsah athua cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 55:1-2">Isa 55.1-2</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngaethyaumsahnaw a hoi hae paw tuh lungtua hae paw nynh thua; pawccecize minmin tuh ngaethyaumsahnaw kha a mue cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thinlung athyaa hae paw tuh lungtua hae paw nynh thua; pawccecize minmin tuh Pachia kha a muih cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 24:3-4">Sam 24.3-4</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Daenaw raetu hae tuh lungtua hae paw nynh thua; pawccecize minmin tuh Pachia ccaaw hae cite ko athua cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Dingnaw keiccuze tuaasahnaw a ing hae paw tuh lungtua hae paw nynh thua; pawccecize vaawlang peenaw tuh minmin kya-e nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 3:14">1Pe 3.14</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Kae ka keiccuze nanning kha ae sarya oh, ae tuaa ae sah oh zah ahme lei lante ahoy leipaw hynbya aphuinphuin ae be oh ze, nanning tuh lungtua hae paw nynh na thua oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 4:14">1Pe 4.14</ref></char></note> <verse number="12" style="v" />Nae lungtua sah lah nae lungpaw sah, pawccecize vaawlang khua kya nae ryalaw mee tuh ale; pawccecize nanning maw e profeh hae kha mah minmin nynh tuhmaminte a tuaa a sah hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:16">2Sh 36.16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:52">Loc 7.52</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Loi te Awnaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mar 9.50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34-35">Luk 14.34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Nanning tuh laephi loi nynh na thua oh; thuasalama loi nynh a enaw kha a zo ze pawcihtemou esah thui kho athua ung cih? Pawpaw elang sanmah hoy vae lan khyh, dae vua lan zah syde lanpaw nynh hung athua vae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Nanning tuh laephi awnaw nynh na thua oh. Mua vawlan sakpaw khua tuh thuruh kho thua khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:12">Joh 8.12</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 9:5">9.5</ref></char></note> <verse number="15" style="v" />Humhung nynh mah maeekhua kha aw zah ke khung boi khyh, maee awnawpaw vawlan khe nung zah inn lungkhu um hae paw balyn kha awnaw a pya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 4:21">Mar 4.21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:16">Luk 8.16</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 11:33">11.33</ref></char></note> <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuhawte nae awnaw kha ccungccaw hae malang khe awsah oh, tuhteze nynh ahoypaw nae ryalaw kha a muih cih hae zah vaawlang umpaw nae Paaw kha a phu-esah cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 2:12">1Pe 2.12</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Kawbya Ccingnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Kawbya tuhkhyhze profeh hae bya ro lan nynh kae hynh yn thua cite tua nan oh; kae tuh ro lan kae thua khyh, ccingsah khylan nynh kae thua. <verse number="18" style="v" />Pawccecize byaccaccing kae hopya oh, vaaw te lae a um lungkhu tuh kawbya abalynte accing makhia kawbya kya-e ccaw ccangkheit, ccapyh suapaw ccaw kha sanmah roh lan khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 16:17">Luk 16.17</ref></char></note> <verse number="19" style="v" />Tukeiccuze humhung zemah hynh-e kawbya hae kyaze adih huapaw ccangkheit kha lawe zah ming hae kha mah tuhcite a ccangpah hae paw tuh vaawlang peenaw kya adih huapaw lang a tang cih; thuasalama humhung zemah tuh-e tuh zui zah ming hae kha a ccangpah hae paw tuh vaawlang peenaw kya alepaw lang a tang cih. <verse number="20" style="v" />Pawccecize kae hopya oh, nae dingnaw nynh kawbya sazae hae te Farasi hae dingnaw kha a lawe khyh lanze vaawlang peenaw kya papin na tee lan khyh oh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Thinrianaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“ ‘Ccungccaw na theih lan khyh, humhung zemah ccungccaw a theihpaw tuh byapianaw kalan thuakhae athua cih,’ cite langmawlya e ccungccaw hae a hopya hae paw kha na thae vae oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:13">Exo 20.13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:17">Deu 5.17</ref></char></note> <verse number="22" style="v" />Thuasalama kae hopya oh, humhung zemah a uno kha a thinrianuapaw<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abang Baebu kya tuh ‘akonglang um leite a thinrianuapaw’ cite a um.</char></note> tuh byapianaw kalan thuakhae athua cih, te humhung zemah a uno kha, a saryapaw tuh byapianaw kalan thuakhae athua cih, te humhung zemah a uno kha ‘Nang tuh mingaee,’ a cih paw tuh hell maee lungkhu lang ccaw lan angaekuhpaw nynh thua. <verse number="23" style="v" />Tukeiccuze silawhang kalan na lasung kha nae ccyng lyakhe na uno nynh na tungvaw a thinriapaw kha na nyku ze, <verse number="24" style="v" />silawhang malang khe na lasung kha nungsyate la cceih lah, na uno te ccawkunaw na raety koute bua yn cceih lah na lasung kha pya. <verse number="25" style="v" />Nang ae rawsetupaw ryte tazae zung lang na ccia lya oh khe, arangte ccawkuh oh, tuhkhyhze ae rawsetupaw nynh byapiatu kalan ae ah cih zah byapiatu nynh thong uktu kalan ae ah cih, te nang kha thong ae saw cih hae. <verse number="26" style="v" />Byaccaccing kae hopya, na rung lanpaw nyathya phuapia kha na pya mawlaezung thonginn kyate na pou lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Milae Zu Milae Vawpaw Seikhaenaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“ ‘Milae zu milae vawpaw kya na sei lan khyh,’ cite a ho hae paw kha na thae vae oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:14">Exo 20.14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:18">Deu 5.18</ref></char></note> <verse number="28" style="v" />Thuasalama kae hopya oh, humhung zemah nopi lu kheit kha seikhae rynaw mit te a do lanze a thinlung kya tuh-e nung kha phe a seikhae vae. <verse number="29" style="v" />Te na ranglang mit nynh ae seisah ze, poh khoi lah dae vua; pawccecize na pyn balynte hell lungkhu lang vua na thua lae tuh na pyn kya-e hae ccangkhakheit na shungpaw tuh na hanlan ahoyhua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:9">Mat 18.9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:47">Mar 9.47</ref></char></note> <verse number="30" style="v" />Te na ranglang kuih nynh ae seisah ze thoh tya lah dae vua; pawccecize na pyn balynte hell lungkhu lang vua na thua lae tuh na pyn kya-e hae ccangkhakheit na shungpaw tuh na hanlan ahoyhua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:8">Mat 18.8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:43">Mar 9.43</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Zu Myanaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:9">Mat 19.9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mar 10.11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luk 16.18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“ ‘Humhung zemah a zu kha a mya lanze tuh-e nung tuh myakunawpaw ccaw kha pya sah,’ cite a ho vae hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 24:1-4">Deu 24.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:7">Mat 19.7</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:4">Mar 10.4</ref></char></note> <verse number="32" style="v" />Thuasalama kae hopya oh, humhung zemah ohhuakunaw keiccu thua leite a zu kha a mya ze tuh-e nung kha milae vawpaw kya a seisahpaw nynh thua; te humhung zemah a mya hae paw nopinung kha zu lang a umkhaepaw tuh milae zu a seikhaepaw nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:9">Mat 19.9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mar 10.11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luk 16.18</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 7:10-11">1Ko 7.10-11</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Byakinkupaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“Tukoute, ‘Ahme leite bya na kinkuh lan khyh, Bawipaw kya bya na kinkupaw kha na cyih ccaccing cih,’ cite langmawlya e ccungccaw hae nynh a hopya hae paw kha na thae vae oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:12">Lev 19.12</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 30:2">Nam 30.2</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 23:21">Deu 23.21</ref></char></note> <verse number="34" style="v" />Thuasalama kae hopya oh, thyalawkute kharouh byakinkuh nan oh, vaawlang phyate mah byakinkuh nan oh, pawccecize vaawlang tuh Pachia kya-e bawitungkhung nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 5:12">Jam 5.12</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 66:1">Isa 66.1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:22">Mat 23.22</ref></char></note> <verse number="35" style="v" />Laephi phyate mah byakinkuh nan oh, pawccecize laephi tuh a ccusy nynh thua; Jerusalem phyate mah byakinkuh nan oh, pawccecize Jerusalem tuh alesaepaw Siapharan kya-e khuapi nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:1">Isa 66.1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 48:2">Sam 48.2</ref></char></note> <verse number="36" style="v" />Na lu phyate mah byakinkuh nan, pawccecize na sang ccangkheit sanmah na rawsah kho khyh zah na mansah kho khyh. <verse number="37" style="v" />Thuasalama na hopaw tuh athua ze athua, athua khyh ze thua khyh na ci cih; pawccecize pawpaw bya zemah hynh-e hae laelan tuh ahoy leipaw kyate nynh yn thua.</para>
  <para style="s1">Liarunaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:27-36">Luk 6.27-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />“ ‘Mit ccangkheit hanlan mit ccangkheit, te haw ccangkheit hanlan haw ccangkheit’ cite a ho hae paw kha na thae vae oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 21:24">Exo 21.24</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 24:20">Lev 24.20</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:21">Deu 19.21</ref></char></note> <verse number="39" style="v" />Thuasalama kae hopya oh, hoyleinaw a raepaw kha liaru nan oh, lukhakheit nynh na ranglang byaki kha ae bia ze, na voilang byaki kha mah la tuapakuh. <verse number="40" style="v" />Te lukhakheit nynh tazaeccoi ae ry zah na angki kha a lawku ze, na angkile kha mah la lawku bia sah. <verse number="41" style="v" />Te lukhakheit nynh me kheit ccia lan ae riase ze amaw ryte me ning la cceih oh. <verse number="42" style="v" />Lukhakheit nynh nang ae ngiaku ze la pya, te lukhakheit nynh nang ae koii ry ze la kang nan.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />“ ‘Na innpaw kha na sungsah cih zah na rhawpaw kha na hua cih,’ cite a ho hae paw kha na thae vae oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.43: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lev 19.18</ref></char></note> <verse number="44" style="v" />Thuasalama kae hopya oh, nae rhaw hae kha sungsah oh, nanning ae tuaa ae sah oh paw hanlan sawsangpah oh. <verse number="45" style="v" />Tuhteze nynh vaawlang umpaw nae Paaw a ccaaw hae lang na tang cih oh; pawccecize ahoy leipaw te ahoypaw ccungccaw tungvaw a khuanin kha pawsah zah adingpaw te ading leipaw tungvaw khuaa a rawsah. <verse number="46" style="v" />Pawccecize nanning ae sungsah oh paw kyalya kha na sungsah oh ze amee pawmou na mue cih oh? Ngunto khoi hae paw nynh heize tuhte cyih khyh hae tou? <verse number="47" style="v" />Te na uno hae kyalya kha na beih hae ze ming hae laeze pawmou na cyihua? Zenta hae nynh heize tuhte cyih khyh hae tou? <verse number="48" style="v" />Tukeiccuze vaawlang umpaw nae Paaw tuh accing hawte nanning mah la ccing oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.48: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:2">Lev 19.2</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 18:13">Deu 18.13</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Pyanaw Kong Ccangpyanaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Ccungccaw hae nynh yn muih hae sah cite minmin malang ryachi bawmnaw na pya khyh nawlan oh la raeringkuh oh; tuhkhyhze tuh vaawlang umpaw nae Paaw kya-e amee na mue lan khyh oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:5">Mat 23.5</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Tukeiccuze ryachi bawmnaw na pya vae oh ze thyaruh hae nynh sinakok hae kya te laanpi hae kyakhe ccungccaw hae nynh thehoysahnaw kha ccou khylan a cyi hae hawte nae malang mungkae la tusah nan oh. Byaccaccing kae hopya oh, minmin tuh mih ryalaw mee kha phe a mue vae hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Thuasalama ryachi bawmnaw na pya vae oh ze nae ranglang kuih nynh a cyipaw kha nae voilang kuih la nysah nan oh. <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuhteze nynh ryachi bawmnaw na pya oh paw kha hum nynh sanmah nyh lan khyh; te aphirute cyipaw a muihtupaw nae Paaw nynh amee kha ae pya cih oh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Bawipaw Sawsangnaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:2-4">Luk 11.2-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Te saw na sang vae oh ze thyaruh hae hawte la cyih nan oh; pawccecize minmin tuh sinakok hae kya te laanpi hae atungkunaw kya ccungccaw hae nynh yn muih hae sah cite thadyn lante sawsang a ry hae. Byaccaccing kae hopya oh, minmin tuh mih ryalaw mee kha phe a mue vae hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 18:10-14">Luk 18.10-14</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />Thuasalama saw na sang vae oh ze nae khaan lungkhu lang tee oh lah nae thuakaw kha khaw oh lah, muih kho leipaw kya a umpaw nae Paaw kalan khe sawsang oh; te aphirute cyipaw a muihtupaw nae Paaw nynh amee kha ae pya cih oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Thuasalama saw na sang vae oh ze Pachia beik lei hae paw nynh a cyi hae hawte accakaepaw bya patae la ho nan oh; pawccecize minmin nynh patae a ho hae liate oun thaepah hua cih cite a tuaku hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Tukeiccuze nanning tuh minmin hawte cyihbua nan oh; pawccecize nae Paaw nynh nanning elang aho-aboupaw kha na ngia maw oh ze phe a ny vae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Tukeiccuze hynhcite sawsang oh:</para>
  <para style="q1">Vaawlang khua umpaw kaening Paaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">na min sawtuanaw um sah.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na peenaw thua ccavae sah.</para>
  <para style="q2">Vaawlang khua kya</para>
  <para style="q1">na rynaw rae athua hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi vawlan mah</para>
  <para style="q2">raebua thua sah.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nin takyh kae aepaw</para>
  <para style="q2">looh atunin oun pya.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ming hae nynh kae tungvaw</para>
  <para style="q2">a sei hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">kae ngaethya hae hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">kae seinaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">oun ngaethyabua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuhounaw lungkhu lang</para>
  <para style="q2">oun cciasah nan,</para>
  <para style="q1">ahoy leipaw kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">oun khumtua.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abang Ccathyaa hae kya tuh, ‘Peenaw kaw te lesaenaw te phu-enaw kha na kya zungzae a um; Amen,’ cite biachihpaw a um.</char></note></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nanning nynh ccungccaw hae cyiseinaw kha na ngaethya oh ze vaawlang umpaw nae Paaw nynh mah ae ngaethya cih oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.14-15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 11:25-26">Mar 11.25-26</ref></char></note> <verse number="15" style="v" />Thuasalama ccungccaw hae cyiseinaw kha na ngaethya khyh oh ze, nae Paaw nynh nae cyiseinaw kha ae ngaethya lan khyh oh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Looh-ae Sungnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Looh-ae na sung oh ze, thyaruh hae hawte a ngaethahpaw maesue te la um nan oh; pawccecize minmin tuh looh-ae a sung hae paw kha ccungccaw hae nynh oun nyh hae sah cite mih maesue te a langsaku hae. Byaccaccing kae hopya oh, minmin tuh mih ryalaw mee kha phe mue vae hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Thuasalama nanning tuh looh-ae na sung vae oh ze nae lu kha chitui thuhkuh oh lah, nae maelahkuh oh. <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuhteze tuh ming hae nynh looh-ae na sung oh paw kha ae nyh lan khyh oh; thuasalama muih kho leinaw kya a umpaw nae Paaw nynh ae nyh cih oh; te aphirute cyipaw a muihtupaw nae Paaw nynh amee kha ae pya cih oh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Vaawlang kya Sisua</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:33-34">Luk 12.33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Laehaw te chihhang nynh a ronaw hae te miruh hae nynh kiabia hae zah a runaw hae laephi vawlan nae sisua kha ccykuh nan oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 5:2-3">Jam 5.2-3</ref></char></note> <verse number="20" style="v" />Laehaw te chihhang nynh a ro leinaw hae, miruh hae nynh mah a kiabia leinaw hae te a ru leinaw hae vaawlang khua khe nae sisua kha ccykuh oh. <verse number="21" style="v" />Pawccecize nae sisua umnaw kya nae thinlung mah a umbua cih.</para>
  <para style="s1">Pyn kya-e Awnaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:33-36">Luk 11.33-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Mit tuh pyn kya-e maeekhua nynh thua; tukeiccuze na mit tuh ahoy lanze na pyn balyn tuh awnaw te phe beih cih. <verse number="23" style="v" />Thuasalama na mit ahoy khyh ze na pyn balyn tuh mohnaw te phe beih cih. Tukeiccuze nang na kya umpaw awnaw tuh mohnaw athua lanze tuh-e mohnaw tuh pawcih baban mou ale!</para>
  <para style="s1">Bawi Lu Ning Ryalawpyanaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:22-34">Luk 12.22-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Hum ccungccaw nynh sanmah bawi lu ning ryalawpah kho khyh; pawccecize bawi lu kheit kha a hua cih zah lu kheit kha a sungsah cih; tuhkhyhze lu kheit kalan a pan cih zah lu kheit kha pawlangria lan khyh. Nanning nynh Pachia rya te phuasui rya parouhte na lah kho khyh oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Tukeiccuze kae hopya oh, pawmou kae ae cih, pawmou kae neih cih cite nae hiinnaw hanlan nae lungvawsaw nan sah; paw boeining mou kae lawkuh cih cite nae pyn elang nae lungvawsaw nan sah. Hiinnaw tuh looh laeze sunghua khyh tou? Pyn tuh boeining laeze sunghua khyh tou? <verse number="26" style="v" />Vaawlang e pavaw hae khuh dotua oh! Minmin tuh ccacii vuakuh khyh hae, looh mah rue khyh hae, byng kya mah ruinkuh khyh hae; tuhzemah vaawlang umpaw nae Paaw nynh minmin kha looh a dang hae. Nanning tuh minmin laeze patae na sunghua khyh oh tou? <verse number="27" style="v" />Nanning lakuze hummou a lungvawsawnaw liate a hiinnaw ccyh kha dyntari san a saesakuh khopaw a um? <verse number="28" style="v" />Tukeiccuze pawccemou boeining elang nae lungriathae? Ramkaw e lili haetapaw ku hae kha pawcihte nynh a lethung hae cipaw tuatua oh; minmin tuh ryalah khyh hae, laaw mah sukuh khyh hae. <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuhzemah kae hopya oh, myarya a hoirumpaw Solomon nynh heize lili paw pawkheit tuhte apuithya lan ccaankuh kho khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:4-7">1Si 10.4-7</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:3-6">2Sh 9.3-6</ref></char></note> <verse number="30" style="v" />Tukeiccuze, pou zynnaw a zya hae paw nanning, atunin hiin zah awkhualan takuamaee lungkhu lang phung athuapaw ramkaw e lonua kha heize Pachia nynh tuhcite a ccaan lanze, nanning kha tuhlaeze houh ae ccaan lan khyh oh tou? <verse number="31" style="v" />Tukeiccuze, ‘Pawmou kae ae cih? Pawmou kae neih cih? Paw boeining mou kae lawkuh cih?’ cite nae lungriathae nan sah. <verse number="32" style="v" />Pawccecize hynh-e uccaw hae balyn tuh lawki hae nynh a ccung hae paw nynh thua; vaawlang umpaw nae Paaw nynh hynh-e uccaw hae balyn tuh nae hanlan aho cipaw phe a ny. <verse number="33" style="v" />Pachia peenaw te a dingnaw kha masaty ccung oh, te hynh-e uccaw hae balyn kha pyachih na thua cih oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Tukeiccuze awkhualan hanlan nae lungriathae nan sah, pawccecize awkhualan nynh amaw elang a lungriathaekuh cih. Atunin e lungriathaenaw tuh atunin hanlan phe azaw.</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Ming hae Ccaee Nan</para>
  <para style="r">(Luk 6.37-38, 41-42)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Nanning tuh byapia na thua khyh nawlan oh ming hae kha bya la pia nan oh. <verse number="2" style="v" />Pawccecize na pianaw oh paw byapianaw thyhte naemaw kha byapia na thua cih oh; na tounaw oh paw tounawpaw te naemaw kha toupya ru na thua cih oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 4:24">Mar 4.24</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />Namaw mit lungkhu umpaw thingthyh kha tuaku leite pawccemou na uno mit lungkhu umpaw athupaw taraw kha na dopya? <verse number="4" style="v" />Namaw mit kya thingthyh phang a um pite, pawtemou na unopaw kha, ‘Na mit kya-e athupaw taraw kha kae la khoipah,’ na ci ngan? <verse number="5" style="v" />Nang thyaruhpaw! Namaw mit lungkhu e thingthyh kha khoikuh ty; tukoute nynh na unopaw mit lungkhu e athupaw taraw kha khoipya khylan ccaerarih lan na muihthya cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Athyaapaw uccaw kha ui hae pya nan oh; nae kya-e palee hae kha voh hae malang sawpah nan oh, tuhte na cyi oh ze mih ccu te a sydehan cih hae, te naemaw kha ae paleihnuakuh cih oh zah ae bou cih oh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Ngia, Ccung, Khua</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:9-13">Luk 11.9-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Ngia oh lah ae pya cih oh; ccung oh lah na muih cih oh; khua oh lah thuakaw kha hungpya na thua cih oh. <verse number="8" style="v" />Pawccecize a ngiapaw miakaw tuh a mue; a ccungpaw miakaw tuh a muih; thuakaw a khuapaw miakaw tuh hungpya athua cih. <verse number="9" style="v" />Nanning lakuze nae ccaaw nynh sanlou ae ngiaku oh ze, lung na pya cih oh tou? <verse number="10" style="v" />Ngasaw ae ngiaku oh ze, hupaw na pya cih oh tou? <verse number="11" style="v" />Ccungccaw hoy leipaw mang na thua oh pite nae ccaaw hae kha lasung hoypaw pya lan na ny oh ze, vaawlang umpaw nae Paaw nynh amaw kalan a ngiakuh hae paw kha uccaw hoypaw tuh houh a pya cih hae!</para>
  <para style="s1">Sui Upadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Nae tungvaw kya cyih hae sah cite na ry oh hawte ming hae tungvaw kya la cyih oh; pawccecize hynh-e tuh kawbya ccauh te profeh hae ccauh nynh a ho hae paw nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 6:31">Luk 6.31</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Abypaw Sakoih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:22-30">Luk 13.22-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Abypaw sakoih kyate tee oh; pawccecize ronaw kalan ccianawpaw sakoih tuh ko zah laanpi tuh azoi; tuin kya a teepaw ccungccaw hae tuh patae acih hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Thuasalama hiinnaw kalan ccianawpaw sakoih tuh by zah laanpi tuh aru; tuh-e laanpi a muihkuhpaw tuh azya.</para>
  <para style="s1">Thingku te Athae</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-44">Luk 6.43-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Tuu phua bongkute nae kalan oun thua hae paw lingthya profeh hae kha la raeringkuh oh; pawccecize minmin tuh alungkhu langte tuh arepaw suizaw hae nynh thua hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Minmin kha mih cyisahnaw khate nae nyh cih oh. Ccungccaw hae nynh misu thae kha taty ku kyate a lo hae tou? Thaeku thae kha hinpaw ku kyate a lo hae tou? <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuh-e hawte thingku hoypaw nynh thingthae hoypaw kha a thae, thuasalama thingku hoy leipaw nynh tuh thingthae hoy leipaw kha nynh a thae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Thingku hoypaw nynh thingthae hoy leipaw kha thae kho khyh, thingku hoy leipaw nynh mah thingthae hoypaw kha thae kho khyh. <verse number="19" style="v" />Thingthae hoypaw a thae leipaw thingku miakaw tuh nge thua zah maee lungkhu lang phung athua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:10">Mat 3.10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:9">Luk 3.9</ref></char></note> <verse number="20" style="v" />Tukeiccuze lingthya profeh hae kha mih cyisahnaw khate nae nyh cih oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:33">Mat 12.33</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Bawipaw, Bawipaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:25-27">Luk 13.25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“ ‘Bawipaw, Bawipaw’ cite yn kopaw miakaw nynh vaawlang peenaw lungkhu lang tee lan khyh hae, thuasalama vaawlang umpaw ka Paaw rynaw a raepaw nynh a tee cih. <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuh-e nin kya ccungccaw patae nynh kae kha, ‘Bawipaw, Bawipaw, na min te profehbya kae ho khyh tou? Na min te raerangsaro kae dee khyh tou? Na min te ngaeangnaw patae kae rae khyh tou?’ cite yn hopah cih hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Te kae nynh minmin kha, ‘Nanning hynh papin kae nyh boi khyh oh, hoyleinaw a rae hae paw nanning, ka kyate cceih oh,’ ka ci cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 6:8">Sam 6.8</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Inn Sak hae paw Lu Ning</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:46-49">Luk 6.46-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Tukeiccuze humhung zemah hynh-e ka bya hynh thae zah a zuipaw tuh lungpi vawlan a inn a sakkuhpaw mihawpaw te nynh a loku. <verse number="25" style="v" />Khuaa yn rah zah tui yn le, khisan yn zaw zah tuh-e inn tuh a mung; thuasalama tuh-e inn tuh lungpi vawlan sakpaw athua keiccuze pu khyh. <verse number="26" style="v" />E ka bya hynh thae zah a zui leipaw tuh laesia vawlan a inn a sakkuhpaw mingaeepaw te nynh a loku. <verse number="27" style="v" />Khuaa yn rah zah tui yn le, te khisan yn zaw zah tuh-e inn tuh a mung, te tuh-e inn tuh phe a pu; khaleih roh lan a pu,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Jesu nynh tuh-e bya hae balyn kha he a ho koute ccungccaw zapi hae tuh a ccangpyanaw kha mih ngaeangthua,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.28-29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 1:22">Mar 1.22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:32">Luk 4.32</ref></char></note> <verse number="29" style="v" />pawccecize aning nynh kawbya sazae hae hawte thua leite kaw a hoipaw lu kheit hawte a ccangpya hae.</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Vaethyakaepaw A Dansah</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mar 1.40-45</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luk 5.12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mua kyate Jesu he a rungbung tuh myarya lungpaw ccungccaw zapi nynh amaw kha a zui hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Te vaethyakaepaw lu kheit yn thua zah amaw malang a ccukharutungte, “Bawipaw, na ry zetuh kae hynh nae thyaasah kho,” a cipya. <verse number="3" style="v" />Jesu nynh a kuih dyng zah tuh-e paw kha hae zah, “Ka ry, thyaa ccavae!” a cipya. Vaekheihmawte a vaethya ccinaw tuh phe athyaa. <verse number="4" style="v" />Tukoute Jesu nynh, “E konglang hynh humhung kya mah na ho khyh nawlan la raeringkuh; thuasalama ranpibawi kalan la cceih lah la dosakuh; te ccungccaw hae kya na dannawpaw ccaekia lang Moses kawbya thyhte silawnaw kha la rae,” a cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 14:1-32">Lev 14.1-32</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Rhawbawipaw Zynnaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:1-10">Luk 7.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jesu tuh Kapernaum khua lang he a tee tuh, rhawbawipaw lu kheit nynh amaw kalan yn thua zah, <verse number="6" style="v" />“Bawipaw, ka ryalahtupaw tuh kuihccuchite ccih zah innvaw phang a huekuh, myarya a ccih,” cite bawmnaw a ngiaku. <verse number="7" style="v" />Jesu nynh, “Kae cceih cih zah ka dansah cih,” a cipya. <verse number="8" style="v" />Rhawbawipaw nynh, “Bawipaw, nang nynh ka inn lang tee lante kae tuh ka ngaekuh khyh; bya te kyalya kawpya lah ka ryalahtupaw tuh a dan cih. <verse number="9" style="v" />Pawccecize kae mah ka luki e bawi hae kaw te a umpaw ka thua zah ka kuihkaw mah rhawkaw hae a um hae; te lu kheit kha, ‘Cceih,’ ka ci ze a cceih; ccangpaw lu kheit kha, ‘Rang,’ ka ci ze yn thua; te ka ryalahtupaw kha, ‘E hynh cyih,’ ka ci ze a cyih,” cite a hopya. <verse number="10" style="v" />Jesu nynh tuh-e bya kha he a thae tuh a ngaeangthua zah amaw a zui hae paw kha, “Byaccaccing kae hopya oh, hynhcih alepaw zynnaw tuh Israel hae kya heize ka muih boi khyh. <verse number="11" style="v" />Nanning kae hopya oh, ccungccaw patae tuh nithua langte, niccaw langte oun thua cih hae zah vaawlang peenaw kya Abraham, Isak te Jakob ryte a aekheih cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 13:29">Luk 13.29</ref></char></note> <verse number="12" style="v" />Thuasalama vaawlang peenaw rho a ccou lan hae paw paleih kha tuh atolang mohnaw lungkhu lang vua athua cih hae, tuin kya tuh rawkhuinaw te hawzynaw a um cih,” a cipya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:13">Mat 22.13</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 25:30">25.30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:28">Luk 13.28</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v" />Te Jesu nynh rhawbawipaw kha, “La cceih ccavae; na zyn thyhte cyipya thua sah,” a cipya. A ryalahtupaw tuh tuh-e ccyh ccaccei kya phe a dan.</para>
  <para style="s1">Ccungccaw Patae A Dansah hae</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mar 1.29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luk 4.38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jesu nynh Peter inn lungkhu lang he a tee tuh, Peter a zu nung tuh ccih zah a huekupaw kha a muih. <verse number="15" style="v" />Te Jesu nynh a kuih kha hae zah a ccinaw tuh phe dan; te aning nynh thokuh zah Jesu kha a do-oih vae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Zete he thua tuh ccungccaw hae nynh raerangsaro bahkuh hae paw patae kha Jesu kalan oun cciakhae hae; Jesu nynh a bya kaw kheit te ahoy leipaw muisaw hae kha dee zah ngeccih hae balyn kha a dansah hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Hynh-e hynh profeh Isaiah nynh, “Aning nynh aening vaemaw kha lah zah, aening ccinaw kha a phu,” cite a hopaw bya accing nawlan nynh thua. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.17. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:4">Isa 53.4</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu A Zui Cih hae paw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:57-62">Luk 9.57-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jesu nynh a pepan e myarya lungpaw ccungccaw zapi kha he a muih tuh khuraw lang ccia lan kaw a pya hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Te kawbya sazae lu kheit tuh amaw kalan yn thua zah, “Sazae, na ccianaw miakaw lang kae zui cih,” a cipya. <verse number="20" style="v" />Jesu nynh, “Suizaw hae nynh karung hoi hae zah vaawlang e pavaw hae nynh bu a hoi hae; thuasalama Ccungccaw Ccapaw tuh a lu nungnaw sanmah hoi khyh,” a cipya. <verse number="21" style="v" />Ccangpaw a zuitupaw nynh, “Bawipaw, masaty ka la cceih sah lah ka paaw kha ka la uh hin sah,” a cipya. <verse number="22" style="v" />Thuasalama Jesu nynh, “Kamaw yn zui, michi hae nynh mih michi hae kha la uh hae sah,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu nynh Khise A Daesah</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mar 4.35-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luk 8.22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jesu tuh kohlung lungkhu lang tee zah a zuitu hae nynh a zui hae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Rili kya myarya rupaw khise yn tho zah kohlung tuh tuileih nynh vyavya a vu, thuasalama Jesu tuh marya a ih. <verse number="25" style="v" />Te a zuitu hae nynh amaw kha ccianuate tho hae zah, “Bawipaw, kaening oun khumtua, aening ah chih vae cih oh!” a cipya hae. <verse number="26" style="v" />Jesu nynh minmin kha, “Pou zynnaw zya hae paw, pawccemou na ri oh?” a cipya hae. Tuinte thokuh zah khise te tuileih tuh daenaw kaw pya hae zah zya adae hae. <verse number="27" style="v" />Te minmin tuh mih ngaeangthua zah, “E paw hynh pawcihawpaw ccungccaw mou? Khise te tuileih nynh heize a kaw a ngae hae!” a ci hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Raerangsaro Bahkuh hae paw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mar 5.1-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luk 8.26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Jesu tuh rili khuraw lang Gadara ram he a thua te, raerangsaro bahkuh hae paw lu ning nynh shawku kyate oun pou hae zah amaw kha oun tungku hae; minmin tuh ri lan myarya um hae zah humhung nynh mah tuh-e laanpi te cceih ngan khyh hae. <verse number="29" style="v" />Te minmin nynh vaekheihmawte, “Pachia Ccapaw, nang te kaening tuh pawmou ah sekuh oh? Accyh azaw mawze kaening hynh vawsaw pya khylan tou hynhlang nae thua?” cite a sia hae. <verse number="30" style="v" />Te minmin kyate eih asaw leinaw khe rampaeekuh hae paw voh phu kheit a um. <verse number="31" style="v" />Te raerangsaro hae nynh, “Nang nynh kaening hynh nae dee ze, voh hae lungkhu lang beih oun teesah,” cite a ngiaku hae. <verse number="32" style="v" />Jesu nynh minmin kha, “Cceih oh!” a cipya hae. Tukeiccuze minmin tuh pou hae zah voh hae lungkhu lang a tee hae; voh hae tuh mih balynte apannaw lang thawmawte ccuebung hae zah rili lungkhu lang phungkuh hae zah tui kya pong a chih hae. <verse number="33" style="v" />Voh a rintu hae tuh ccue hae zah khua lungkhu lang a tee hae, te raerangsaro bahkuh hae paw kya acyihkuhpaw balyn kha a hopya hae. <verse number="34" style="v" />Khuaccaaw hae balyn nynh Jesu te tungku lan oun cceih hae zah amaw kha he a muih hae te, mih ram kyate a pou nawlan a ngia hae.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Kuihccu Chihpaw A Dansah</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mar 2.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luk 5.17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesu tuh kohlung lungkhu lang a tee koute rili khuraw lang po zua zah amaw khua lang a thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Iphae vawlan phang ihpaw a kuihccu chihpaw kha Jesu kalan oun puih hae. Jesu nynh mih zynnaw kha a muih tuh, a kuihccu chihpaw kha, “Ka ccapaw, na thawsia nan sah, na seinaw tuh ngaethya athua vae,” a cipya. <verse number="3" style="v" />Tetuh kawbya sazae hae abang nynh, “E paw hynh Pachia saryate bya a ho,” cite a hoku hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Jesu nynh mih tuanaw kha nyh zah, “Pawccemou nae thinlung kya ahoy leipaw kha na tua oh? <verse number="5" style="v" />‘Na seinaw tuh ngaethya athua vae’ cipyapaw tou azoihua? Tuhkhyhze, ‘Thokuh lah cceih,’ cipyapaw tou azoihua? <verse number="6" style="v" />Thuasalama Ccungccaw Ccapaw tuh laephi vawlan seinaw kha ngaethyanaw kaw a hoi cipaw na ny nawlan oh,” ci zah, kuihccu chihpaw kha, “Thokuh, na iphae kha lawkuh lah na inn lang cceih ccavae,” a cipya. <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuh-e paw tuh thokuh zah a inn lang a cceih vae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Ccungccaw zapi nynh tuh-e tuh he a muih hae te, mih ngaeangthua zah tuhcihawpaw kawhoinaw kha ccungccaw hae a pyatupaw Pachia kha the a hoysah hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu nynh Matthai A Ko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mar 2.13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luk 5.27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuin kyate Jesu tuh po a ccia lyakhe ngunto khoinaw zung kya a dahungpaw Matthai a ci hae paw lu kheit kha muih zah, “Kamaw yn zui,” a cipya. Te aning nynh thokuh zah Jesu kha a zui.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jesu tuh inn kya ae lan ccaboi kya a haung lyakhe ngunto khoi hae paw patae te misei hae tuh oun thua hae zah Jesu te a zuitu hae ryte a dahungkheih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.10-11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 15:1-2">Luk 15.1-2</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuh-e tuh Farasi hae nynh he a muih hae tuh, a zuitu hae kha, “Pawccemou nae sazaepaw hynh ngunto khoi hae paw te misei hae ryte a aekheih hae?” a cipya hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Jesu nynh tuh-e bya kha he a thae tuh minmin kha, “A dan hae paw nynh sibawi peki khyh hae, thuasalama a ccih hae paw nynh a peki hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />La cceih oh lah, ‘Kae tuh silawkunaw ka ry khyh, ngaethyaumsahnaw nynh ka ry,’ acikuhpaw kha na nythya nawlan oh la ccangkuh oh. Pawccecize kae tuh miding hae ko khylan kae thua khyh, misei hae ko khylan nynh kae thua,” a cipya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:7">Mat 12.7</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 6:6">Hos 6.6</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Looh-ae Sungnaw Kong Byakhianaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mar 2.18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luk 5.33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Te Johan zuitu hae nynh Jesu kalan oun thua hae zah, “Kaening te Farasi hae tuh atu te atu looh-ae kae sung zah, pawccemou nang na zuitu hae ze looh-ae a sung khyh hae?” a cipya hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Jesu nynh minmin kha, “Zudy ccangvaepaw tuh zudy poi oun too hae paw kya a umbua lungkhu tuh tuh-e ccungccaw hae tuh mih ngaethah cih zawtou? Thuasalama zudy ccangvaepaw kha minmin kyate lawpya ccyh yn thua cih; tetuh minmin tuh looh-ae oun sung vae cih hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Humhung nynh mah arynpaw boeining kha athawpaw boeibia te bia boi khyh, tuhte a bia lanze bianawpaw nynh arynpaw boeining kha po lah zah houh aseiikuh paleih vae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Humhung nynh mah athawpaw misutui kha arynpaw misutui-saphuabawng lungkhu lang ruin boi khyh, tuhte a ruin lanze misutui-saphuabawng tuh apaw cih zah misutui tuh azu cih, te misutui-saphuabawng mah aroh cih; thuasalama athawpaw misutui tuh athawpaw misutui-saphuabawng lungkhu lang nynh a ruin hae, tuhteze tuh parouh akhyn hae,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu Boeirae A Haenung</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mar 5.21-43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luk 8.40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuh-e bya tuh Jesu nynh a hopya cciamang lya hae khe, sinakok piccan lu kheit nynh yn thua zah Jesu malang bakhung zah, “Ka ccanung tuh atumaw khe nynh a chi, thuasalama nang nynh yn cceih lah a tungvaw khe na kuih na khang ze aning tuh a hiin cih,” a cipya. <verse number="19" style="v" />Jesu nynh thokuh zah tuh-e paw tuh a zui, a zuitu hae mah a zuikuh bua hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuh lyatuin kum haw lae ning cia chiilua ccinaw a hoipaw nopinung lu kheit tuh Jesu nulang yn thua zah a boeirae kha a hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Pawccecize a boei sankaw ka hae ze phe ka dan cih cite a lungkaw te a tuaku. <verse number="22" style="v" />Thuasalama Jesu nynh maeleihkuh zah tuh-e nung kha he a muih tuh, “Ka ccanung, na thawsia nan sah, na zynnaw nynh ae dansah vae,” a cipya. Tuin ccyh kyate nopinung tuh a dan vae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Jesu tuh uktupaw inn lang he a thua te, tyngdaw khua hae paw te a sia a rua hae paw ccungccaw hae kha muih zah, <verse number="24" style="v" />“Toiku tua hin oh, pawccecize imuanung tuh chih khyh, a ihpaw nynh thua,” cite a hopya hae. Te minmin nynh a nuinse hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Thuasalama ccungccaw hae he a pou hae te, Jesu nynh tee zah tuh-e nung kha a kuih te tho zah imuanung tuh po a tho vae. <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuh-e thongpang tuh tuh-e ram lungkhu balyn po azeihkuh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Mitmoh Lu ning Ngawmuih hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuin kyate Jesu tuh pou zah a ccia lyakhe mitmoh hae paw lu ning nynh zui hae zah, “David Ccapaw, kaening hynh ngaethya beih oun umsah!” cite a sia hae. <verse number="28" style="v" />Jesu tuh innthung lang he a thua te, mitmoh hae tuh amaw kalan oun thua hae; Jesu nynh minmin kha, “E hynh a cyih kho cih cite nae zyn oh tou?” a cipya hae. Minmin nynh, “Kae zyn, Bawipaw,” a ci hae. <verse number="29" style="v" />Tetuh Jesu nynh mih mit kha hae zah, “Nae zynnaw thyhte nae tungvaw cyihkuh sah,” a cipya hae. <verse number="30" style="v" />Te mih mit hae tuh oun aw vae; Jesu nynh, “E hynh humhung mah la nysah nan oh,” cite tynkaring lan bya a tawsya hae. <verse number="31" style="v" />Thuasalama minmin nynh he a pou hae te, amaw konglang thongpang kha tuh-e ram balyn kya a zeihsaku hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Byaho Kho leipaw Byaho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Minmin he a pou hae te, raerangsaro bahkuhpaw byaho kho leipaw lu kheit kha Jesu kalan oun thuakhae hae. <verse number="33" style="v" />Raerangsaro kha he a deepah koute, byaho kho leipaw tuh bya yn ho vae; te ccungccaw zapi tuh mih ngaeangthua zah, “E tahawpaw hynh Israel ram kya muihkuh boi khyh,” a ci hae. <verse number="34" style="v" />Thuasalama Farasi hae nynh, “Raerangsaro hae uktupaw liate nynh raerangsaro hae kha a dee hae,” cite a ho hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:25">Mat 10.25</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 12:24">12.24</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:22">Mar 3.22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:15">Luk 11.15</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Ryalahtu Azya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Jesu tuh khuapi hae te khua taraw hae balyn kalan khua po ccong zah, mih sinakok hae kyakhe a ccangpya hae, peenaw thehoypaw kha hopah hae zah mih ccinaw miakaw te ccihawnaw miakaw kha a dansah hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:23">Mat 4.23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:39">Mar 1.39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:44">Luk 4.44</ref></char></note> <verse number="36" style="v" />Jesu nynh ccungccaw zapi kha he a muih hae tuh, ngaethya a umsah hae, pawccecize minmin tuh tuurintu a um leipaw tuu hae hawte lungriathaete um hae zah bawmtu hoi khyh hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:17">Nam 27.17</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 22:17">1Si 22.17</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 18:16">2Sh 18.16</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:5">Eze 34.5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:34">Mar 6.34</ref></char></note> <verse number="37" style="v" />Tukeiccuze a zuitu hae kha, “Loohrue lanpaw tuh myarya alung, thuasalama ryalahtu hae tuh azya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.37-38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:2">Luk 10.2</ref></char></note> <verse number="38" style="v" />Tukeiccuze loohrue lanpaw a hoitu Bawipaw nynh a loohruenaw kalan ryalahtu hae yn saw nawlan sawsang oh,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Locceihtu Lu Haw Lae Ning A Po</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mar 3.13-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luk 6.12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesu nynh a zuitu hae lu haw lae ning kha amaw kalan ko hae zah athyaa leipaw muisaw hae dee khonaw te ccinaw aphuinphuin te ccihawnaw miakaw dansah khonaw kaw a pya hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Locceihtu hae lu haw lae ning min tuh: masaty, Peter cite a ko hae paw Simon, te a neitaw Andru, Zebedi ccapaw James, te a neitaw Johan; <verse number="3" style="v" />Filip te Bartholomew; Thomas te ngunto khoipaw Matthai; Alfeas ccapaw James te Taddias; <verse number="4" style="v" />Kanaan khuapaw Simon, te Jesu a pheetupaw Judas Iskariot nynh thua hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Locceihtu Lu haw Lae Ning A Saw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mar 6.7-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luk 9.1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />E lu haw lae ning hynh Jesu nynh saw hae zah hynhte kaw a pya hae: “Zenta hae ram lang la cceih nan oh, Samaria hae khua lang mah la tee nan oh. <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel minphuin kyaze azopaw tuu hae kalan palia la cceih oh. <verse number="7" style="v" />Na ccia vae oh ze, ‘Vaawlang peenaw tuh anae vae,’ cite thehoypaw kha la siakhae oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.7-15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:4-12">Luk 10.4-12</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v" />Ngeccih hae kha la dansah oh, a chih hae paw kha la thoosah oh, vaethyakae hae paw kha la thyaasah oh, raerangsaro hae kha la dee oh. Nanning tuh amee pya leite na mue oh zah, amee lawku leite la pya oh. <verse number="9" style="v" />Nae phuabu kya sui, ngun te sohinphua kha la sangkuh nan oh. <verse number="10" style="v" />Khuaccong nawlan sohrae, angki zung ning, phanah hae te hoitang hae mah phukuh nan oh; pawccecize ryalahtupaw tuh looh dang lan accan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:14">1Ko 9.14</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 5:18">1Ti 5.18</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v" />Khuapi lang thuasah, khua taraw lang thuasah na tee vae oh ze, tuin khua kya angaekuhpaw innccong kha la khia oh lah tuin khua kyate na pou mawlaezung oh tuin kya la um oh. <verse number="12" style="v" />Inn lungkhu lang na tee vae oh ze, ‘Nae kya daenaw um sah,’ cite la beih oh. <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuh-e inn tuh angaeku ze nae kya-e daenaw tuh tuh-e innbyn hae kya la um sah; thuasalama angaeku khyh ze, nae kya-e daenaw tuh naemaw kalan la ki sah. <verse number="14" style="v" />Te humhung zemah nanning kha innccong ae doih oh zah nae bya kha mah a ngae khyh ze, tuh-e inn, tuhkhyhze tuh-e khuapi kyate he na pou oh te, nae ccu kya-e vuiping kha la khuanua sya oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:51">Loc 13.51</ref></char></note> <verse number="15" style="v" />Byaccaccing kae hopya oh, byapia nin kya tuh-e khuapi hanlan laeze Sodom te Gomorrah khua hanlan ngaesang kho a umhua cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:24">Mat 11.24</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 19:24-28">Gen 19.24-28</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Tuaasahkunaw A um cih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:9-13">Mar 13.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:12-17">Luk 21.12-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Ngaetua oh! Suizaw hae laku tuu hae saw hawte nanning kha kae saw oh, tukeiccuze hupaw hawte nae lunghaw sah lah vahu hawte nae lungne sah.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:3">Luk 10.3</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v" />Ccungccaw hae kha la raeringkuh oh; pawccecize minmin nynh zung lang ae ap cih oh zah mih sinakok hae kya ae bua cih oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.17-20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 13:9-11">Mar 13.9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:11-12">Luk 12.11-12</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 21:12-15">21.12-15</ref></char></note> <verse number="18" style="v" />Kae ka keiccuze ram uktu hae te siapharan hae malang ae thuakhae cih oh zah, minmin te Zenta hae kya ccaekia lang na tang cih oh. <verse number="19" style="v" />Minmin nynh he ae ap vae oh ze, pawmou ka ho cih, pawtemou ka ho cih cipaw nae lungvawsaw nan sah; pawccecize tuh-e ccyh kya na ho lan oh paw kha pya na thua cih oh. <verse number="20" style="v" />Pawccecize a ho cih paw tuh naemaw thua khyh, nae Paaw Muisaw nynh nanning kyate a ho cih. <verse number="21" style="v" />Uno nynh a uno toulou kha chinaw kalan yn ap cih, paaw nynh a ccaaw kha yn ap cih; ccaaw hae nynh nungpaaw hae kha oun rawse cih hae zah minmin kha oun chisah cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 13:12">Mar 13.12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:16">Luk 21.16</ref></char></note> <verse number="22" style="v" />Kae ka min keiccuze ccungccaw balyn nynh nanning kha ae hua cih oh. Thuasalama athangnaw cia a tynpaw tuh khum athua cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:9">Mat 24.9</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 24:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:13">Mar 13.13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:17">Luk 21.17</ref></char></note> <verse number="23" style="v" />Khua khuakheit kya ae tuaa ae sah oh ze, khua ccanglang la ccue oh; pawccecize byaccaccing kae hopya oh, Ccungccaw Ccapaw yn thua maw nanning nynh Israel khua miakaw kalan na cceih kou lan khyh oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Siaimua tuh a sazae laeze thyahua khyh, see mah a bawipaw luki um khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 6:40">Luk 6.40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:16">Joh 13.16</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 15:20">15.20</ref></char></note> <verse number="25" style="v" />Siaimua nynh a sazae hawte athua ze azaw vae, see mah a bawipaw hawte athua ze azaw vae. Minmin nynh inn hoitu kha Beelzebul cite a ko hae ze a innbyn hae thathy tuh athah huapaw min te khaw a ko vae cih hae!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:34">Mat 9.34</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 12:24">12.24</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:22">Mar 3.22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:15">Luk 11.15</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Hummou Ri lan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:2-7">Luk 12.2-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Tukeiccuze minmin kha la rih nan oh; pawccecize alangkuh lei lante thuruhpaw miakaw kha langsah athua cih zah, khongpaw miakaw kha hungpya athua cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 4:22">Mar 4.22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:17">Luk 8.17</ref></char></note> <verse number="27" style="v" />Mohnaw kya kae hopya oh paw kha awnaw kya la ho oh; nae nakaring kya zya na thae oh paw kha innccukaly kyate la ho oh. <verse number="28" style="v" />Pyn tuh theih kho salamah muisaw a theih kho lei hae paw kha la rih nan oh; muisaw te pyn kha parouhte hell kya a roh khopaw raw kha la rih oh. <verse number="29" style="v" />Rithya sa ning kha phuapia pia kheit lang zua khyh hae tou? Tuh-e rithya sa kheit sanmah nae Paaw kaw leite laekhu lang ccah lan khyh. <verse number="30" style="v" />Nae lu kya-e nae sangrua kha heize marya ria athua. <verse number="31" style="v" />Tukeiccuze rih nan oh, nanning tuh rithya patae laeze nae phutehua.</para>
  <para style="s1">Khri Pankhaenaw te Vuanaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:8-12">Luk 12.8-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“Humhung zemah ccungccaw hae malang kae kha ccaekia yn khan zetuh tuh-e paw kha vaawlang umpaw ka Paaw malang ccaekia ka khanru cih. <verse number="33" style="v" />Thuasalama humhung zemah ccungccaw hae malang kamaw kha yn vuapaw tuh vaawlang umpaw ka Paaw malang kae nynh mah ka vuaru cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 2:12">2Ti 2.12</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Daenaw Thua Khyh, Thaloi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:51-53">Luk 12.51-53</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 14:26-27">14.26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Laephi vawlan daenaw thuakhae khylan nynh yn thua cite tua nan oh, daenaw thuakhae khylan kae thua khyh, thaloi saw khylan nynh kae thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ccapaw nynh a paaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">ccanung nynh a nung,</para>
  <para style="q1">monung nynh a ninnung kha</para>
  <para style="q2">rawsesah khylan nynh kae thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.35-36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 7:6">Mik 7.6</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Amaw a rhaw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">amaw a innbyn hae toulou kha</para>
  <para style="q1">yn thua cih.</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Humhung zemah kae laeze a paaw khyhze a nung a sungsah huapaw tuh kae te ngaekuh khyh; humhung zemah kae laeze a ccapaw khyhze a ccanung a sungsah huapaw tuh kae te ngaekuh khyh. <verse number="38" style="v" />Humhung zemah amaw a vaelantung kha puihku leite kae yn zuipaw tuh kae te ngaekuh khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:24">Mat 16.24</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:34">Mar 8.34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:23">Luk 9.23</ref></char></note> <verse number="39" style="v" />A hiinnaw a muihkuhpaw ccungccaw tuh hiinnaw kha a shung cih, kae ka keiccuze a hiinnaw a shungpaw tuh hiinnaw kha a muihkuh cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:25">Mat 16.25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:35">Mar 8.35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:24">Luk 9.24</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 17:33">17.33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Joh 12.25</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Zuitu Do-oihnaw Mee Lasung</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:41">Mar 9.41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />“Humhung zemah nanning leh ae khan oh paw tuh kae kha leh yn khanpaw nynh thua, te humhung zemah kae kha leh yn khanpaw tuh kae yn sawtupaw kha leh a khanpaw nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 9:37">Mar 9.37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:48">Luk 9.48</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 10:16">10.16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:20">Joh 13.20</ref></char></note> <verse number="41" style="v" />Humhung zemah profeh lu kheit kha profeh athua keiccuze leh a khanpaw tuh profeh kya-e lasung kha a mue cih, te humhung zemah miding lu kheit kha miding athua keiccuze leh a khanpaw tuh midingpaw kya-e lasung kha a mue cih, <verse number="42" style="v" />byaccaccing kae hopya oh, humhung zemah hynh-e hae kyaze adih huapaw kha ka zuitu athua keiccuze tuikyaa banang nang kheit a pyapaw tuh a ryalaw mee shung lan khyh,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Johan nynh Jesu A Khiasah hae</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:18-35">Luk 7.18-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesu nynh a zuitu hae lu haw lae ning kha phe thang lan a hopah kou hae te, tuin pepan e khua hae kya ccangpya khylan te phungho khylan tuin kyate a cceih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Johan nynh thonginn kyate Khri a ryalawnaw kong kha he a thae te, a zuitu hae kha saw hae zah, <verse number="3" style="v" />Jesu kha, “Nang hynh yn thua cih paw tuh na thua tou? Tuhkhyhze mingccangpaw tou kae ngaw ung cih?” cite bya a khiasah hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Jesu nynh minmin kha, “La cceih oh lah na muih oh paw te na thae oh paw kha Johan la hopah oh. <verse number="5" style="v" />Mitmoh hae nynh ngawmuih hae zah ccukhou hae nynh a cceih kho vae hae, vaethyakae hae paw a dan hae, nawpan hae nynh nawthae hae zah michi hae tuh thoosah athua hae, ryachi hae kalan thehoypaw tuh hopya athua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 35:5-6">Isa 35.5-6</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 61:1">61.1</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />Kae ka keiccuze a lungroh leipaw ccungccaw tuh lungtuapaw nynh thua,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Te minmin he a cceih hae te, Jesu nynh Johan konglang kha ccungccaw zapi kya a hopya hae paw tuh: “Nanning nynh paw do khylan mou ramkaw lang na ccia oh? Khisan nynh a hepaw phaeku do khylan tou? <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuhkhyhze paw do khylan mou na ccia oh? Boeining hoypaw a lawkuh hae paw kha do khylan tou? Dotua oh, boeining hoypaw a lawkuh hae paw tuh siapharan inn kya nynh leih a um hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuhkhyhze paw do khylan mou na ccia oh? Profehpaw do khylan tou? Athua, kae hopya oh, profeh lu kheit lae heize alesae huapaw nynh thua. <verse number="10" style="v" />Pawccecize Ccathyaa kya,</para>
  <para style="q1">‘Dotua, na malang khe</para>
  <para style="q2">na laanpi a paccyn cih paw</para>
  <para style="q1">ka zeccuetu kha</para>
  <para style="q2">na malang ka saw cih,’</para>
  <para style="m">cite azeikuhpaw kha hynh-e paw kong nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3.1</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v" />Byaccaccing kae hopya oh, nopi hae kyate a puipaw ccungccaw hae kyaze Baptisma pyatu Johan laeze alesae huapaw lu kheit san langkuh loh khyh; thuasalama vaawlang peenaw kya adih huapaw ccungccaw tuh aning laeze a lesaehua. <verse number="12" style="v" />Baptisma pyatu Johan ccyh kyate tho zah atu cia vaawlang peenaw tuh doukunaw teing zah a doutu hae nynh nangsete a lawkude hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.12-13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 16:16">Luk 16.16</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v" />Pawccecize kawbya ccauh te profeh ccauh hae balyn nynh Johan ccyh kyacia profehbya a ho hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuh-e bya tuh na zyn ry oh ze, Johan tuh yn thua cih paw Elijah nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 4:5">Mal 4.5</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 17:10-13">Mat 17.10-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:11-13">Mar 9.11-13</ref></char></note> <verse number="15" style="v" />Thaenaw nakaring a hoipaw tuh thae sah!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Atu she e ccungccaw hae hynh pawtemou ka touse cih hae? Kungkunaw hae kya haung hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />‘Kaening nynh phyly</para>
  <para style="q2">kae tupah oh zah na law khyh oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">michi hlaw</para>
  <para style="q2">kae sahpah oh zahmah</para>
  <para style="q1">na rah lae khyh oh rei,’</para>
  <para style="m">cite a hokuh hae paw imua hae te nynh aloku hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Pawccecize Johan tuh ae lei nia leite yn thua zah minmin nynh, ‘Aning tuh raerangsaro bahkuhpaw nynh thua,’ a ci hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Ccungccaw Ccapaw tuh aete niate yn thua zah minmin nynh, ‘Dotua oh, aemohpaw te misuripaw khuh! Ngunto khoi hae paw te misei hae banpaw khuh!’ a ci hae. Thuasalama hawnaw tuh ahme cipaw kha a cyisahnaw nynh a langsah,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="s1">Zynnaw Hoi leipaw Khua hae</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:13-15">Luk 10.13-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jesu nynh ngaeangnaw alunghua a raenaw khua hae nynh a ngaesiku khyh hae keiccuze hynhte a pe hae: <verse number="21" style="v" />“Khorazin khua, nang na hanlan ngaethya lan kou um! Bethsaida khua, nang na hanlan ngaethya lan kou um! Pawccecize nanning kya rae athuapaw ngaeangnaw hae kha Tair khua te Sidon khua kyakhe rae a la thua ze, minmin tuh buri boeining lawkute buhhaw kya a toukuh cih hae zah khawlya mawte a ngaesikuh vae cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 23:1-18">Isa 23.1-18</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 26:1-28:26">Eze 26.1—28.26</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:4-8">Joe 3.4-8</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:9-10">Amo 1.9-10</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:2-4">Zek 9.2-4</ref></char></note> <verse number="22" style="v" />Tukeiccuze kae hopya oh, byapianaw nin kya nanning hanlan laeze Tair te Sidon hanlan ngaesang kho a umhua cih. <verse number="23" style="v" />Kapernaum khua,</para>
  <para style="q1">nang tuh vaawlang cia</para>
  <para style="q2">hangku na ry tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">Hell kalan sawbung na thua cih.</para>
  <para style="m">Pawccecize nang na kya rae athuapaw ngaeangnaw hae kha Sodom khua kya rae a la thua ze, atunin cia atyn ung cih paw.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:13-15">Isa 14.13-15</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 19:24-28">Gen 19.24-28</ref></char></note> <verse number="24" style="v" />Tukeiccuze nang kae hopya, byapianaw nin kya nang na hanlan laeze Sodom khua hanlan ngaesang kho a umhua cih,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:15">Mat 10.15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:12">Luk 10.12</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuh ccyh lyakhe Jesu nynh tho zah, “Vaaw te laephi Bawipaw, pou Apang, na kalan lungtuabya ka ho; pawccecize e uccaw hae hynh a haw hae paw te a thya hae paw kyate na thuruh zah nosi hae kha na phypya hae. <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuhmawte nynh athua Apang, pawccecize tuh-e tuh na rynaw nynh thua. <verse number="27" style="v" />Ka Paaw nynh pawpaw balyn kha marya yn ap vae; Paaw laelan hum nynh sanmah Ccapaw kha nyh khyh; Ccapaw te Ccapaw nynh amaw kong phy lan a popaw ccungccaw laelan hum nynh sanmah Paaw kha nyh khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:35">Joh 3.35</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 1:18">1.18</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 10:15">10.15</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Riathae hae paw te phupaw ri hae paw balyn ka kalan rang oh lah haeungnaw kae pya cih oh. <verse number="29" style="v" />Ka nanrui hynh lawkuh oh lah vawkuh oh; kamaw hynh yn ccangkuh oh; pawccecize kae tuh a lungnepaw te zakawsangsakunaw thinlung a hoipaw nynh ka thua; nae thinlung kya daenaw na mue cih oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 6:16">Jer 6.16</ref></char></note> <verse number="30" style="v" />Pawccecize ka nanrui tuh nawre um zah ka phupaw tuh azaw,” a ci.</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Sabbath Bawipaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mar 2.23-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luk 6.1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuh ccyh lyakhe Jesu tuh sabbath nin kya loo lungkhu po a cceih; a zuitu hae tuh mih vuelaw zah looh avui kha zukuh hae zah a ae hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 23:25">Deu 23.25</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuh-e tuh Farasi hae nynh he a muih hae tuh Jesu kha, “Dotua, sabbath nin kya kawbya nynh cyi lan a ua leipaw kha na zuitu hae nynh a cyi hae,” a cipya hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Jesu nynh minmin kha, “David te a umkheih hae paw nynh mih vuelaw lyaze David nynh pawmou a cyi cipaw kha na ria boi khyh oh tou?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.3-4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 21:1-6">1Sa 21.1-6</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v" />Pachia inn lungkhu lang tee zah kawbya nynh ranpibawi hae kyalya ae lan ua zah amaw thuasah, amaw te a umkheih hae paw thuasah ae lan a ua leipaw Nungpyapaw sanlou kha a ae hae cipaw na ria boi khyh oh tou?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:9">Lev 24.9</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuhpiaze ranpibawi hae nynh sabbath nin kya Beikinn lungkhu khe sabbath phung kha a lawe hae zemah seibe thua khyh hae cipaw kha kawbya kya na ria boi khyh oh tou?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 28:9-10">Nam 28.9-10</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />Byaccaccing kae hopya oh, Beikinn laeze alesae huapaw tuh hein kya a um. <verse number="7" style="v" />‘Silawkunaw tuh ka ry khyh, ngaethyaumsahnaw nynh ka ry,’ acikuhpaw asuilan kha na ny oh ze, seibe lan accan leipaw kha sei na be cih lei oh paw.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:13">Mat 9.13</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 6:6">Hos 6.6</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v" />Pawccecize Ccungccaw Ccapaw tuh sabbath Bawipaw nynh thua,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">A Kuih Chihpaw Ccungccapaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mar 3.1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luk 6.6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jesu nynh tuh-e hmin tuh cciataw zah mih sinakok lungkhu lang a tee. <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuin kyakhe a kuih voihawlang achihpaw ccungccapaw lu kheit a la um. Minmin nynh Jesu kha a seinaw kae kyngpya ccaw cite, “Sabbath nin kya dansah lan kawbya nynh a ua tou?” cite a khia hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Jesu nynh minmin kha, “Nanning lakuze lukhakheit nynh tuu sa kheit hoi zah, sabbath nin kya hunghua lungkhu lang a ccaw ze tuh-e tuu tuh thuaa leite na um cih oh tou? <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuu laeze ccungccaw tuh pawcihmou houh aphutehua! Tukeiccuze sabbath nin kya hoynaw rae tuh kawbya nynh a uapaw nynh thua,” a cipya hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Te Jesu nynh ccungccapaw kha, “Na kuih dyngtua,” a cipya. Aning nynh a kuih kha dyng zah voihawlang kuih hawte a dan vae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Tetuh Farasi hae tuh cceih hae zah Jesu kha pawtemou chia lan cipaw khua a khanku hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Pachia Popaw Ryalahtu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:7-12">Mar 3.7-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jesu nynh tuh-e mih khuakhannaw kha he a nyh tuh tuin kyate a cceih. Te ccungccaw zapi nynh amaw kha zui hae zah minmin balyn kha a dansah hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Te amaw kong kha ming hae na nysah lan khyh oh cite kaw a pyasya hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Hynhte a cyipaw hynh profeh Isaiah nynh a hosyapaw bya accing nawlan nynh thua. A hopaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Ka pokupaw ka ryalahtu tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">hein kya mang um!</para>
  <para style="q1">Ka sungsah zah a tungvaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ka lungryccing.</para>
  <para style="q1">A tungvaw khe</para>
  <para style="q2">ka Muisaw ka nung cih zah</para>
  <para style="q1">aning nynh Zenta hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">byading kong a hopah cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.18-21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 42:1-4">Isa 42.1-4</ref> (LXX)</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aning nynh ei lan khyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">sia mah sia lan khyh,</para>
  <para style="q1">hum ccungccaw nynh sanmah</para>
  <para style="q2">laanpi kya a roi thae lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Byading kha taenaw kalan</para>
  <para style="q2">a thuakhae makhia aning nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">a vaemaw umpaw phaeku kha</para>
  <para style="q2">khya lan khyh zah</para>
  <para style="q1">vyavya chihpaw maeekhua kha</para>
  <para style="q2">the lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amaw min kha</para>
  <para style="q2">Zenta hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">a doliakuh cih hae,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu te Beelzebul</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:20-30">Mar 3.20-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luk 11.14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Te raerangsaro a bahku keiccuze a mitmoh zah bya a ho kho leipaw lu kheit kha Jesu kalan oun thuakhae hae zah a dansah. Tetuh bya a ho kho leipaw tuh byaho zah ngaw a muih vae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Ccungccaw zapi balyn tuh mih ngaeangthua zah, “E paw hynh David Ccapaw thua vema?” a ci hae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Thuasalama Farasi hae nynh he a thae hae tuh, “E paw nynh raerangsaro hae a dee khopaw hynh raerangsaro hae bawipaw Beelzebul liate nynh thua,” a ci hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:34">Mat 9.34</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 10:25">10.25</ref></char></note> <verse number="25" style="v" />Jesu nynh mih tuanaw kha nyh zah minmin kha, “Amaw te amaw kha rawsekuh zah aphiakuhpaw peenaw miakaw tuh aroh cih; te amaw te amaw kha rawsekuh zah aphiakuhpaw khuapi thuasah, innbyn thuasah tyn kho lan khyh. <verse number="26" style="v" />Satan nynh Satan kha a dee lanze, aning tuh amaw te amaw a rawsekuhpaw te a phiakuhpaw nynh thua; pawtemou a peenaw tuh atyn kho cih? <verse number="27" style="v" />Kae nynh Beelzebul liate raerangsaro hae kha ka dee ze, nae ccungccaw hae nynh hum liate mou minmin kha a dee hae? Tukeiccuze minmin tuh nanning bya ae piatu oh athua cih hae. <verse number="28" style="v" />Thuasalama kae nynh Pachia Muisaw liate raerangsaro hae kha ka dee ze, Pachia peenaw tuh nae kya a thua ccaccing vae. <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuhkhyhze ccungccaw lu kheit nynh a thawsaepaw lu kheit kha a khiide ty leite, pawcihtemou tuh-e paw inn lungkhu lang a tee kho cih zah a uccaw hae kha a lua kho cih? A khiide ty ze nynh a inn kha a lua kho cih. <verse number="30" style="v" />Humhung zemah ka kalan a pan leipaw tuh kae yn rawsepaw nynh thua; ka kalan a sueluakuh bua leipaw tuh a phiakuhpaw nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 9:40">Mar 9.40</ref></char></note> <verse number="31" style="v" />Tukeiccuze kae hopya oh, seinaw miakaw te Pachia saryapaw bya hanlan ccungccaw hae tuh ngaethya athua cih hae; thuasalama Thyaa Muisaw saryapaw bya a hopaw ccungccaw hae tuh ngaethya thua lan khyh hae. <verse number="32" style="v" />Ccungccaw Ccapaw kha rawsete bya a hopaw miakaw tuh ngaethya athua cih, thuasalama Thyaa Muisaw kha rawsete bya a hopaw tuh, atu she kya mah, malang she kya mah ngaethya thua lan khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:10">Luk 12.10</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“Thingku kha ahoy lan rae lah athae ahoy cih, tuhkhyhze ahoy lei lan rae lah athae hoy lan khyh, pawccecize thingku tuh athae liate ny athua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:20">Mat 7.20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:44">Luk 6.44</ref></char></note> <verse number="34" style="v" />Pou huparepaw ciihan hae! Nanning tuh na hoy lei oh pite ahoypaw uccaw hae kong kha pawtemou na ho kho cih oh? Pawccecize thinlung kya phe beihpaw kha nynh munglae nynh leih a ho.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:7">Mat 3.7</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 23:33">23.33</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 15:18">15.18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:7">Luk 3.7</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 6:45">6.45</ref></char></note> <verse number="35" style="v" />Ccungccaw hoypaw nynh thinlung kya-e ahoypaw sisua bawng kya-e ahoypaw uccaw hae kha yn poukhae; te ahoy leipaw ccungccaw nynh ahoy leipaw sisua bawng kya-e ahoy leipaw uccaw hae kha yn poukhae. <verse number="36" style="v" />Nanning kae hopya oh, raeringku leite bya na ho oh paw miakaw hanlan byapianaw nin kya paw keiccu nynh khahte ka ho cipaw na langsakuh cih. <verse number="37" style="v" />Pawccecize na bya liate thyaaccousah na thua cih zah na bya liate seibe na thua cih,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jonah Muihsahnaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:29-32">Luk 11.29-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Te kawbya sazae hae abang te Farasi hae nynh khung hae zah, “Bawipaw, na raepaw muihsahnaw ccangkheit kae muihtua ry,” a cipya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:1">Mat 16.1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:11">Mar 8.11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:16">Luk 11.16</ref></char></note> <verse number="39" style="v" />Thuasalama Jesu nynh minmin kha, “Ahoy leipaw te a ohhuakuhpaw ciihan nynh tuh muihsahnaw kha leih a ngia, thuasalama profeh Jonah kya-e muihsahnaw laelan ccangpaw muihsahnaw kha langsahpya thua vae lan khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:4">Mat 16.4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:12">Mar 8.12</ref></char></note> <verse number="40" style="v" />Pawccecize Jonah tuh nin thum te zi thum ngasawpi vue lungkhu a um hawte, Ccungccaw Ccapaw mah nin thum te zi thum laephi lungkhu a um cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JON 1:17">Jon 1.17</ref></char></note> <verse number="41" style="v" />Nineveh khuaccaaw hae tuh e she kya-e ccungccaw hae ryte byapianaw kya oun thadyn cih hae zah, e she kya-e ccungccaw hae kha oun seisah cih hae, pawccecize minmin tuh Jonah phunghonaw kya a ngaesikuh hae, te dotua, Jonah laeze alesae huapaw tuh hein kya mang um!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.41: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JON 3:5">Jon 3.5</ref></char></note> <verse number="42" style="v" />Byapianaw kya Alia lang e siapharannung tuh e she kya-e ccungccaw hae ryte yn thadyn cih zah minmin kha yn seisah cih hae, pawccecize aning tuh laephi athangnaw langte Solomon hawnaw bya kha thae khylan yn thua; te dotua, Solomon laeze alesae huapaw tuh hein kya mang um!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.42: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:1-10">1Si 10.1-10</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:1-12">2Sh 9.1-12</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Athyaa leipaw Muisaw Kithuinaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:24-26">Luk 11.24-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />“Athyaa leipaw muisaw nynh ccungccapaw kyate he a pou te, umnaw hmin zahku lan ramrou kalan a khiakuh, thuasalama muihkuh khyh. <verse number="44" style="v" />Tetuh aning nynh, ‘Ka poutawnaw ka inn lang ka ki cih,’ ci zah, he a kithui tuh tuh-e inn tuh phe la phikuh zah ccynmamyh lan a ccawnghanpaw kha a muih. <verse number="45" style="v" />Tetuh aning nynh cceih zah amaw laeze houh athahhua hae paw ccangpaw muisaw lu sari kha a hoeibua hae, te minmin nynh tee hae zah tuh-e paw kya a um hae; te tuh-e ccungccapaw tuh nyalang e a cyisahnaw tuh langmaw a cyisahnaw laeze houh athahhua vae. E ahoy leipaw ciihan kya mah tuh-e hawte yn cyihkuh bua cih,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu Vaeccaw hae Ccaccing</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mar 3.31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luk 8.19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Jesu nynh ccungccaw zapi kya bya a ho cciamang lyakhe a nung te a neitawpaw hae tuh amaw kha bya hopya lan ry hae zah atolang khe a thadyn hae. <verse number="47" style="v" />Te ccungccaw lu kheit nynh amaw kha, “Dotua, na nung te na neitawpaw hae tuh nang kha bya hopya lan ae ry hae zah atolang phang thadyn hae,” a cipya. <verse number="48" style="v" />Thuasalama Jesu nynh tuh-e bya a hopahpaw kha, “Ka nung tuh hummou? Ka neitawpaw hae tuh hum hae mou?” cite a khung. <verse number="49" style="v" />Te a zuitu hae kha khii hae zah, “E hae hynh ka nung te ka neitawpaw hae nynh thua hae! <verse number="50" style="v" />Pawccecize vaawlang umpaw ka Paaw rynaw a cyihpaw miakaw tuh ka neitawpaw, ka ccianung te ka nung nynh athua hae,” a ci.</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Ccacii Vuatu Tousenaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mar 4.1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luk 8.4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuin nin kyakhe Jesu tuh inn kyate pou zah rili kin khe a haung. <verse number="2" style="v" />Myarya lungpaw ccungccaw zapi nynh amaw kalan oun sueluakuh hae keiccuze Jesu tuh kohlung lungkhu lang tee zah a haung; te ccungccaw zapi balyn tuh varang langkhe a thadyn hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 5:1-3">Luk 5.1-3</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />Te Jesu nynh minmin kha tousenaw phungpaw hae te bya patae a hopya hae. A hopaw tuh: “Ngaetua oh! Ccacii vuatu lu kheit tuh ccacii vua lan a cceih. <verse number="4" style="v" />Ccacii kha vua zah, ccacii abang tuh laanpi pe khe ccah zah pavaw hae nynh oun thuanua hae zah karyh a tuh hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Abang tuh laephi zya zah lungpyng alungnaw kya accah; laephi thaawkalae a ci khyh keiccuze taloi a po hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Thuasalama khuanin he yn thua tuh, tharui a saw khyh keiccuze karae arou hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Abang ccacii tuh hinpaw laku ccah zah hinpaw nynh lethin zah phang a lungde. <verse number="8" style="v" />Thuasalama ccangpaw ccacii hae tuh lae hoy kya ccah hae zah abang tuh leit za kheit, abang tuh leit sung taruh, abang tuh leit sung thum avoi. <verse number="9" style="v" />Thaenaw nakaring a hoipaw tuh thae sah!” a ci.</para>
  <para style="s1">Tousenaw hae Eenaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mar 4.10-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luk 8.9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Te zuitu hae nynh amaw kalan oun cceih hae zah, “Pawccemou tousenaw phungpaw hae te minmin kha na hopya hae?” cite a khia hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Jesu nynh khung hae zah, “Pawccecize nanning tuh vaawlang peenaw kya-e byakhupaw nynaw kha pya na thua oh, thuasalama minmin tuh pya thua khyh hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Pawccecize a hoipaw ccungccaw kha pyachih athua cih zah patae a hoi cih; thuasalama a hoi leipaw ccungccaw tuh a hoi thypaw maw kha lawpya athua cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:29">Mat 25.29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:25">Mar 4.25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:18">Luk 8.18</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 19:26">19.26</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v" />Tukeiccu nynh minmin kha tousenaw phungpaw hae te ka hopya hae; pawccecize minmin tuh a do hae zemah muih khyh hae, a ngae hae zemah thae khyh hae, thae mah thaethya khyh hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Te Isaiah nynh a la hopaw bya tuh minmin kya accing vae; a la hopaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q1">‘Ngae tuh na ngae cih oh zah</para>
  <para style="q2">kharouh na thaethya lan khyh oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">do tuh na do cih oh zah</para>
  <para style="q2">kharouh na muih lan khyh oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.14-15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Isa 6.9-10</ref> (LXX)</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pawccecize hynh-e ccungccaw hae</para>
  <para style="q2">thinlung tuh marae aping,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih nakaring tuh phe apan,</para>
  <para style="q2">kae mit te kae muih khyh ccaw cite</para>
  <para style="q1">phang masi hae.</para>
  <para style="q2">Tuhkhyhze tuh mih nakaring nynh a thae cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih lung nynh a nyhthya cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">te ka kalan oun maekuh cih hae zah</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin kha phe ka dansah cih hae paw,’ a ci.</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thuasalama nanning tuh nae mit nynh ngawmuih zah nae nakaring nynh naw a thae keiccuze lungtua hae paw nynh na thua oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.16-17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:23-24">Luk 10.23-24</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v" />Byaccaccing kae hopya oh, profeh hae patae te adingpaw ccungccaw hae nynh na muih oh paw uccaw hae hynh muih a ry hae zemah muihbua khyh hae; na thae oh paw hynh thae a ry hae zemah thaebua khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Ccacii Vuatu Ccaesahnaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mar 4.13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luk 8.11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Tukeiccuze ccacii vuatupaw tousenaw phungpaw kong hynh ngaetua oh. <verse number="19" style="v" />Lukhakheit nynh peenaw kong hopaw bya kha he a thae tuh thaethya khyh, te mihoy leipaw nynh yn thua zah a thinlung kya vuapaw ccacii kha dae a lawpya. Tuh-e tuh laanpi pe vuapaw ccacii kha nynh thua. <verse number="20" style="v" />Lung alungnaw kya vuapaw ccacii tuh thehoypaw bya kha thae zah vaekheihmawte lungtuate a lawkuhpaw kha nynh thua. <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuhzemah aning tuh tharui hoi khyh zah sosoh rou nynh atyn; thehoypaw bya keiccuze vawsawnaw te tuaasahkunaw he yn um tuh a lung palou thang. <verse number="22" style="v" />Hinpaw hae laku vuapaw ccacii tuh thehoypaw bya kha thae salamah laephi vawlan thinphangnaw te hoirum rynaw nynh tuh-e bya tuh phang lungde zah athae thae kho vae khyh. <verse number="23" style="v" />Thuasalama lae hoypaw kya vuapaw ccacii tuh thehoypaw bya kha thae zah a thaethyapaw ccungccaw nynh thua; athae kha thae zah abang tuh leit za kheit, abang tuh leit sung taruh, abang tuh leit sung thum a pousahpaw ccungccaw kha nynh thua,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="s1">Looh te Lonua Tousenaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Jesu nynh ccangpaw tousenaw phungpaw a hopya hae paw tuh: “Vaawlang peenaw tuh a loo kya ccacii hoypaw a vuapaw ccungccaw te nynh aloku. <verse number="25" style="v" />Ccungccaw hae a i lya hae khe a rhawpaw nynh yn cceih zah looh hae kyakhe lonua mung hae kha vua zah a cciataw. <verse number="26" style="v" />Thuasalama looh tuh yn po zah avui he yn pou tuh lonua hae mah oun langkuh bua hae. <verse number="27" style="v" />Tukeiccuze inn hoitu a see hae nynh a kalan oun cceih hae zah, ‘Bawipaw, na loo kya ccacii hoypaw khaw na vua? Paw kyate mou lonua hae hynh oun pou hae?’ cite a khia hae. <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuh-e paw nynh, ‘Rhaw lu kheit nynh e hynh a cyih,’ a cipya hae. See hae nynh, ‘Tuhteze kaening nynh kae la ccianua sah lah, lonua hae kha kae la khaee ze na ry tou?’ a ci hae. <verse number="29" style="v" />Thuasalama aning nynh, ‘Tuhte thua khyh, lonua hae na khaee lya oh khe, looh kha na khaeebia sei cih oh. <verse number="30" style="v" />Loohrue ccyh azaw makhia pynkheihlan lekheih hin hae sah; loohrue ccyh kya loohruetu hae kha, Nanning nynh lonua hae kha khaee ty oh lah maee te soi khylan tung oh, te looh kha ka byng lungkhu lang ruin oh,’ ka cipah cih hae,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Mungngia Cii Tousenaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mar 4.30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luk 13.18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jesu nynh ccangpaw tousenaw phungpaw a hopya hae paw tuh: “Vaawlang peenaw tuh ccungccapaw lu kheit nynh mungngia cii kha lah zah a loo kya a vuapaw te nynh aloku. <verse number="32" style="v" />Mungngia cii tuh ccacii hae balyn kyaze adih huapaw nynh thua; thuasalama tuh-e nynh he yn le vae tetuh enaw-eho hae lakuze ale huapaw lang te thingku lang phe a tang; te vaawlang e pavaw hae nynh oun zou hae zah tuh-e aran hae kyakhe bu a luaku hae,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="s1">Ransi Tousenaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:20-21">Luk 13.20-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ccangpaw tousenaw phungpaw a hopya hae paw tuh: “Vaawlang peenaw tuh ransi te nynh aloku; nopi lu kheit nynh ransi kha lah zah vaepoi ke kethum kya phing zah, tuh-e vaepoi phe a thosahpaw ransi te nynh aloku,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />E akonglang hae balyn hynh Jesu nynh ccungccaw zapi kha tousenaw phungpaw hae te a hopya hae; tousenaw phungpaw leite minmin kha bya hopah khyh hae. <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuh-e tuh profeh nynh,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Ka khalang ka aw cih zah</para>
  <para style="q2">tousenaw phungpaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">ka ho cih, laephi tho takaw kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">thuruhpaw uccaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">ka ho cih,”</para>
  <para style="m">cite a hopaw bya accing nawlan nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 78:2">Sam 78.2</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Lonua Tousenaw Ccaesahnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Jesu nynh ccungccaw zapi kha cciataw hae zah inn lungkhu lang a tee; a zuitu hae nynh amaw kalan oun thua hae zah, “Loo kya-e lonua hae tousenaw phungpaw kong kha asuilan beih oun hopya tua,” a cipya hae. <verse number="37" style="v" />Jesu nynh, “Ccacii hoypaw a vuatupaw tuh Ccungccaw Ccapaw nynh thua. <verse number="38" style="v" />Loo tuh laephi nynh thua; ccacii hoypaw tuh peenaw ccaaw hae nynh thua; lonua hae tuh mihoy leipaw ccaaw hae nynh thua. <verse number="39" style="v" />Tuh-e lonua mung hae a vuapaw rhaw tuh Satan nynh thua; loohrue ccyh tuh laephi she athangnaw nynh thua; te loohruetu hae tuh vaaw hae nynh thua hae. <verse number="40" style="v" />Tukeiccuze lonua hae tuh suelua hae zah maee kya a soi hae hawte laephi she athangnaw kya acyikuh bua cih. <verse number="41" style="v" />Ccungccaw Ccapaw nynh a vaawccungccaw hae kha yn saw cih hae zah ccungccaw seinaw a raesah hae paw te hoyleinaw a rae hae paw balyn kha a peenaw kyate oun suelua cih hae. <verse number="42" style="v" />Te minmin kha maeephupi lungkhu lang a phung cih hae, tuin kya rawkhuinaw te hawzynaw a um cih. <verse number="43" style="v" />Te adingpaw ccungccaw hae tuh mih Paaw peenaw kya khuanin hawte a paw vae cih hae. Thaenaw nakaring a hoipaw tuh thae sah!</para>
  <para style="s1">Thurupaw Sisua Tousenaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />“Te vaawlang peenaw tuh loo kya thuruhpaw sisua te nynh aloku; tuh-e tuh ccungccapaw nynh he a muih tuh zya a thuruh, te tuh-e elang lungtuanaw te cceih zah a hoipaw balyn kha zua zah tuh-e loo tuh a re.</para>
  <para style="s1">Palee Tousenaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />“Vaawlang peenaw tuh myarya ahoypaw palee hae a ccungkuhpaw kungkupaw te nynh aloku. <verse number="46" style="v" />Tuh-e paw nynh myarya aphutepaw palee kha he a muih tuh, cceih zah a hoipaw balyn kha zua zah tuh-e palee tuh a re.</para>
  <para style="s1">Mia te Ngasaw Tousenaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />“Te vaawlang peenaw tuh: rili lungkhu lang vua hae zah ngasaw aphuinphuin a kyngpaw mia te nynh aloku. <verse number="48" style="v" />Ngasaw te he abeih tuh ngasaw kyngtu hae nynh mia kha varang langkhe a sue hae, te haung hae zah ahoypaw ngasaw hae kha shua lungkhu lang sang hae zah ahoy leipaw kha a vua hae. <verse number="49" style="v" />Tuh-e hawte laephi she athangnaw kya athua cih; vaaw hae nynh oun rung cih hae zah ccungccaw hoylei hae paw kha miding hae laku kyate thoh a phia cih hae. <verse number="50" style="v" />Minmin kha maeephupi lungkhu lang a vua cih hae; tuin kya rawkhuinaw te hawzynaw a um cih,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Jesu nynh, “E bya hae balyn hynh na thaethya oh tou?” cite zuitu hae kha a khia hae. Minmin nynh, “Kae thaethya,” a ci hae. <verse number="52" style="v" />Te Jesu nynh, “Tukeiccuze vaawlang peenaw kong ccangpya athua vae paw kawbya sazae miakaw tuh amaw a sisua bawng lungkhu te athawpaw te arynpaw uccaw hae yn thuakhaepaw inn hoitupaw te nynh aloku,” a cipya hae. <verse number="53" style="v" />Jesu nynh tuh-e tousenaw phungpaw hae kha he a ho koute tuin kyate a pou.</para>
  <para style="s1">Nazareth kya Jesu A Vua hae</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mar 6.1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luk 4.16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Te amaw a khua lang he a thua tuh a khuaccaaw hae kha mih sinakok kyakhe a ccangpya hae; minmin tuh myarya mih ngaeangthua zah, “E paw nynh paw kyate mou hynh-e hawnaw te e ngaeangnaw rae khonaw hynh a mue? <verse number="55" style="v" />E paw tuh lehccamapaw ccapaw thua khyh tou? A nung tuh Mary ci hae paw thua khyh tou? A neitaw hae tuh James, Joses, Simon te Judas thua khyh hae tou? <verse number="56" style="v" />Te a ccianung hae tuh mih balynte aening ryte a um hae paw kha thua khyh tou? Tuhteze paw kyate mou e paw nynh e uccaw hae balyn hynh a mue?” a ci hae. <verse number="57" style="v" />Tuhcite minmin nynh amaw kha a vua hae. Thuasalama Jesu nynh minmin kha, “Profeh hae tuh mimaw khua te mih innbyn kya holeite tuh sawtua leite um khyh hae,” a cipya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.57: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:44">Joh 4.44</ref></char></note> <verse number="58" style="v" />Minmin nynh a zyn khyh hae keiccuze Jesu nynh tuin kya ngaeangnaw patae rae khyh.</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Baptisma Pyatu Johan Chinaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mar 6.14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luk 9.7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuh-e ccyh lyakhe Galilee ram uktupaw Herod nynh Jesu thongpang kha thae zah, <verse number="2" style="v" />a ryalawpatu hae kha, “E paw hynh Baptisma pyatu Johan thua zah chinaw kyate yn hiinthuipaw nynh athua cih; tukeiccu nynh e ngaeangnaw hae hynh a rae kho,” a cipya hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Pawccecize Herod nynh a neitaw Filip zu Herodias keiccuze Johan kha kyng zah a he koute thonginn kya a saw.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.3-4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 3:19-20">Luk 3.19-20</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v" />Pawccecize Johan nynh Herod kha, “Herodias kha na dyku lan ccan khyh,” a la cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:16">Lev 18.16</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 20:21">20.21</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" />Aning nynh Johan kha chia lan a ry zemah ccungccaw zapi raw kha a rih. Pawccecize minmin nynh Johan kha profeh lu kheit hawte a tua hae paw nynh thua. <verse number="6" style="v" />Herod a pui nin khe Herodias ccanung nynh ccungccaw hae malang khe he yn law tuh Herod kha a lungrythuasah. <verse number="7" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Herod nynh tuh-e nung kyakhe, “Nae ngiakupaw miakaw kae pya cih,” cite thyalawkute bya a kinpyaku. <verse number="8" style="v" />Te a nung nynh a hopya thyhte, tuh-e nung nynh, “Baptisma pyatu Johan lu kha pakephepaw te hynhlang hin yn pya,” a ci. <verse number="9" style="v" />Siapharan tuh a ngaethah; tuhzemah thyalawkupaw keiccu te a ko hae paw ccungccaw hae keiccuze tuh-e nung nynh a rypaw kha raepya lan kaw a pya hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Tukeiccuze thonginn lungkhu e Johan lu kha a paesah hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Johan lu kha pakephepaw te oun ccyng hae zah nopinung taraw kha a pya hae, te aning nynh tuh-e tuh a nung kalan a ccyng. <verse number="12" style="v" />Johan zuitu hae oun thua hae zah a rhua kha lah hae zah a ccy hae, te cceih hae zah Jesu kha a hopya hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Thong Pangaw Looh A Dang hae</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mar 6.30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk 9.10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Joh 6.1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jesu nynh Johan kong he a thae tuh tuin kyate a makhaete ramkaw lang kohlung te a cceih; ccungccaw hae nynh tuh-e tuh he a thae hae tuh khua kyate mih ccu te amaw kha a zui hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Jesu tuh varang lang thua zah ccungccaw zapi kha he a muih tuh, ngaethyaumsah hae zah mih ngeccih hae kha a dansah hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Zete he yn thua tuh a zuitu hae nynh amaw kalan oun thua hae zah, “E kya tuh ramkaw thua zah khuanin phe anae vae, tukeiccuze ccungccaw zapi hynh saw hae lah khua hae kalan la cceih hae sah lah, looh la rekuh hae sah,” cite a hopya hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Thuasalama Jesu nynh, “Cceih nan hae sah, nanning nynh minmin kha ae lanpaw hankhakheit khangpah oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Minmin nynh, “E kya sanlou phe pangaw te ngasaw zaw ning rou nynh kae hoi,” a cipya hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Jesu nynh, “Tuh-e tuh hynhlang ka kalan oun ccyng oh,” a ci. <verse number="19" style="v" />Te ccungccaw zapi kha lonua vawlan haung lan kaw a pya hae, te sanlou phe pangaw te ngasaw zaw ning kha lah zah vaawlang dothung zah lungtuabya a ho, te eih zah sanlou kha zuitu hae a pya hae, te zuitu hae nynh ccungccaw zapi kha a nee hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Mih balyn te ae hae zah phe byn hae; te alaepaw a eihpaw kha khuin hae zah kee haw lae ning phe abeih. <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuh-e a ae hae paw tuh nopi hae te imua hae riabia leite pise ccite thong pangaw loukaw acih hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu Tui vawlan A Cceih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mar 6.45-52</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Joh 6.15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jesu nynh ccungccaw zapi a cciasah lya hae khe, zuitu hae kha kohlung kalan palou teesah hae zah rili khuraw lang a cciasah lalo hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Te ccungccaw zapi kha he a cciasah kou hae te, a makhaete sawsang lan mua vawlan a kaethung; khuanin nae cia tuin kya a makhaete a um. <verse number="24" style="v" />Varang te asawnaw lang a thua vae paw kohlung tuh khise yn tho keiccuze tuileih nynh vyavya a buleih. <verse number="25" style="v" />Khuadae dyn khe Jesu tuh rili vawlan khe zuitu hae kalan a cceih. <verse number="26" style="v" />Te zuitu hae nynh amaw rili vawlan yn cciapaw kha he a muih hae tuh siikuh hae zah, “Muisaw nynh thua!” a ci hae; te minmin tuh a ri hae keiccuze thawte a sia hae. <verse number="27" style="v" />Thuasalama Jesu nynh minmin kha hopah kangmaw hae zah , “Nae thinphang nan sah, kamaw nynh ka thua, rih nan oh,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Zynnaw Zyapaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tetuh Peter nynh, “Bawipaw, namaw na thua ze, tui vawlan te na kalan ccianaw kaw beih yn pya,” a cipya. <verse number="29" style="v" />Te Jesu nynh, “Rang,” a cipya. Tukeiccuze Peter tuh kohlung kyate sahkuh zah tui vawlan te Jesu kalan a cceih. <verse number="30" style="v" />Thuasalama khisan arupaw kha he a muih tuh a rih vae, te tui lungkhu lang he yn ccahbung zah, “Bawipaw, yn khum!” cite a sia. <verse number="31" style="v" />Jesu nynh vaekheihmawte a kuih kha dyng zah a kyng koute, “Na zynnaw eih zya kaesy! Pawccemou na lung ahiin?” a cipya. <verse number="32" style="v" />Minmin nynh kohlung lungkhu lang he oun thua hae tuh khisan phe adae. <verse number="33" style="v" />Te kohlung kya a um hae paw nynh oun cceih hae zah, “Nang tuh Pachia Ccapaw ccaccing nynh na thua,” ci hae zah amaw kha a beik hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Genesaret kya A Dansah hae</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:53-56">Mar 6.53-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Minmin nynh khuraw lang zua hae zah Genesaret ram a thua hae. <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuin kya-e ccungccaw hae nynh amaw kha he a nyh hae tuh tuin pepan balyn kalan khe byataw hae zah ngeccih hae balyn kha amaw kalan oun cciakhae hae. <verse number="36" style="v" />Te minmin nynh a boei dung sankaw hae lan amaw kha a ngiaku hae; te a hae paw miakaw tuh marya a dan hae.</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Anungsikuhpaw Uccaw hae</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:1-23">Mar 7.1-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Te Jerusalem khua e kawbya sazae hae te Farasi hae tuh Jesu kalan oun thua hae zah, <verse number="2" style="v" />“Pawccemou na zuitu hae nynh langmaw e piccan hae phung kha a lawe hae? Pawccecize minmin nynh looh a ae maw hae mih kuih singkuh khyh hae,” a cipya hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Jesu nynh minmin kha, “Pawccemou nanning so nae phung keiccuze Pachia kawbya kha na lawe oh? <verse number="4" style="v" />Pawccecize Pachia nynh, ‘Na paaw te na nung kha sawtua hae; humhung zemah a nung thuasah, a paaw thuasah thya a lawpaw tuh chia thua sah,’ a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Exo 20.12</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 21:17">21.17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Deu 5.16</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:9">Lev 20.9</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" />Thuasalama nanning nynh, humhung zemah a paaw thuasah, a nung thuasah, ‘Pawpaw zemah kamaw liate na mue lanpaw bawmnaw tuh Pachia uccaw nynh thua,’ a ci ze, <verse number="6" style="v" />a paaw thuasah, a nung thuasah sawtua ho vae khyh, na ci oh. Tuhcite naemaw phung keiccuze Pachia bya kha pawlang na ria khyh oh. <verse number="7" style="v" />Thyaphe hae! Nanning konglang hynh Isaiah nynh hmerarih lan a la hoty vae. A hopaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />‘E ccungccaw hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">mih munglae te saw oun tua hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">thuasalama mih thinlung tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ka kyate asawkuh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.8-9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 29:13">Isa 29.13</ref> (LXX)</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ccungccaw phung kha</para>
  <para style="q2">Pachia phung lang</para>
  <para style="q1">a ccangpya hae keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">kae yn beik hae paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">accakaepaw nynh thua,’ a ci,” cite a hopya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Te Jesu nynh ccungccaw zapi kha ko hae zah, “Ngae oh lah thaethya oh: <verse number="11" style="v" />Khalang lungkhu lang a teepaw nynh ccungccaw kha thusah khyh; thuasalama khalang kyate yn poupaw nynh ccungccaw kha a thusah,” a cipya hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Te a zuitu hae nynh a kalan oun naekuh hae zah, “Na hopaw bya he a thae hae te, Farasi hae tuh mih thinria cipaw na nyh tou?” a cipya hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Thuasalama Jesu nynh, “Vaawlang umpaw ka Paaw nynh a lin leipaw aku miakaw tuh marya khaee athua cih. <verse number="14" style="v" />Minmin tuh khamawte um hae sah; minmin tuh mitmoh hae a cciakhaetu hae mitmoh hae nynh thua hae. Te mitmohpaw nynh mitmohpaw kha a cciakhae ze parouhte hunghua lungkhu lang a ccah cih hae,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 6:39">Luk 6.39</ref></char></note> <verse number="15" style="v" />Peter nynh, “E tousenaw phungpaw hynh kaening oun ccaesahpya tua,” a cipya. <verse number="16" style="v" />Jesu nynh, “Nanning so thaethya leite tou na um ung oh? <verse number="17" style="v" />Khalang lungkhu lang a teepaw miakaw tuh vue lungkhu lang cceih zah atolang po a toikuh cipaw na nyh khyh oh tou? <verse number="18" style="v" />Thuasalama khalang lungkhu te yn poupaw uccaw tuh thinlung kyate yn poupaw thua zah, tuh-e nynh ccungccaw kha a thusah.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:34">Mat 12.34</ref></char></note> <verse number="19" style="v" />Pawccecize ahoy leipaw tuanaw hae, ccungccaw chianaw, milae zu milae vawpaw seikhaenaw, ohhuakunaw, ahme leipaw ccaekiakhannaw, runaw te milae thethya honaw tuh thinlung kyate nynh yn pou. <verse number="20" style="v" />E uccaw hae hynh nynh ccungccaw kha a thusah; thuasalama kuih singku leite aepaw nynh tuh ccungccaw kha thusah khyh,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="s1">Kanaan Nopinung Zynnaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:24-30">Mar 7.24-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Te Jesu tuh tuin kyate pou zah Tair te Sidon ram lang a cceih. <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuin ram kya umpaw Kanaan nopinung lu kheit nynh yn thua zah, “Pou Bawipaw, David Ccapaw, kae hynh ngaethya yn umsah; ka ccanung tuh raerangsaro nynh vawsawnaw myarya a pya,” cite a sia. <verse number="23" style="v" />Thuasalama Jesu nynh bya kaw kheit san khung khyh. A zuitu hae nynh a kalan oun cceih hae zah, “E nung hynh po dee, pawccecize ah nulang te oun zui zah palei a sia,” cite a ngia hae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Jesu nynh, “Israel hae kyaze azopaw tuu hae kalan rou nynh kae hynh yn saw,” a ci. <verse number="25" style="v" />Te tuh-e nung nynh yn cceih zah a malang bakhung zah, “Bawipaw, beih yn bawm!” a cipya. <verse number="26" style="v" />Jesu nynh, “Ccaaw hae looh kha law lan zah ui hae kha vuapya lan ccan khyh,” a cipya. <verse number="27" style="v" />Te tuh-e nung nynh, “Bawipaw, na hopaw tuh ahme, tuhzemah ui hae nynh mih bawi hae ccaboi kyate accahpaw loohmoi kha a ae hae khaw,” a ci. <verse number="28" style="v" />Tetuh Jesu nynh, “Pou nopinung, na zynnaw tuh ale raria! Na ry hawte na kya cyihkuh sah,” a cipya. A ccanung tuh tuin ccyh kyate phe dan vae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Ccungccaw Patae A dan hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jesu tuh tuin kyate cceih zah Galilee Rili pe lang a thua; te mua langkhe kaethung zah tuin kya a haung. <verse number="30" style="v" />Te myarya lungpaw ccungccaw zapi nynh a mitmohpaw, a ccukhoupaw, byaho kho leipaw, a kuihccu khyn leipaw te ccangpaw ngeccih patae kha oun thuakhae hae zah Jesu cculeihpaw khe a nung hae, te Jesu nynh minmin kha a dansah hae. <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuhcite byaho kho leipaw nynh bya yn ho, kuihccu khyn leipaw nynh yn dan, ccukhoupaw nynh laanpi cceih zah mitmohpaw nynh ngaw a muihpaw kha ccungccaw zapi nynh he a muih hae tuh mih ngaeangthua; te minmin nynh Israel Pachia kha a phu-esah hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Thong Pali Looh A Dang hae</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:1-10">Mar 8.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Jesu nynh a zuitu hae kha amaw kalan ko hae zah, “Ccungccaw zapi hynh thaw ka ccih hae, pawccecize minmin tuh kamaw kya nin thum um vae hae zah ae lanpaw hoi vae khyh hae, minmin hynh ae leite ka cciasah ry khyh hae, tuhte cciasah lan hae ze laanpi kya a bawsei cih hae,” a cipya hae. <verse number="33" style="v" />A zuitu hae nynh, “Hynhzeih ccungccaw zapi dang lanpaw looh tuh phe zaw lan ramkaw kyahin paw kyate mou kae mue cih?” a ci hae. <verse number="34" style="v" />Jesu nynh minmin kha, “Sanlou hohzeihmou na hoi oh?” cite khia hae zah minmin nynh, “Phe sari te ngasaw taraw beihtaraw nynh kae hoi,” a ci hae. <verse number="35" style="v" />Tetuh Jesu nynh ccungccaw zapi kha laekhu kya haung lan kaw a pya hae. <verse number="36" style="v" />Te aning nynh sanlou phe sari te ngasaw hae kha lah zah lungtuabya a ho koute tuh-e hae tuh eih zah a zuitu hae kha a pya hae, te zuitu hae nynh ccungccaw zapi kha a nee hae. <verse number="37" style="v" />Mih balynte ae hae zah a byn hae; minmin nynh a eihpaw alaepaw kha khuin hae zah kee sari phe abeih. <verse number="38" style="v" />A aepaw tuh nopi hae te imua hae riabia leite pise hae thong pali acih hae. <verse number="39" style="v" />Jesu nynh ccungccaw zapi kha a cciasah kou hae te kohlung kha ccikuh zah Magadan ram lang a cceih.</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Muihsahnaw A Ngiaku hae</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-13">Mar 8.11-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:54-56">Luk 12.54-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Farasi hae te Sadusi hae nynh oun thua hae zah Jesu kha syntawtua khylan, vaawlang e muihsahnaw kha minmin kya langsahpya lan a ngia hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:38">Mat 12.38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:16">Luk 11.16</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Jesu nynh, “Zete ccyh kya nanning nynh, ‘Vaawlui ase ze khuaa ahoy cih,’ na ci oh. <verse number="3" style="v" />Te awkhua ccyh kya, ‘Vaawlui se zah mae-ui keiccuze atunin tuh khuaarah cih,’ na ci oh. Nanning nynh vaawlui kha dote khuaa nincce kha na ny kho oh; thuasalama accyh muihsahnaw tuh na nyh kho khyh oh. <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahoy leipaw te a ohhuakuhpaw ciihan nynh muihsahnaw kha a ngia hae zemah profeh Jonah kya-e muihsahnaw laelan pawpaw muihsahnaw mah langsahpya thua vae lan khyh,” a ci. Te minmin kha po a cciataw vae hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:39">Mat 12.39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29">Luk 11.29</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Farasi hae te Sadusi hae Ransi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:14-21">Mar 8.14-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Te a zuitu hae nynh khuraw lang he a thua hae tuh sanlou phuku lanpaw kha phe a ning hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Jesu nynh minmin kha, “Farasi hae te Sadusi hae ransi kha raeringkute la sibia oh,” a cipya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:1">Luk 12.1</ref></char></note> <verse number="7" style="v" />Minmin nynh, “Aening nynh sanlou ah phuku khyh oh keiccu nynh e bya hynh a ho,” cite mimaw te mimaw a hoku hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Jesu nynh tuh-e tuh he a nyh te, minmin kha, “Zynnaw a zyn hae paw nanning, pawccemou sanlou na hoi khyh oh paw tuh palei na ho oh? <verse number="9" style="v" />Na thaethya loh khyh oh tou? Sanlou phe pangaw kha ccungccaw thong pangaw nynh ae hae zah kee hohzeihmou na khuin oh cipaw na nyh vae khyh oh tou?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:17-21">Mat 14.17-21</ref></char></note> <verse number="10" style="v" />Sanlou phe sari kha ccungccaw thong pali nynh ae hae zah kee hohzeihmou na khuin oh cipaw so na nyh vae khyh oh tou?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 15:34-38">Mat 15.34-38</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v" />Kae hopya oh paw hynh sanlou kong thua khyh cipaw kha pawccemou na thaethya khyh oh? Farasi hae te Sadusi hae ransi kha raeringkuh oh!” a cipya hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Tetuh zuitu hae nynh sanlou kya-e ransi kha raeringku lan oun hopya rypaw thua leite, Farasi hae te Sadusi hae ccangpyanaw kong nynh oun hopya ry cipaw kha a thaethya vae hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Peter nynh Jesu Kong Phynaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Mar 8.27-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luk 9.18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jesu tuh Sisaria Filipi ram lang he a thua te a zuitu hae kyakhe, “Ccungccaw hae nynh Ccungccaw Ccapaw kae hynh hum yn ci hae mou?” cite a khia hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Minmin nynh, “Ccungccaw abang nynh Baptisma pyatu Johan ae ci hae; abang nynh Elijah ae ci hae; abang nynh Jeremiah khyhze profeh lukhakheit nynh thua ae ci hae,” cite a khung hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:1-2">Mat 14.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-15">Mar 6.14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-8">Luk 9.7-8</ref></char></note> <verse number="15" style="v" />Jesu nynh minmin kha, “Nanning nynh so kae hynh hum nae ci oh mou?” cite a khia hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Simon Peter nynh, “Nang tuh a hiinpaw Pachia Ccapaw Messiah nynh na thua,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:68-69">Joh 6.68-69</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v" />Tetuh Jesu nynh, “Johan ccapaw Simon, nang tuh hythua a ccoupaw nynh na thua! Pawccecize chii te saw nynh e hynh nang ae phypyapaw thua khyh, vaawlang umpaw ka Paaw nynh ae phypyapaw nynh thua. <verse number="18" style="v" />Te nang tuh Peter nynh na thua cipaw kha kae hopya; e lungtung vawlan hin ka khriccaawbuu kha ka thadynsah cih zah, Michi khua e koikua hae nynh tae kho lan khyh. <verse number="19" style="v" />Vaawlang peenaw toh hae kha nang kae pya cih; nang nynh laephi vawlan na khiidepaw miakaw tuh vaawlang zemah khiide athua cih; te laephi vawlan na supyapaw miakaw tuh vaawlang zemah supya athua cih,” a cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:18">Mat 18.18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:23">Joh 20.23</ref></char></note> <verse number="20" style="v" />Te Jesu nynh a zuitu hae kha aning tuh Messiah nynh thua cite humhung kya mah a hopya khyh nawlan hae tynkaring lan kaw a pya hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">A Chi lanpaw A Hoty</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:31-9:1">Mar 8.31—9.1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luk 9.22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuin ccyh kyate Jesu nynh Jerusalem lang a ccia lanpaw, piccan hae, ranpibawi lepaw hae te kawbya sazae hae kuih kya patae a teing lanpaw, a chia lan hae paw, te nin thumnaw kya a thoothui lanpaw kong kha a zuitu hae kya a langsahpya hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Peter nynh Jesu kha ccanglang cciakhae zah, “Bawipaw, tuh-e tuh Pachia nynh khee vae sah; na tungvaw kya tuh-e tuh cyihkuh nan sah!” cite a hopya. <verse number="23" style="v" />Thuasalama Jesu nynh Peter kha maenuakuh zah, “Satan, ka nulang cceih! Nang tuh kae yn khawtu nynh na thua; pawccecize na tuanaw hynh Pachia kyate yn thuapaw thua khyh, ccungccaw kyate yn thuapaw nynh thua,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Jesu nynh a zuitu hae kha, “Lukhakheit nynh kae kha yn zui ry ze amaw te amaw kha vuakuh sah lah a vaelantung kha puihkute yn zui sah.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:38">Mat 10.38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:27">Luk 14.27</ref></char></note> <verse number="25" style="v" />Pawccecize humhung zemah a hiinnaw kha a khumkuh rypaw tuh a hiinnaw kha a shung cih; thuasalama humhung zemah a hiinnaw kha kae ka keiccuze a shungpaw tuh a hiinnaw kha a mue cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Mat 10.39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">Luk 17.33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Joh 12.25</ref></char></note> <verse number="26" style="v" />Pawccecize ccungccaw lu kheit nynh laephi pynpi hynh pong a ccou zeso a hiinnaw kha a shung ze, a hanlan pawmou athane? Tuhkhyhze a hiinnaw kha paw uccaw te mou a shawkhawkuh kho cih?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Pawccecize Ccungccaw Ccapaw tuh a Paaw phu-enaw kya a vaawccungccaw hae ryte yn thua cih; ccungccaw miakaw kha mih ryalawnaw thyhte ryalaw mee oun pya cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:31">Mat 25.31</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 62:12">Sam 62.12</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 2:6">Rom 2.6</ref></char></note> <verse number="28" style="v" />Byaccaccing kae hopya oh, Ccungccaw Ccapaw nynh a peenaw te yn thuapaw kha a muih hae cia a chih cih lei hae paw abang tuh hein kya a thadyn hae,” cite a hopya hae.</para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Jesu Muinsan Rulaekunaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:2-13">Mar 9.2-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luk 9.28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nin taruh acih koute Jesu nynh Peter, James te a neitaw Johan kha hoeibua hae zah mih makhaete ahangpaw mua lang a kae hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.1-5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 1:17-18">2Pe 1.17-18</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Mih malang khe Jesu tuh a muinsan yn rulaekuh; a mae tuh khuanin hawte phaephae ak zah a boeining tuh lahlah ak lan araw. <verse number="3" style="v" />Moses te Elijah tuh vaekheihmawte mih kya oun langkuh hae zah Jesu ryte bya a hokuh hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Tetuh Peter nynh Jesu kha, “Bawipaw, hein kya um tuh ah hanlan ahoy, na ry ze hein kya kae nynh bu buthum kae sak sah, nang na hanlan bu kheit, Moses hanlan bu kheit, Elijah hanlan bu kheit,” a cipya. <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuhte a ho cciamang lyakhe a awpaw maeking nynh minmin kha pong zithin hae zah maeking kyate roi nynh, “E paw tuh ka lungry kou yn tungpaw, ka sungsahpaw ka Ccapaw nynh thua, amaw bya kha la ngae oh!” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:2">Gen 22.2</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 18:15">Deu 18.15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 2:7">Sam 2.7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:1">Isa 42.1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mat 3.17</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 12:18">12.18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mar 1.11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Luk 3.22</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />Zuitu hae nynh tuh-e roi tuh he a thae hae te, myarya rih hae zah a bakhung hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Jesu nynh yn cceih zah minmin kha hae hae zah, “Thokuh oh, rih nan oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Minmin nynh he a dothung hae tuh Jesu kyalya muih hae zah tuhlaepaw hum sanmah muih vae khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Minmin nynh mua kyate oun rungbung lya hae khe Jesu nynh, “Ccungccaw Ccapaw tuh a chih hae paw kyate a thoothui mawlaezung na muih oh paw vizin hynh hum kya sanmah la ho nan oh,” cite zuitu hae kha kaw a pya hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Zuitu hae nynh Jesu kha, “Pawccemou kawbya sazae hae nynh Elijah tuh yn thuaty cih a ci hae?” cite a khia hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 4:5">Mal 4.5</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v" />Jesu nynh, “Elijah tuh yn thuaty ccaccing cih zah pawpaw balyn kha a paccyn ty cih. <verse number="12" style="v" />Thuasalama kae hopya oh, Elijah tuh phe thua vae, tuhzemah ccungccaw hae nynh amaw kha nyh khyh hae zah, a tungvaw mih rythyte a cyi hae. Tuhawte Ccungccaw Ccapaw mah minmin kuih kya yn teingbua cih,” a cipya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:14">Mat 11.14</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v" />Tetuh zuitu hae nynh Baptisma pyatu Johan kong nynh a ho cipaw a thaethya vae hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Imuapaw A Dansah</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:14-29">Mar 9.14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luk 9.37-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ccungccaw zapi kya he a thua hae te, ccungccapaw lu kheit tuh Jesu kalan yn thua zah a malang khe a ccukharutung zah, <verse number="15" style="v" />“Bawipaw, ka ccapaw hynh ngaethya beih umsah, pawccecize aning tuh dungpaw ccinaw hoi zah myarya a teing; accyhccyh vae ze maee lungkhu lang phungkuh zah accyhccyh vae ze tui lungkhu lang a phungkuh. <verse number="16" style="v" />Na zuitu hae kalan ka cciakhae zahmah dansah kho khyh hae,” a cipya. <verse number="17" style="v" />Jesu nynh, “Pou zynnaw hoi lei hae paw te a ccouseikuh hae paw ciihan hae, hohseciamou nae kya ka um ung cih? Hohseciamou kae ngaesangpah ung cih oh? Imuapaw kha ka kalan oun cciakhae oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Jesu nynh raerangsaro kha kawpya zah imuapaw lungkhu te a pou; te imuapaw tuh tuin ccyh kyate palou a dan vae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Tetuh zuitu hae nynh mih makhaete Jesu kalan oun cceih hae zah, “Pawccemou raerangsaro kha kae dee kho khyh?” cite a khia hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Te Jesu nynh, “Nae zynnaw azya keiccu nynh thua. Pawccecize byaccaccing kae hopya oh, mungngia mung cia zynnaw na hoi oh zetuh e mua hynh, ‘E kyate khuhlang khuin nuekuh,’ na ci oh ze a nuekuh cih; na cyi kho lei oh paw pawpaw mah um lan khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:21">Mat 21.21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:23">Mar 11.23</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 13:2">1Ko 13.2</ref></char></note> <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuhzemah e tahawpaw raerangsaro tuh looh-ae sungnaw te sawsangnaw kyalya nynh a dee kho,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">A Chi lanpaw Bua A Hoty</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mar 9.30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:44-45">Luk 9.44-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Galilee kya zuitu hae ryte a umkheih lya hae khe Jesu nynh, “Ccungccaw Ccapaw tuh ccungccaw hae kuih kalan apnaw ccyh anae vae, <verse number="23" style="v" />minmin nynh oun theih cih hae zah nin thumnaw kya yn thoothui cih,” a cipya hae. Minmin tuh myaryamaw mih ngaethah.</para>
  <para style="s1">Beikinn Ngunto Khoinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Minmin Kapernaum khua he a thua hae tuh beikinn ngunto a khoi hae paw nynh Peter kalan oun thua hae zah, “Nae sazaepaw hynh beikinn ngunto pya khyh tou?” cite a khia hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:13">Exo 30.13</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 38:26">38.26</ref></char></note> <verse number="25" style="v" />Peter nynh, “A pya,” a ci. Peter nynh innthung lang he yn tee tuh Jesu nynh cciadue zah, “Simon, pawtemou na tua? Laephi siapharan hae nynh hum hae kya-e mou ngunto kha a lawku hae? Mimaw mih ccaaw hae kya-e tou? Tuhkhyhze milae hae kya-e tou?” cite a khia. <verse number="26" style="v" />Peter nynh, “Milae hae kya-e nynh a lawku hae,” a ci. Jesu nynh, “Tuhteze ccaaw hae tuh a lue hae. <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuhzemah minmin tuh aening keiccuze a cyisei khyh ccaw hae, rili kalan la cceih lah ngasaw la baw, te na baw typaw ngasaw kha a khalang la kei lah phua shekel ccangkheit na la muih cih, tuh-e phua tuh la lah lah, namaw te kamaw hanlan la pya hae,” a cipya.</para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Hummou A Lesaehua?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mar 9.33-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luk 9.46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuh ccyh lyakhe zuitu hae nynh Jesu kalan oun thua hae zah, “Vaawlang peenaw kya hummou a lesaehua?” cite a khia hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:24">Luk 22.24</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Jesu nynh imua taraw lu kheit kha a kalan ko zah minmin ngaelaku khe nung zah, <verse number="3" style="v" />“Byaccaccing kae hopya oh, nanning nynh na rulaeku khyh oh zah imua taraw hawte na thua khyh oh ze, vaawlang peenaw lungkhu lang papin na tee lan khyh oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 10:15">Mar 10.15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:17">Luk 18.17</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v" />Tukeiccuze humhung zemah e imua hawte zakaw a sangsakuhpaw tuh vaawlang peenaw kya a lesae huapaw nynh thua. <verse number="5" style="v" />Humhung zemah e tahawpaw imua lu kheit kha ka min te leh a khanpaw tuh kae kha leh yn khanpaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="s1">Seinaw kalan Tuhounaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:42-48">Mar 9.42-48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luk 17.1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Humhung zemah kae yn zynpaw e imua taraw lukhakheit kha seinaw a raesahpaw tuh a nging kya mianawpaw lung kha sae lan zah rili akhunaw kya phung lanze amaw hanlan ahoyhua. <verse number="7" style="v" />Zynnaw kyate cciasahseinaw a um keiccuze laephi hanlan ngaethya lan kou um! Zynnaw kyate cciasahseinaw tuh solei a um cih; thuasalama tuhcite cciasahseinaw a umsahpaw hanlan ngaethya lan kou um!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Na ccu nynh thuasah, na kuih nynh thuasah ae seisah ze, thoh tya lah dae vua; ccukhou te tuhkhyhze kuihccu ccing leite hiinnaw lungkhu lang tee lanpaw tuh kuih voi ning, ccu voi ning te zungzae aruapaw maee lungkhu lang vuaku lanpaw laeze na hanlan ahoyhua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:30">Mat 5.30</ref></char></note> <verse number="9" style="v" />Na mit nynh ae seisah ze poh khoi lah dae vua; mit voi ning te hell maee lungkhu lang vuaku laeze mit voi kheit te hiinnaw kalan teepaw tuh na hanlan ahoyhua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:29">Mat 5.29</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Tuu Azopaw Tousenaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 15:1-7">Luk 15.1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“E imua taraw hae hynh lu kheit sanmah na dothatheih khyh nawlan oh raeringkuh oh; pawccecize kae hopya oh, imua hae a thungkhawtu vaaw hae nynh vaawlang umpaw ka Paaw mitmae kha tyty a muih hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Pawccecize Ccungccaw Ccapaw tuh a zopaw kha khum khylan nynh yn thua. <verse number="12" style="v" />Pawtemou na tua oh? Ccungccaw lu kheit nynh tuu za kheit hoi zah tuh-e hae kyaze sa kheit tuh laanpi a vaesei ze, sung takua sa takua kha mua vawlan a cciataw cih zah tuh-e laanpi a vaepaw tuu sa kheit kha ccung khylan cceih lan khyh tou? <verse number="13" style="v" />Byaccaccing kae hopya oh, tuh-e tuu kha he a muih lan thua ze, laanpi a vae lei hae paw sung takua sa takua tungvaw laeze tuh-e tuu sa kheit kya a lungtuahua. <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuhawte vaawlang umpaw nae Paaw nynh e imua taraw hae kyaze lu kheit sanmah zosah ry khyh.</para>
  <para style="s1">A Seipaw Uno Thuiheinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Na uno nynh na tungvaw a cyisei ze, cceih lah nae makhae kyakhe a cyiseinaw kha hopah; aning nynh ae ngaepya lanze na uno kha bua na muethui.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 17:3">Luk 17.3</ref></char></note> <verse number="16" style="v" />Thuasalama aning nynh ae ngaepya khyh ze, lu kheit khyhze lu ning la hoeikuh hae, tuhteze nynh ccaekia lu ning khyhze lu thum hae liate na hopaw bya miakaw tuh atyn cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 19:15">Deu 19.15</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v" />Aning nynh minmin bya kha a ngae khyh ze khriccaawbuu kya na ho cih; khriccaawbuu bya kha bua a ngae vae khyh ze amaw kha lawkipaw te ngunto khoipaw hawte la tua ccavae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Byaccaccing kae hopya oh, pawpaw zemah laephi vawlan na khiide oh paw tuh vaawlang kya khiide athua cih, te pawpaw zemah laephi vawlan na supya oh paw tuh vaawlang kya supya athua cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:19">Mat 16.19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:23">Joh 20.23</ref></char></note> <verse number="19" style="v" />Nanning kha bua kae hopya oh, laephi vawlan hin nanning kyaze ccungccaw lu ning nynh lunglokute uccaw hankhakheit kha a ngia hae ze, vaawlang umpaw ka Paaw nynh a pya cih hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Pawccecize lu ning khyhze lu thum nynh ka min te a sueluakunaw hae kyakhe kae mah minmin kya ka umbua,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Ngaethyakunaw A Hoi leipaw See</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Peter nynh Jesu kalan yn cceih zah, “Bawipaw, ka uno lukhakheit nynh ka tungvaw a sei ze, vae hohzeihmou ka ngaethya cih? Vae sari cia tou?” cite a khia.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.21-22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 17:3-4">Luk 17.3-4</ref></char></note> <verse number="22" style="v" />Jesu nynh, “Vae sari cia kyalya thua khyh; vae sung sari leit sari cia na ngaethya cih, kae cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:24">Gen 4.24</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Tukeiccuze vaawlang peenaw tuh a see hae te asekuhpaw phua ccazing a do rypaw siapharanpaw lu kheit te nynh aloku. <verse number="24" style="v" />Ccazing he a lah tuh talent thong haw laebah umpaw lu kheit kha amaw kalan oun thuakhae hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuh-e paw nynh laebah sang lanpaw a hoi khyh keiccuze a bawipaw nynh amaw ry, a zu a ccaaw hae ryte a hoipaw balyn kha zua sah lah laebah kha sang sah cite kaw a pya. <verse number="26" style="v" />Tukeiccuze tuh-e see nynh bakhungte amaw kha beik zah, ‘Bawipaw, beih yn ngaethya hin, laebah tuh marya kae sang cih,’ a cipya. <verse number="27" style="v" />A bawipaw nynh ngaethya a umsah keiccuze a laebah kha ngaethya zah phe a luesah. <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuh-e see tuh po cceih zah amaw nynh denari phua za kheit laebah a umsahpaw a banpaw see lu kheit kha a muih; te tuh-e paw tuh kyng zah a lotharue kha meih zah, ‘Laebah na umpaw kha yn pya ccavae,’ a cipya. <verse number="29" style="v" />A banpaw nynh a cculeihpaw bakhung zah, ‘Yn ngaethya hin, laebah tuh marya kae sang cih,’ cite a ngiaku. <verse number="30" style="v" />Thuasalama aning nynh ngaethya ry khyh; te cceih zah lae a sang makhia thong a saw. <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuhte a cyipaw tuh ccangpaw a ban hae see hae nynh he a muih hae tuh myarya mih ngaethah, te cceih hae zah acyikuhpaw balyn kha mih bawipaw kya a hopya hae. <verse number="32" style="v" />Tetuh a bawipaw nynh tuh-e see tuh ko zah, ‘Pou see thyapaw! Nae soihbiakuh zah na laebah balyn kha marya kae ngaethya. <verse number="33" style="v" />Kae nynh na tungvaw ngaethya kae umsah hawte na banpaw see tungvaw kya ngaethya na umsah lan ccan khyh tou?’ a cipya. <verse number="34" style="v" />A bawipaw tuh a thinria zah tuh-e paw nynh laebah marya a sang kou mawlaezung thong kya a saw. <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuhawte nanning nynh nae uno hae mih cyiseinaw kha nae thinlung te na ngaethya khyh oh ze vaawlang umpaw ka Paaw nynh mah tuhcite ae cyihbua cih oh,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Zu Myanaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:1-12">Mar 10.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luk 16.18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesu nynh tuh-e bya he a ho koute Galilee kyate pou zah Jordan vaw khuraw lang umpaw Judea ram kya a thua. <verse number="2" style="v" />Ccungccaw zapi nynh amaw kha zui hae zah tuin kya minmin kha a dansah hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Farasi hae abang nynh amaw kalan oun thua hae zah amaw kha syntawtua khylan, “Pisepaw nynh a zu kha pawpaw kong zemah mya lan kawbya nynh a ua tou?” cite a khia hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Te Jesu nynh, “Atakaw lyaze raetu nynh ‘pise te nopi kha a rae hae,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:27">Gen 1.27</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 5:2">5.2</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" />hynh-e keiccuze pise nynh a paaw te a nung kha a cciataw cih zah a zu te a umkheih cih hae, minmin lu ning tuh pyn pynkheit lang a tang cih hae,’ acikuhpaw kha na ria boi khyh oh tou?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Gen 2.24</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />Tukeiccuze minmin tuh lu ning thua vae khyh hae, pyn pynkheit nynh athua vae hae. Tukeiccuze Pachia nynh a suelua vae paw kha humhung nynh mah phia nan sah,” a ci. <verse number="7" style="v" />Minmin nynh, “Tuhteze pawccemou Moses nynh zu te vaw myakunawpaw ccaw kha pya lan zah zu kha mya lan cite kaw oun pya?” a cipya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 24:1-4">Deu 24.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31">Mat 5.31</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v" />Jesu nynh, “Nae thinlung akhung keiccuze Moses nynh nae zu hae kha mya lan ae ua oh; thuasalama atakaw lya tuh tuhte thua khyh. <verse number="9" style="v" />Te kae hopya oh, humhung zemah ohhuakunaw keiccu thua leite a zu kha mah zah ccangpaw zu a hoipaw tuh milae zu a seikhaepaw nynh thua; te humhung zemah a mya hae paw nopi kha a zu lang a hoikuhpaw tuh milae zu a seikhaepaw nynh thua,” a cipya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:32">Mat 5.32</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 7:10-11">1Ko 7.10-11</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A zuitu hae nynh, “Zu te vaw kong hynh tuhcite athua ze, zu hoi leite um lanze ahoyhua,” a cipya hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Thuasalama Jesu nynh, “E ccangpyanaw hynh ccungccaw miakaw nynh lawkuh kho khyh hae; tuh-e tuh mih hanlan pya athua hae paw rou nynh a lawkuh kho hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Pawccecize abang tuh a pui takaw hae mawte akuchihpaw a um hae; abang tuh ccungccaw hae nynh tinria hae paw a um hae; vaawlang peenaw keiccuze mimaw te mimaw tinreihkuh hae paw a um hae. E bya hynh a lawkuh khopaw nynh lawkuh sah,” cite a hopya hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu te Imua hae</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mar 10.13-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luk 18.15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Imua hae tungvaw kya Jesu nynh a kuih khangte saw a sangpya ccaw hae cite amaw kalan oun cciakhae hae zah, a zuitu hae nynh minmin kha a pe hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Thuasalama Jesu nynh, “Imua hae kha ka kalan oun cceih hae sah, khee nan oh; pawccecize vaawlang peenaw tuh hynhcihawpaw ccungccaw hae elang nynh thua,” a ci. <verse number="15" style="v" />Imua hae tungvaw kya a kuih a khang koute tuin kyate a cceih.</para>
  <para style="s1">Mihoi Ccangvaepaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mar 10.17-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luk 18.18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ccungccapaw lu kheit nynh Jesu kalan yn thua zah, “Sazae, zungzae hiinnaw ka hoi nawlan paw uccaw hoypaw mou ka cyih cih?” cite a khia. <verse number="17" style="v" />Jesu nynh, “Pawccemou uccaw hoypaw kong tuh nae khia? Pachia lu kheit kyalya nynh a hoypaw a um; hiinnaw lungkhu lang na tee ry zetuh kawbya hae kha la zui,” a cipya. <verse number="18" style="v" />Aning nynh, “Paw kawbya hae kha mou?” cite a khia. Jesu nynh, “Ccungccaw na theih lan khyh, milae zu milae vawpaw kya na sei lan khyh, na ruh lan khyh, ahme leipaw ccaekia lang na tang lan khyh,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:13-16">Exo 20.13-16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:17-20">Deu 5.17-20</ref></char></note> <verse number="19" style="v" />na paaw te na nung kha sawtua, na innpaw kha namaw na sungsaku hawte na sungsah cih, cikuhpaw kha,” a cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Exo 20.12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Deu 5.16</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lev 19.18</ref></char></note> <verse number="20" style="v" />Ccangvaepaw nynh, “E hae balyn tuh pong ka zui vae; pawmou ka bou ung?” a cipya. <verse number="21" style="v" />Jesu nynh, “Accingpaw ccungccaw lang na tang ry ze, cceih lah na hoipaw kha zua lah, ryachi hae kha la pya hae; tetuh vaawlang khua kya sisua na hoi cih, te yn cceih lah kae hynh yn zui,” a cipya. <verse number="22" style="v" />Ccangvaepaw nynh tuh-e bya tuh he a thae te ngaethyate a cceih, pawccecize aning tuh uccaw patae a hoi keiccu nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Te Jesu nynh a zuitu hae kha, “Byaccaccing kae hopya oh, mihoipaw hanlan vaawlang peenaw kalan tee lanpaw tuh kou aru. <verse number="24" style="v" />Te bua kae hopya oh, mihoipaw nynh Pachia peenaw kalan tee lae tuh kalauh nynh phynbang khu kya tee nynh azoihua,” a cipya hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />A zuitu hae nynh tuh-e bya he a thae hae tuh myaryamaw mih ngaeangthua zah, “Tuhteze hummou khumnaw tuh a mue kho cih?” a ci hae. <verse number="26" style="v" />Thuasalama Jesu nynh minmin kha do hae zah, “Ccungccaw hanlan tuh hynh-e hynh thua kho khyh, thuasalama Pachia hanlan tuh pawpaw balyn athua kho,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tetuh Peter nynh, “Dotua, kaening tuh pawpaw balyn kae cciataw zah namaw kha kae zui vae, tukeiccuze pawmou kae mue cih?” a cipya. <verse number="28" style="v" />Jesu nynh, “Byaccaccing kae hopya oh, atyn-are balyn bua raethuinaw ccyh kya Ccungccaw Ccapaw nynh a phu-enaw bawitungkhung kya he yn haung te kae nae zui oh paw nanning mah bawitungkhung haw lae ning kya nae haungbua cih oh zah, Israel phin haw lae ning kha bya nae pia cih oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:31">Mat 25.31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:30">Luk 22.30</ref></char></note> <verse number="29" style="v" />Te ka min keiccuze inn hae, uno hae, ccianung hae, paaw, nung, zu, ccaaw hae, loo hae, tuh-e hae hankhakheit kha a cciatawpaw tuh leit za kheit a mueru cih zah zungzae hiinnaw rho a ccou cih. <verse number="30" style="v" />Thuasalama masaty e ccungccaw patae tuh nyathyakou athua cih hae zah nyathyakou e patae tuh masaty athua cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:16">Mat 20.16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:30">Luk 13.30</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Misu Khokhu Ryalahtu hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Pawccecize vaawlang peenaw tuh a misu khokhu elang ryalahtu hae hoh lan cite awkhua takaw te a cceihpaw khokhu hoitupaw te nynh aloku. <verse number="2" style="v" />Aning nynh nin kheit ze denari kia kheit pya lante ryalahtu hae ryte nawccawnaw kha rae zah minmin kha a misu khokhu lang a saw hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Awkhua suimilan ccangtakua loukaw khe pou zah kungkunaw kya paw ryalaw leite a thadyn hae paw mingccang hae kha a muih. <verse number="4" style="v" />Te minmin kha, ‘Nanning mah misu khokhu lang la cceihbua oh lah accan thyhte kae pya cih oh,’ a cipya hae. Te minmin mah a cceihbua hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Ninthuccynglyn loukaw te zete suimilan ccangthum loukaw khe bua cceih zah tuhcih maminte bua a cyi. <verse number="6" style="v" />Te suimilan ccangpangaw loukaw khe bua cceih zah, paw ryalaw leite a thadyn hae paw mingccang hae kha muih zah, ‘Pawccemou hein kya ryalaw leite ninlang na thadyn oh?’ cite a khia hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Minmin nynh, ‘Hum nynh sanmah oun paw khyh hae keiccu,’ a ci hae. Aning nynh, ‘Nanning mah misu khokhu lang la cceih oh lah accan thyhte na mue cih oh,’ a cipya hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Zete he yn thua tuh misu khokhu hoitupaw nynh a ryaccinkhanpaw kyakhe, ‘Ryalahtu hae kha ko hae lah nyathyakou a teepaw kyate masaty a teepaw kyacia mih ryalaw mee kha pya hae,’ a cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:13">Lev 19.13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 24:15">Deu 24.15</ref></char></note> <verse number="9" style="v" />Te suimilan ccangpangaw loukaw kya ryalaw a tee hae paw tuh oun thua hae zah denari kia kheit cci a mue hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Masaty ryalaw a tee hae paw he oun thua hae tuh mimaw tuh alunghua kae mue cih cite a tuaku hae; thuasalama minmin mah denari kia kheit cci nynh a mue hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuh-e tuh a lawkuh kou hae te minmin nynh khokhu hoitupaw kha ccoh hae zah, <verse number="12" style="v" />‘E hae nyathyakou oun tee hae paw tuh suimilan ccangkheit kyalya nynh ryalaw hae, khuaninso teingte ninlang rya kae lahpaw kaening te minmin kha phe na losaku bua hae,’ a cipya hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Thuasalama aning nynh minmin kyaze lukheitpaw kha, ‘Ka ban, na kya ka cyihsei khyh, denari kia kheit te ryalaw lan na nawccah khyh tou? <verse number="14" style="v" />Na ccanpaw hynh lawkuh lah la cceih ccavae; hynh-e nyathyakou e paw hynh nang te phe lokuh lan ka pya ry. <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka uccaw te ka cyi rypaw cyinaw kaw ka hoi khyh tou? Tuhkhyhze hysahnaw ka hoi keiccuze nang tuh na eiung tou?’ a cipya. <verse number="16" style="v" />Tukeiccuze nyathyakou e hae tuh masaty athua cih hae zah masaty e hae tuh nyathyakou athua cih hae; ccungccaw patae tuh ko athua hae, thuasalama beihtaraw nynh po athua hae,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:30">Mat 19.30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:31">Mar 10.31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:30">Luk 13.30</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">A Chi lanpaw Bua A Hoty</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mar 10.32-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luk 18.31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jesu nynh Jerusalem lang a cciathung lyaze zuitu hae lu haw lae ning kha mih makhaete ccanglang cciakhae hae zah, <verse number="18" style="v" />“Ngaetua oh, aening tuh Jerusalem lang ah cceihthung oh, te Ccungccaw Ccapaw tuh ranpibawi lepaw hae te kawbya sazae hae kalan oun ap cih hae zah chia lan sei oun be cih hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Amaw kha sarya khylan, bua khylan te khiade khylan Zenta hae kuih kalan oun pya cih hae; te nin thumnaw kya bua yn thoothui cih,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Johan Nung nynh Ngianaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:35-45">Mar 10.35-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Te Zebedi ccaaw hae mih nung tuh a ccaaw hae ryte Jesu kalan oun thua hae, a malang khe bakhung zah thawccinaw a ngiaku. <verse number="21" style="v" />Jesu nynh, “Pawmou na ry?” cite a khia. Nopinung nynh, “E ka ccaaw hae lu ning nynh na peenaw kya na ranglang lu kheit, na voilang lu kheit a haungbua nawlan hae bya beih yn kinpakuh,” a cipya. <verse number="22" style="v" />Jesu nynh, “Paw nynh kae ngia cipaw na nyh khyh oh. Ka nia lanpaw banang hynh na neih kho cih oh zawtou? Kae nynh baptisma ka in lanpaw kha na inbua kho cih oh zawtou?” cite a khia hae. Minmin nynh, “Kae cyih kho cih,” a ci hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Jesu nynh minmin kha, “Nanning nynh ka banang kha na neih ccaccing cih oh zah baptisma ka in lanpaw kha na inbua cih oh; thuasalama ka ranglang te ka voilang haungnaw kaw kha kae nynh ka pya kho khyh, tuh-e dahungnaw tuh ka Paaw nynh a paccynpya hae paw hanlan nynh thua,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Zuitu lu haw nynh tuh-e tuh he a thae hae tuh uno lu ning tungvaw mih thinria. <verse number="25" style="v" />Thuasalama Jesu nynh minmin kha ko hae zah, “Zenta hae a uktu hae nynh tuh uknaw kaw khate a uk hae, te a lesae hae paw nynh kawhoinaw kha a mang hae cipaw na ny oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.25-26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:25-26">Luk 22.25-26</ref></char></note> <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuhzemah nanning kya tuh tuhte thua lan khyh, thuasalama nanning laku a lesaepaw lang a tang rypaw tuh nae ryalahtu lang a tang hahe cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.26-27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:11">Mat 23.11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:35">Mar 9.35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:26">Luk 22.26</ref></char></note> <verse number="27" style="v" />Humhung zemah nanning lakuze lupihua lang a tang rypaw tuh nae see lang a tang hahe cih. <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuhawte Ccungccaw Ccapaw tuh rya lawpyaku khylan yn thua khyh; ming hae rya kha lawpya khylan te ccungccaw patae shawkhaw nawlan a hiinnaw kha pyaku khylan nynh yn thua,” cite a hopya hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Mitmoh hae Lu Ning A Dansah</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mar 10.46-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luk 18.35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jesu te a zuitu hae nynh Jeriko khua te he a pou hae tuh ccungccaw zapi nynh amaw kha a zui hae. <verse number="30" style="v" />Laanpi pe a haung hae paw mitmoh hae lu ning nynh Jesu po a cceih cipaw he a thae hae tuh, “Bawipaw, David Ccapaw, kaening hynh ngaethya beih oun umsah!” cite a sia hae. <verse number="31" style="v" />Te ccungccaw zapi nynh minmin kha zya a dae ccaw hae cite a sianua hae; thuasalama minmin nynh, “Bawipaw, David Ccapaw, kaening hynh ngaethya beih oun umsah!” cite houh a sia hae. <verse number="32" style="v" />Jesu nynh a thadyn lante minmin kha ko hae zah, “Nae hanlan pawmou nae cyisah ry oh?” cite a khia hae. <verse number="33" style="v" />Minmin nynh, “Bawipaw, kae mit hynh ngaw oun muih sah,” a ci hae. <verse number="34" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Jesu nynh ngaethyaumsah hae zah mih mit kha a hae, te vaekheihmawte mih mit tuh ngawmuih zah amaw kha a zui hae.</para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Jesu Jerusalem lang A Tee</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mar 11.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk 19.28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Joh 12.12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesu te a zuitu hae nynh Jerusalem lang naekuh hae zah Oliv Mua leihpaw Bethfeih khua he a thua hae tuh Jesu nynh zuitu lu ning kha saw hae zah, <verse number="2" style="v" />“Nae malang umpaw khua langkhe la cceih oh lah, a khii hae paw lann pinung te lann taraw kha ccahe na la muih cih oh; tuh-e lann hae kha oun supah oh lah ka kalan oun sue oh. <verse number="3" style="v" />Lukhakheit nynh ae khia oh ze, ‘Bawipaw nynh a peki,’ nae cipah cih oh; tetuh tuh-e paw nynh palou ae sawpah vae cih oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Hynh-e tuh profeh nynh a la hosyapaw kha accing nawlan nynh thua; a hosyapaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Dotua, na siapharan tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">na kalan yn cceih cciamang;</para>
  <para style="q1">aning tuh a lungnepaw thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">lann kha yn ccikuh,</para>
  <para style="q1">lann taraw kha yn ccikuh, cite</para>
  <para style="q2">Zion ccanung kha</para>
  <para style="q1">hopah oh,” acikuh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 9:9">Zek 9.9</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zuitu hae nynh cceih hae zah Jesu nynh kaw a pya hae hawte a cyi hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Lann pinung te lann taraw kha oun thuakhae hae zah lann hae tungvaw khe mih boei hae kha de hae zah tuh-e vawlan khe Jesu nynh a cciku. <verse number="8" style="v" />Myarya lungpaw ccungccaw zapi nynh mih uccaw hae kha laanpi kya a phaepya hae; mingccang hae nynh thingku kya-e thingnge hae kha bae hae zah laanpi kya a phaepya hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Jesu malang a cceih hae paw te a nulang a zuikuh hae paw zapi hae nynh,</para>
  <para style="q1">“David Ccapaw, Hosanna!</para>
  <para style="q2">Bawipaw min te yn thuapaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">hythuaccou sah!</para>
  <para style="q2">Ahang huanaw kya</para>
  <para style="q1">Hosanna thua sah!”</para>
  <para style="m">cite a sia hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:25">Sam 118.25</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 118:26">26</ref></char></note> <verse number="10" style="v" />Jesu nynh Jerusalem lang he a tee tuh, khualae balyn tuh ngaluin-ngaluin ccae zah, “E paw hynh hummou athua?” a ci hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Ccungccaw zapi nynh, “E paw tuh Galilee ram e Nazareth paw profeh Jesu nynh thua,” a ci hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu nynh Beikinn A Ccikan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mar 11.15-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luk 19.45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-17">Joh 2.13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jesu nynh Pachia beikinn lungkhu lang tee zah beikinn kya a zuatu hae te a retu hae balyn kha a dee hae; phuaru hae paw mih ccaboi te vahu zua hae paw kya-e dahungnaw hae kha dawleihpah hae zah, <verse number="13" style="v" />“Ccathyaa kyaze,</para>
  <para style="q1">‘Ka inn tuh sawsangnaw inn</para>
  <para style="q2">ci athua cih,’ cite azeikuh;</para>
  <para style="q1">thuasalama nanning nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">miruh hae karung lang</para>
  <para style="q1">na rae oh,” a cipya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Isa 56.7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:11">Jer 7.11</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Te mitzu hae te ccukhou hae nynh beikinn lang amaw kalan oun thua hae zah minmin kha a dansah hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Jesu nynh a raepaw ngaeangnaw hae te imua hae nynh beikinn kya, ‘David Ccapaw kya Hosanna thua sah,’ cite a sia hae paw kha, ranpibawi lepaw hae te kawbya sazae hae nynh he muih hae tuh mih thinria zah, <verse number="16" style="v" />Jesu kha, “E imua hae nynh a ho hae paw tuh na thae tou?” a cipya hae. Jesu nynh, “Ou, ka thae;</para>
  <para style="q1">‘Imua hae te matei zu hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">nosi hae munglae kyate</para>
  <para style="q1">namaw thehoysahnaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">na paccyn vae,’</para>
  <para style="q1">acikuhpaw kha na ria boi</para>
  <para style="q2">khyh oh tou?” a cipya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 8:2">Sam 8.2</ref> (LXX)</char></note></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Te minmin kha cciataw hae zah khualae te pou zah Bethani khua lang a cceih; te tuin kya a rya.</para>
  <para style="s1">Thaeku Ku Thyalawnaw</para>
  <para style="r">(Mar 11.12-14, 20-26)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Awkhua khe khualae lang he a ki tuh a vuelaw vae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Laanpi pe khe thaeku ku kha muih zah a ccianua, thuasalama a naw laelan paw sanmah muih khyh; tukeiccuze thaeku ku kha, “Papinmaw athae la thae boi nan vae!” a cipya. Te vaekheihmawte thaeku ku tuh karae arou. <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuh-e tuh zuitu hae nynh a muih hae tuh mih ngaeangthua zah, “Thaeku ku hynh vaekheihmawte karae arou kangmaw rei!” a ci hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Jesu nynh minmin kha, “Byaccaccing kae hopya oh, lunghiinnaw hoi leite zynnaw na hoi oh ze, thaeku ku kya acyihkuhpaw kyalya thua leite, e mua hynh, ‘Nuekuh lah rili lungkhu lang phungkuh,’ na ci oh ze a phungkuh cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 17:20">Mat 17.20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 13:2">1Ko 13.2</ref></char></note> <verse number="22" style="v" />Na zyn oh ze sawsang te na ngia oh paw miakaw kha na mue cih oh,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu Kawhoinaw A Khia hae</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mar 11.27-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luk 20.1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jesu nynh beikinn lungkhu lang tee zah a ccangpya lya hae khe, ranpibawi lepaw hae te piccan hae nynh a kalan oun cceih hae zah, “E uccaw hae hynh paw kawhoinaw te mou na cyi? E kawhoinaw hynh hum nynh mou ae pya?” cite a khia hae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Jesu nynh khung hae zah, “Kae mah bya kaw kheit kae khia cih oh, aphi nae hopya oh ze, kae mah e uccaw hae hynh paw kawhoinaw te nynh ka cyi cipaw kae hopah ru cih oh: <verse number="25" style="v" />Johan kya-e baptisma hynh paw kyate mou yn thua? Vaawlang tetou? Tuhkhyhze ccungccaw kyate tou?” cite a khia hae. Mimaw te mimaw bya eikuh hae zah, “Aening nynh, ‘Vaawlang kyate,’ ah ci oh ze, aning nynh, ‘Tuhteze pawccemou Johan kha na zyn khyh oh,’ oun ci cih. <verse number="26" style="v" />‘Ccungccaw hae kyate,’ ah ci oh ze, ccungccaw hae rawri lan a um; pawccecize ccungccaw balyn nynh Johan tuh profeh lu kheit hawte a tua hae paw nynh thua,” a ciku hae. <verse number="27" style="v" />Tukeiccuze minmin nynh Jesu kha, “Kae nyh khyh,” cite a khung hae. Jesu nynh, “Kae mah paw kawhoinaw te nynh e uccaw hae hynh ka cyi cipaw kae hopah lan khyh oh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Ccapaw Lu Ning Tousenaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Nanning pawte na tua oh? Ccungccapaw lu kheit nynh ccapaw lu ning a hoi; aning nynh atawccapaw kalan cceih zah, ‘Ka ccapaw, atunin misu khokhu lang la cceih lah rya la lah,’ a cipya. <verse number="29" style="v" />A ccapaw nynh, ‘Ka cceih lan khyh,’ a ci; thuasalama khuekheih acih te ngaesikuh zah a cceih. <verse number="30" style="v" />Te mih paaw nynh asoipaw kalan cceih zah, tuh-e hawte bua a hopya. Aning nynh, ‘Ka la cceih vae sah, apang,’ a cipya, thuasalama cceih khyh. <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuh-e lu ning hae kyaze hum tuh mou a paaw rynaw a cyih?” cite a khia hae. Minmin nynh, “Atawccapaw,” a ci hae. Jesu nynh minmin kha, “Byaccaccing kae hopya oh, ngunto khoi hae paw te ohhuanung hae nynh Pachia peenaw lungkhu lang nae malang te ae teetaw vae cih oh. <verse number="32" style="v" />Pawccecize Johan nynh dingnaw laanpi kha zuite nae kalan yn thua zah na zyn khyh oh; thuasalama ngunto khoi hae paw te ohhuanung hae nynh amaw kha a zyn hae; te nanning nynh tuh-e tuh mang na muih oh pite nae lung na paleihkuh khyh oh zah zyn mah na zyn khyh oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 3:12">Luk 3.12</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 7:29-30">7.29-30</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Ryalahtu hae Tousenaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mar 12.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luk 20.9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“Ccangpaw tousenaw phungpaw hynh ngaetua oh: loram a hoipaw lu kheit nynh misu khokhu kha rae zah hohung po a koih, te misu mianaw khu kha karouh zah buhang ccangkheit a sak, te khokhu kha a hohtu hae kalan hohsakuh hae zah ramccang lang a cceih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 5:1-2">Isa 5.1-2</ref></char></note> <verse number="34" style="v" />Misu thae lo yn zaw te, a mue lanpaw kha law khylan a see hae kha a hohtu hae kalan a saw hae. <verse number="35" style="v" />Khokhu a hohtu hae nynh a see hae kha kyng hae zah lu kheit kha a bua hae, lu kheit kha a chia hae, lu kheit kha lung te a deih hae. <verse number="36" style="v" />Aning nynh masaty e see hae laeze alunghua lante ccangpaw see hae kha bua a saw hae; minmin nynh tuh-e hae tuh langmaw hawte bua a cyi hae. <verse number="37" style="v" />Nyathyakou tuh, ‘Minmin nynh ka ccapaw tuh saw a tua cih hae,’ ci zah a ccapaw kha minmin kalan a saw. <verse number="38" style="v" />Thuasalama khokhu a hohtu hae nynh a ccapaw kha he a muih hae tuh, ‘E paw hynh rhoccoutu nynh thua, rang oh, amaw hynh theih oh sih lah a rho kha lawkuh oh sih’ cite a hoku hae. <verse number="39" style="v" />Te tuh-e paw tuh kyng hae zah misu khokhu akhung lang vua hae zah a chia hae. <verse number="40" style="v" />Tukeiccuze misu khokhu a hoitupaw he yn thua te, khokhu a hohtu hae kha pawtemou a cyih cih hae?” cite a khia hae. <verse number="41" style="v" />Minmin nynh, “Tuh-e ccungccaw hoylei hae paw kha myarya ccih lante a theih cih hae; te a misu khokhu kha athae lo ccyh kya athae hoyte a pya cih hae paw ccangpaw khokhu a hohtu hae kalan a hohsakuh cih hae,” a ci hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Jesu nynh minmin kha, “Ccathyaa kyaze,</para>
  <para style="q1">‘Inn sak hae paw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a nuee hae paw lung tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">inn saknaw kya abyapi huapaw</para>
  <para style="q2">apaki lang e lung lang</para>
  <para style="q1">yn tang, hynh-e tuh Bawipaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a cyipaw thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">aening muihnaw kya</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaeang lan umpaw nynh thua,’</para>
  <para style="m">cite azeikuhpaw kha na ria boi khyh oh tou?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.42: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22-23">Sam 118.22-23</ref></char></note> <verse number="43" style="v" />Tukeiccuze kae hopya oh, Pachia peenaw tuh nae kyate lawpya athua cih zah tuh-e peenaw thae a thaepaw minphuin kalan pya athua cih. <verse number="44" style="v" />Humhung zemah tuh-e lung vawlan a ccahpaw tuh phe akingkuh cih; humhung zemah tuh-e lung nynh a ccawphupaw tuh palae tui cih,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Te ranpibawi lepaw hae te Farasi hae nynh tuh-e tousenaw phungpaw hae kha he a thae hae tuh kaening kong nynh oun honua cipaw a nyku hae. <verse number="46" style="v" />Minmin nynh Jesu kha kyng lan a ry hae zemah ccungccaw zapi raw kha a rih hae; pawccecize ccungccaw hae nynh Jesu tuh profeh cite a tua hae paw nynh thua.</para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Zudy Poi Tousenaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 14:15-24">Luk 14.15-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesu nynh ccungccaw hae kha tousenaw phungpaw hae te bua a hopya hae. A hopaw tuh: <verse number="2" style="v" />“Vaawlang peenaw tuh a ccapaw hanlan zudy poi a tuapaw siapharanpaw te nynh aloku. <verse number="3" style="v" />Zudy poi kalan thuabua lan a ko hae paw kha kosah lan hae a see hae kha a saw hae; thuasalama minmin tuh oun thua ry khyh hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Ccangpaw a see hae kha bua saw hae zah, ‘Kopaw ccungccaw hae kha hynhte la hopah oh: Dotua oh, ka loohdangkunaw tuh ka paccyn kou vae, ka tangnuapaw hae te athopaw sahiin hae kha phe ka chia vae, pawpaw balyn tuh paccyn athua vae, zudy poi loohdangkunaw kalan rang ccavae oh,’ cite a hosahpya hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Thuasalama minmin nynh tuh-e tuh pawlangria leite mih rynaw lang a cceih hae, lukheitpaw nynh a loo lang cceih zah ccangpaw lu kheit nynh a kungkunaw lang a ccia. <verse number="6" style="v" />Te tuhlae hae nynh tuh-e see hae kha kyng hae zah sarisarya zuenah hae zah a chia hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Thuasalama siapharan tuh myarya a thinria zah a rhawkaw hae kha saw hae zah tuh-e ccungccatheih hae kha a chiasah hae, te mih khuapi kha maee te a soipya hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Tukoute a see hae kha, ‘Zudy poi tuh paccyn phe athua vae, thuasalama ko hae paw tuh ngaekuh vae khyh hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Tukeiccuze nanning nynh laanluepi hae kalan la cceih oh lah na muih oh paw ccungccaw miakaw kha zudy poi kalan oun ko oh,’ cite a hopya hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Tukeiccuze tuh-e see hae tuh laanluepi hae kalan cceih hae zah, a muih hae paw ccungccaw miakaw kha athah ahoy ci leite pum hae zah zudy poi tuh mikhia hae ryte phe abeih vae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Siapharanpaw nynh mikhia hae do lan he yn tee tuh zudy poi boeining a lawkuh leipaw ccungccaw lu kheit kha he a muih tuh, <verse number="12" style="v" />‘Ka ban, pawccemou zudy poi boeining lawku leite hynhlang nae tee?’ a cipya. Tuh-e paw nynh yccae khyh. <verse number="13" style="v" />Tetuh siapharanpaw nynh a see hae kyakhe, ‘A kuih te a ccu kha he oh lah, rawkhuinaw te hawzynaw a umnaw atolang mohnaw kalan khe vua oh,’ a cipya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 8:12">Mat 8.12</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 25:30">25.30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:28">Luk 13.28</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v" />Pawccecize kopaw tuh alung, thuasalama popaw tuh azya,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="s1">Pachia Uccaw te Sizar Uccaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mar 12.13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luk 20.20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Farasi hae nynh cceih hae zah Jesu nynh a hopaw kya pawtemou kaangsyakhaw lan cipaw khua a khanku hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Minmin nynh Herod pati hae ryte mimaw zuitu hae kha Jesu kalan saw hae zah, “Sazae, nang tuh ahmepaw nynh na thua, Pachia laanpi kha hmerarih lan na ccangpah hae zah mirymihua na tua khyh; pawccecize nang tuh ccungccaw hae mae na do khyh cipaw kae ny. <verse number="17" style="v" />Tukeiccuze na tuanaw kha oun hopya tua. Sizar kalan ngunto pya lan accan tou, ccan khyh tou?” cite a khiasah hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Jesu nynh a thyaruhnaw hae kha phe nyh zah, “Thyaruh hae, pawccemou kae hynh nae syntawtua oh? <verse number="19" style="v" />Ngunto lang pya lanpaw phua tuh yn dosah tua oh,” a ci. Te minmin nynh denari kia kheit kha oun ccyngpya hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Jesu nynh minmin kha, “E hynh hum muinsan te hum min mou?” cite a khia hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Minmin nynh, “Sizar muinsan te min,” a ci hae. Te Jesu nynh, “Tukeiccuze Sizar uccaw kha Sizar kalan pya oh lah, Pachia uccaw kha Pachia kalan pya oh,” cite a khung hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Minmin nynh tuh-e bya he a thae hae tuh mih ngaeangthua; te amaw kha po cciataw hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Thoothuinaw Kong Byakhianaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mar 12.18-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luk 20.27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuin nin khe thoothuinaw um khyh a cih hae paw Sadusi hae tuh Jesu kalan oun thua hae zah hynhte a khia hae:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:8">Loc 23.8</ref></char></note> <verse number="24" style="v" />“Sazaepaw, ‘Ccungccapaw lu kheit nynh ccaawsaah leite a zu kha a chitaw ze, tuh-e paw a neitawpaw nynh tuh-e zu tuh a umkhae cih zah a upaw elang ccaaw a saahpah cih,’ cite Moses nynh a la ho.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:5">Deu 25.5</ref></char></note> <verse number="25" style="v" />Atu kaening laku kya uno lu sari a umbua hae; atawccapaw tuh zu hoi zah ccaawsaah leite phe a chih, a zu kha a neitawpaw nynh zu lang a hoi. <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuhawte lu ningnaw nynh zu lang bua a hoi, te lu thumnaw kyate lu sarinaw kyacia tuhcite a cyihkuh. <verse number="27" style="v" />Nyathyakou tuh tuh-e nopinung mah a chihbua. <verse number="28" style="v" />Tukeiccuze thoothuinaw kya tuh-e nung tuh lu sari hae kyaze hum zu lang mou a tang cih? Pawccecize tuh-e nung tuh mih balyn zu lang phe a tang vae,” a ci hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jesu nynh minmin kha, “Nanning tuh na mesei oh; Ccathyaa thuasah, Pachia thungnaw thuasah na ny khyh oh keiccu nynh thua. <verse number="30" style="v" />Pawccecize thoothuinaw kya tuh zuvaw tang ci um vae khyh, zu dypyaku ci mah um vae khyh, minmin tuh vaawlang e vaaw hae hawte nynh athua vae hae. <verse number="31" style="v" />Thuasalama a chih hae paw thoothuinaw konglang te Pachia nynh ae hopya oh paw kha na ria boi khyh oh tou? A hopaw tuh: <verse number="32" style="v" />‘Kae tuh Abraham Pachia, Isak Pachia te Jakob Pachia nynh ka thua,’ a ci. Pachia tuh a chih hae paw Pachia thua khyh, a hiin hae paw Pachia nynh thua,” cite a hopya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Exo 3.6</ref></char></note> <verse number="33" style="v" />Ccungccaw zapi nynh tuh-e bya he a thae hae tuh a ccangpyanaw kha mih ngaeangthua.</para>
  <para style="s1">Abyapi huapaw Kawbya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Mar 12.28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luk 10.25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jesu nynh Sadusi hae kha zya a daesah hae cipaw kha Farasi hae nynh a thae hae tuh pynkheihlan a tungkuh hae. <verse number="35" style="v" />Minmin kyaze kawbya sazae lu kheit nynh Jesu kha syntawtua khylan hynhte bya a khia:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.35-40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luk 10.25-28</ref></char></note> <verse number="36" style="v" />“Sazaepaw, kawbya kyaze paw kawbya mou alehua?” cite a khia. <verse number="37" style="v" />Jesu nynh, “ ‘Bawipaw na Pachia kha na thinlung balyn te, na hiinnaw balyn te, na tuanaw balyn te na sungsah cih,’ acikuh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:5">Deu 6.5</ref></char></note> <verse number="38" style="v" />E hynh ale huapaw te abyapi huapaw kawbya nynh thua. <verse number="39" style="v" />Ccangningnaw tuh tuh-e te alokuh. ‘Na innpaw kha namaw toulou hawte na sungsah cih,’ acikuh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lev 19.18</ref></char></note> <verse number="40" style="v" />Kawbya balyn te profeh ccauh hae balyn tuh hynh-e kawbya ccangning kyahin marya akyngkuh,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="s1">Messiah Kong Byakhianaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mar 12.35-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luk 20.41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Farasi hae tuh pynkheihlan a pumku lya hae khe Jesu nynh, <verse number="42" style="v" />“Messiah hynh pawtemou na tua oh? Aning tuh hum ccaaw mou athua?” cite a khia hae. Minmin nynh, “David Ccapaw nynh thua,” a ci hae. <verse number="43" style="v" />Jesu nynh, “Tuhteze pawccemou David nynh Muisaw liate amaw kha Bawipaw a ci. David nynh,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />‘Bawipaw nynh ka Bawipaw kha,</para>
  <para style="q2">“Na rhaw hae kha na ccu kaw kya</para>
  <para style="q1">ka nung mawlaezung tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ka ranglang khe</para>
  <para style="q1">haung,” a cipya,’ a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.44: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Sam 110.1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />David nynh Messiah kha Bawipaw cite a ko lanze, pawtemou Messiah tuh David Ccapaw athuathya cih?” cite a khia hae. <verse number="46" style="v" />Te bya kaw kheit a khung khopaw hum sanmah um khyh; tuh-e nin kyate hum nynh sanmah byakhia ngan vae khyh hae.</para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Kawbya Sazae hae te Farasi hae</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mar 12.38-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Luk 20.45-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Te Jesu nynh ccungccaw zapi te a zuitu hae a hopya hae paw bya tuh: <verse number="2" style="v" />“Kawbya sazae hae te Farasi hae nynh tuh Moses tungkhung kya nynh a haung hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Tukeiccuze minmin nynh ae ccangpya oh paw miakaw kha zui oh lah cyih oh; thuasalama a cyi hae hawte la cyihbua nan oh, pawccecize minmin tuh ho hae zah cyih khyh hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Minmin nynh phupaw aripaw te phu arupaw kha tung hae zah ccungccaw hae raw vawlan a khang hae, thuasalama mimaw tuh mih kuihdung te sanmah nue ry khyh hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Thuasalama rya a law hae paw balyn kha ccungccaw hae nynh muih hae sah cite leih a law hae. Mih terui kya te mih kuihbaw kya a khiibiaku hae paw Ccathyaa zeikuhpaw bawngtaraw kha kosah hae zah mih angkile adung kha a ccuasaku hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:1">Mat 6.1</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 15:38">Nam 15.38</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 6:8">Deu 6.8</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />Poi kya ahoy huanaw hmin kha ry hae zah sinakok hae kya ahoy huapaw haungnaw hae kya haung lan a ry hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Kungkunaw hae kya sawtuate byabeihku ry hae zah ccungccaw hae nynh, ‘Sazae, Sazae’ cite koku kha a ry hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Thuasalama nanning tuh ‘Sazae’ cite la kokuh ry nan oh; pawccecize nanning nynh sazae lu kheit rou nynh na hoi oh; nanning balyn tuh siaimua hae nynh na thua oh. <verse number="9" style="v" />Laephi vawlan hum sanmah ‘Apang’ cite ko nan oh; pawccecize vaawlang umpaw nae Paaw lu kheit rou nynh Paaw na hoi oh. <verse number="10" style="v" />‘Lupi’ cite mah la kokuh ry nan oh; pawccecize lupi lu kheit kyalya na hoi oh zah amaw tuh Messiah nynh thua. <verse number="11" style="v" />Nanning lakuze ale huapaw tuh nae ryalahtu lang a tang cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:26-27">Mat 20.26-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:35">Mar 9.35</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 10:43-44">10.43-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:26">Luk 22.26</ref></char></note> <verse number="12" style="v" />Humhung zemah amaw te amaw a hangsakuhpaw tuh sawbung athua cih; amaw te amaw zakaw a sangsakuhpaw tuh hangthung athua cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 14:11">Luk 14.11</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 18:14">18.14</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Thuasalama kawbya sazae hae te Farasi hae, thyaruh hae, nae hanlan ngaethya lan kou um! Pawccecize vaawlang peenaw thuakaw kha ccungccaw hae elang phe na khaw oh, naemaw mah na tee khyh oh zah a tee ry hae paw mah na uapah khyh oh. <verse number="14" style="v" />Kawbya sazae hae te Farasi hae, thyaruh hae, nae hanlan ngaethya lan kou um! Pawccecize nomae hae inn kha na luade oh zah cyisakuthya nawlan saw kha khaw cia na sang oh; tukeiccuze ale huapaw detahnaw kha na teing cih oh. <verse number="15" style="v" />Kawbya sazae hae te Farasi hae, thyaruh hae, nae hanlan ngaethya lan kou um! Pawccecize ccungccaw lu kheit a beiknaw paleih khylan rili te laephi kya khua na ccong oh, he yn paleihkuh tuh tuh-e paw kha naemaw laeze leit ning hell kalan ccawsah lan rya na law oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Cciakhaetu hae mitmoh hae, nae hanlan ngaethya lan kou um! Nanning nynh ‘Humhung zemah beikinn phyate thyalawku ze pawtua-ung khyh; thuasalama humhung zemah beikinn kya-e sui phyate thyalawku ze atyn,’ na ci oh. <verse number="17" style="v" />Nanning mingaee hae te mitmoh hae! Sui tou abyapihua, tuhkhyhze sui a thyaasahpaw beikinn tou abyapihua? Pawtuhmou abyapihua? <verse number="18" style="v" />Te ‘Humhung zemah silawhang phyate thyalawku ze pawtua-ung khyh, thuasalama humhung zemah silawhang vawlan umpaw lasung phyate thyalawku ze atyn,’ na ci oh. <verse number="19" style="v" />Nanning mingaee hae te mitmoh hae! Silawhang vawlan e lasung tou abyapihua, tuhkhyhze lasung a thyaasahpaw silawhang tou abyapihua? Pawtuhmou abyapihua? <verse number="20" style="v" />Tukeiccuze silawhang phyate thya a lawku ze silawhang ry, a vawlan umpaw lasung balyn ryte thya a lawde vae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Beikinn phyate thya a lawku ze beikinn te tuin kya umpaw Pachia kha thya a lawde vae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Te vaawlang phyate thya a lawku ze Pachia kya-e bawitungkhung phyate thyalawkuhpaw thua zah, tuh-e vawlan a haungpaw Pachia phyate thyalawkuhpaw nynh thua vae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:1">Isa 66.1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:34">Mat 5.34</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Kawbya sazae hae te Farasi hae, thyaruh hae, nae hanlan ngaethya lan kou um! Pawccecize nanning nynh hangmae, pucinan te khanmuin kha pumhaw pumkheit na pya oh zah kawbya kyaze akhincci huapaw atazanaw, ngaethyaumsahnaw te lungzinaw tuh pawlang na ria khyh oh; ccangpaw kha mah sawphah leite hynh-e hae hynh na cyi lan oh paw nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 27:30">Lev 27.30</ref></char></note> <verse number="24" style="v" />Cciakhaetu hae mitmoh hae, na nia lan oh paw tui kya-e maseih khaze na kihbia oh zah kalauh khaze po na due oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Kawbya sazae hae te Farasi hae, thyaruh hae, nae hanlan ngaethya lan kou um! Pawccecize nanning nynh banang te pake kha avawlan kyalya na sing oh, thuasalama alungkhu tuh luadenaw te karankunaw khate phe abeih. <verse number="26" style="v" />Farasi mitmoh hae, pakekhupaw te banang alungkhu kha singty oh, tuhteze nynh tuh-e hae avawlan kha mah athyaabua cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Kawbya sazae hae te Farasi hae, thyaruh hae, nae hanlan ngaethya lan kou um! Pawccecize nanning tuh asi rawpaw a thuh hae paw shawku te nynh na loku oh; avawlan tetuh kou puithya salamah alungkhu tuh michi hae ru te athupaw aphuinphuin te phe abeih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:3">Loc 23.3</ref></char></note> <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuhawte nanning mah avawlan tetuh ccungccaw hae malang adingpaw hawte nynh na langku oh, thuasalama nae lungkhu tuh thyaruhnaw te hoyleinaw te nynh phe abia.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Kawbya sazae hae te Farasi hae, thyaruh hae, nae hanlan ngaethya lan kou um! Pawccecize profeh hae shawku kha na raepah oh zah miding hae lungbing kha na ccaan oh. <verse number="30" style="v" />Nanning nynh, ‘Kae minpaaw hae she lyakhe kae la hiinbua ze, profeh hae chiise luasahnaw kya kae umbua lan khyh,’ na ci oh. <verse number="31" style="v" />Tukeiccuze nanning tuh profeh hae a la theih hae paw ciihan hae nynh kae thua cipaw kha naemaw toulou nynh ccaekia na khanku vae oh. <verse number="32" style="v" />Tukeiccuze nae minpaaw hae kya-e cyisahnaw tounawpaw kha phe biasah lalae oh. <verse number="33" style="v" />Nanning hupaw hae, huparepaw ciihan hae! Pawtemou hell kalan ccawnaw kyate na lue kho cih oh?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:7">Mat 3.7</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 12:34">12.34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:7">Luk 3.7</ref></char></note> <verse number="34" style="v" />Tukeiccuze profeh hae, mihaw hae te kawbya sazae hae kha nae kalan kae saw hae; te minmin lakuze abang kha nae theih cih oh zah nae khiade cih oh; abang kha nae sinakok hae kya nae bua cih oh zah khua khuakheit kyate khuakheit kalan nae dee cih oh. <verse number="35" style="v" />Tukeiccuze adingpaw Abel chiise kyate, beikinn te silawhang laku na chia oh paw Berakhiah ccapaw Zekhariah chiise kyacia laephi vawlan aluapaw miding hae chiise balyn tuh nae tungvaw accah cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:8">Gen 4.8</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 24:20-21">2Sh 24.20-21</ref></char></note> <verse number="36" style="v" />Byaccaccing kae hopya oh, e uccaw hae balyn hynh atu she e ccungccaw hae tungvaw yn ccah cih.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jerusalem elang Jesu A Rah</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:34-35">Luk 13.34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />“Pou Jerusalem, Jerusalem, nang nynh profeh hae kha na theih hae zah na kalan oun saw hae paw ccungccaw hae kha lung te na deih hae; awpinung nynh a taw hae kha a sake kaw a khong hae hawte na ccaaw hae kha pynkheihlan suelua lan palei ka ry, thuasalama na ry khyh! <verse number="38" style="v" />Na inn tuh vuasya thua zah ccungccaw phe adae vae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 22:5">Jer 22.5</ref></char></note> <verse number="39" style="v" />Pawccecize kae hopya oh, ‘Bawipaw min te yn thuapaw Ccungccaw tuh hythua ccoupaw nynh thua,’ cite na ho mawlaezung oh, atu te nae muih vae lan khyh oh,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Sam 118.26</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Athangnaw Kong Muihsahnaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mar 13.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luk 21.5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesu nynh beikinn kyate pou zah a ccia lyakhe a zuitu hae nynh a kalan oun cceih hae zah beikinn kya-e inn hae kha a muihsah hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Jesu nynh, “E hae balyn hynh na muih khyh oh tou? Byaccaccing kae hopya oh, hein kyahin lung ccangkheit vawlan ccangkheit a khangthykuh lei lan ciate khaleih tingsah bung athua cih,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jesu tuh Oliv Mua vawlan a haung lyakhe zuitu hae nynh mih makhaete a kalan oun thua hae zah, “E uccaw hae hynh hohtuhmou yn cyihkuh cih? Nae thuanaw lanpaw te laephi she athangnaw lanpaw hynh muihsahnaw pawmou yn langkuh cih? Kaening hynh oun hopah bua,” a ci hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Jesu nynh, “Humhung nynh mah ae ling khyh nawlan oh la raeringkuh oh. <verse number="5" style="v" />Pawccecize ccungccaw patae nynh ka min te oun thua cih hae zah, ‘Kae tuh Messiah nynh ka thua,’ oun ci cih hae zah ccungccaw patae kha oun ling cih hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Nanning nynh rhawtukkunaw kong te rhawtho lanpaw kong kha nae thae cih oh; tuhzemah nae thinphang nan sah; pawccecize hynh-e uccaw hae balyn tuh oun cyihkuh hahe cih, thuasalama athangnaw tuh thua loh khyh. <verse number="7" style="v" />Pawccecize minphuin phuin kheit te phuin kheit, ram kheit te ram kheit oun rhawkuh cih hae; ram takyh kya ccakan yn ccih cih zah innry yn suekuh cih. <verse number="8" style="v" />E hae balyn tuh neitangia accih takawpaw hawte nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Te ccungccaw hae nynh nanning kha vawrivawsaw nung khylan ae ap cih oh zah ae theih cih oh; ka min keiccuze minphuin hae balyn nynh ae hua cih oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:22">Mat 10.22</ref></char></note> <verse number="10" style="v" />Te ccungccaw patae nynh mih zynnaw kha oun vua cih hae, lu kheit te lu kheit yn pheekuh cih hae zah lu kheit te lu kheit yn huakuh cih hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Lingthya profeh hae patae oun langkuh cih hae zah ccungccaw patae kha oun ling cih hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Hoyleinaw alung keiccuze ccungccaw patae kya-e sungsakunaw tuh yn zyabung cih. <verse number="13" style="v" />Thuasalama athangnaw cia atynpaw tuh khum athua cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:22">Mat 10.22</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v" />E peenaw thehoypaw hynh minphuin hae balyn kalan ccaekia lang laephi pynpi kya oun ho cih hae; tukoute athangnaw tuh yn thua cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Tukeiccuze profeh Daniel nynh a la ho hawte, luathua-ae-ui lan umpaw rohtupaw nynh athyaapaw hmin kya a thadynpaw kha he nae muih oh te (Ccathyaa a riapaw nynh thaethya sah),<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 9:27">Dan 9.27</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 11:31">11.31</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 12:11">12.11</ref></char></note> <verse number="16" style="v" />Judea ram kya um hae paw nynh mua lang ccue hae sah. <verse number="17" style="v" />Inn tungvaw a umpaw nynh inn lungkhu e uccaw kha law lan rungbung nan vae sah.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.17-18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 17:31">Luk 17.31</ref></char></note> <verse number="18" style="v" />Loo kya a umpaw nynh a boeining lawku khylan ki nan vae sah. <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuin ccyh kya tuh ccaaw a poipaw nopi hae te matei zupaw nosi a hoipaw nopi hae hanlan ngaethya lan kou um! <verse number="20" style="v" />Nanning na ccue ccyh oh tuh khuaccih ccyh te sabbath nin athua khyh nawlan saw la sang oh. <verse number="21" style="v" />Pawccecize laephi athotakaw te atu cia a la um boi leipaw, nyalang mah a um vae cih leipaw myarya ccihpaw teingnaw tuh yn thua cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:1">Dan 12.1</ref>; <ref loc="REV 7:14">Bya 7.14</ref></char></note> <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuh-e accyh tuh dynsah khyh lanze humhung mah lue lan khyh, thuasalama popaw ccungccaw hae hanlan tuh-e accyh tuh dynsah athua cih. <verse number="23" style="v" />Lukhakheit nynh, ‘Dotua! Hein kya nynh Messiah tuh a um!’ tuhkhyhze ‘Khuin kya nynh a um!’ ae cipya oh ze la zyn nan oh. <verse number="24" style="v" />Pawccecize lingthya messiah hae te lingthya profeh hae oun langkuh cih hae zah athua kho ze alepaw muihsahnaw te ngaeangnaw kha oun langsakuh cih hae; ou khate popaw ccungccaw hae kha heize oun ling cih hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Ngae oh, nanning kha kae hopya ty vae oh. <verse number="26" style="v" />Tukeiccuze minmin nynh, ‘Dotua! Messiah tuh ramkaw nynh a um,’ ae cipya oh ze la cceih nan oh. ‘Dotua! Aning tuh akhaan lungkhu nynh a um,’ ae cipya oh ze la zyn nan oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.26-27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 17:23-24">Luk 17.23-24</ref></char></note> <verse number="27" style="v" />Pawccecize khozaw tuh nithua langte yn laekuh zah niccaw lang cia a aw hawte Ccungccaw Ccapaw tuh yn thua cih. <verse number="28" style="v" />Michi rhua a umnaw miakaw kya lantaw hae oun pumkuh cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 17:37">Luk 17.37</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Ccungccaw Ccapaw Thuanaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mar 13.24-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luk 21.25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Tuin ccyh kya-e teingnaw koute</para>
  <para style="q1">vaekheihmawte khuanin tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">yn moh cih zah sawpaw mah</para>
  <para style="q1">yn aw vae lan khyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">te awsi hae tuh vaawlui kyate</para>
  <para style="q1">oun ccah cih hae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">vaawlang e thungnaw hae balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">oun hy vae cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:10">Isa 13.10</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 34:4">34.4</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 32:7">Eze 32.7</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:10">Joe 2.10</ref>, <ref loc="JOL 2:31">31</ref>, <ref loc="JOL 3:15">3.15</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:12-13">Bya 6.12-13</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tetuh Ccungccaw Ccapaw kya-e muihsahnaw kha vaawlang kya yn langkuh cih; laephi vaw e minphuin hae balyn tuh oun rah oun khui cih hae, te Ccungccaw Ccapaw tuh thungnaw te alesaepaw phu-enaw ryte vaawlang e maeking kya yn rungpaw kha oun muih vae cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan 7.13</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 12:10-14">Zek 12.10-14</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">Bya 1.7</ref></char></note> <verse number="31" style="v" />Te myarya ccaepaw mungkae roi ryte a vaaw hae kha yn saw cih hae zah amaw nynh a po hae paw kha minmin nynh laephi ki kipali kyate, vaawlang athangnaw san kheit kyate san kheit kyacia oun pum cih hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Thaeku Ku Tousenaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mar 13.28-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luk 21.29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“Thaeku ku kya-e tousenaw phungpaw hynh atu ccangku tua oh; aran tuh notazyh lan yn cih zah anaw he yn toih tuh hawnin anae vae cipaw na ny oh. <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuhawte nanning nynh e uccaw hae balyn hynh he nae muih vae oh ze Ccungccaw Ccapaw yn thuanaw lanpaw tuh anae vae, thuakaw kin cia yn naekuh vae cipaw la nyh ccavae oh. <verse number="34" style="v" />Byaccaccing kae hopya oh, e uccaw hae balyn acyiku kou makhia atu she e ccungccaw hae hynh zo lan khyh hae. <verse number="35" style="v" />Vaaw te laephi tuh azo cih, thuasalama ka bya tuh zo lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Nin te Ccyh Ny Thua Khyh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:32-37">Mar 13.32-37</ref>; Luk 17.26-30, 34-36)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“Thuasalama tuh-e nin te ccyh tuh hum nynh sanmah nyh khyh, vaawlang umpaw vaaw hae nynh mah nyh khyh hae, Ccapaw nynh mah nyh khyh, Paaw rou nynh a nyh. <verse number="37" style="v" />Noah she lya hawte nynh Ccungccaw Ccapaw yn thuanaw ccyh tuh yn cyihkuh cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:5-8">Gen 6.5-8</ref></char></note> <verse number="38" style="v" />Pawccecize tuipayn a ynku maw, Noah nynh sanphalung lungkhu lang a tee nin cia, ccungccaw hae tuh aete, niate, zudykute, zudypyakute a um hae. <verse number="39" style="v" />Tuipayn nynh a lou maw hae cia pawte nynh yn cyihkuh cih cipaw nyh khyh hae; tuhawte nynh Ccungccaw Ccapaw yn thua ccyh mah yn cyihkuh cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 7:6-24">Gen 7.6-24</ref></char></note> <verse number="40" style="v" />Tuin ccyh kya tuh loo kya um hae paw lu ning kyaze lu kheit kha law athua cih zah lu kheit tuh cciataw athua cih. <verse number="41" style="v" />Sungsuh hae paw nopi hae lu ning kyaze lu kheit kha law athua cih zah lu kheit tuh cciataw athua cih. <verse number="42" style="v" />Tukeiccuze nae Bawipaw tuh hohtuh nin nynh yn thua cih cipaw kha na ny khyh oh keiccuze paccynkute la ngaw oh. <verse number="43" style="v" />Thuasalama e hynh nyh oh; inn hoitupaw nynh miruh yn thua lanpaw accyh kha a ny ze, miruh nynh a inn kha a kiabia khyh nawlan phang a ngaw cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.43-44: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:39-40">Luk 12.39-40</ref></char></note> <verse number="44" style="v" />Tukeiccuze nanning mah raeringkute um oh, pawccecize na tua khyh oh ccyh lyakhe Ccungccaw Ccapaw tuh yn thua cih.</para>
  <para style="s1">See Phuin Ning</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:41-48">Luk 12.41-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />“Tuhte athua lanze inn hoitupaw nynh a inn kya-e ccungccaw hae kha a uktu lang te accyh azaw vae ze looh a pyatu lang a nungpaw a lungzipaw te a hawpaw see tuh hummou athua? <verse number="46" style="v" />Tuhte rya a lawpaw kha a bawipaw nynh yn thua zah a muihpyapaw see tuh lungtuapaw nynh thua. <verse number="47" style="v" />Byaccaccing kae hopya oh, a bawipaw nynh tuh-e see kha a uccaw balyn a do-oihtu lang a nung cih. <verse number="48" style="v" />Thuasalama see hoy leipaw nynh, ‘Ka bawipaw yn thuanaw ccyh tuh aro ung cih,’ cite a lungkaw te tua zah, <verse number="49" style="v" />a ban hae see hae kha a bua hae, te a neih hae paw ryte aete niate a um vae. <verse number="50" style="v" />Tuh-e see nynh a tua khyh ccyh te a ny khyh ccyh lyakhe a bawipaw tuh mang yn thua cih. <verse number="51" style="v" />A bawipaw nynh tuh-e see tuh palae tui lan a pae cih zah thyaruh hae ryte a nungkheih cih hae; tuin kya rawnaw te hawzynaw a um cih.</para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Liaccaw Lu Haw Tousenaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Vaawlang peenaw tuh zudy ccangvaepaw kha cciadue lan mih maeekhua kha ccyngkuh hae zah a cceih hae paw liaccaw lu haw te nynh aloku.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:35">Luk 12.35</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Minmin kyaze lu pangaw tuh haw hae zah lu pangaw tuh a ngaee hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />A ngaee hae paw nynh mih maeekhua kha ccyngkuh hae zah zine ccyngku bia khyh hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Thuasalama a haw hae paw nynh mih maeekhua ryte abawng kya zine kha a ccyngku bia hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Zudy ccangvaepaw tuh khaw yn ro keiccuze minmin balyn tuh mih ngawthua zah a ihtheih hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Ziraccyng khe, ‘Dotua oh! Zudy ccangvaepaw yn thua vae; amaw kha cciadue khylan oun toikuh ccavae oh,’ cite roi accae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Tetuh tuh-e liaccaw hae balyn tuh tho hae zah mih maeekhua kha a paccynku hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />A ngaee hae paw nynh a haw hae paw kha, ‘Nae zine abang kha oun pyabua oh, pawccecize kae maeekhua tuh achih vae cih,’ a cipya hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Thuasalama a haw hae paw nynh, ‘Tuhte thua khyh! Kae hanlan te nae hanlan zaw lan khyh, a zua hae paw kalan la cceih oh lah la rekuh oh,’ a cipya hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Te minmin nynh zine reku lan a ccia lya hae khe, zudy ccangvaepaw tuh yn thua vae; paccynkute um hae paw tuh amaw ryte zudy poi kalan tee hae zah thuakaw kha phe a khaw vae hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Tukoute ccangpaw liaccaw hae tuh mah oun thua hae zah, ‘Bawipaw, bawipaw, kaening mah oun hungpah bua!’ a ci hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25.11-12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 13:25">Luk 13.25</ref></char></note> <verse number="12" style="v" />Thuasalama aning nynh, ‘Byaccaccing kae hopya oh, nanning kha kae nyh khyh oh,’ cite a khung hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Tukeiccuze nanning nynh Ccungccaw Ccapaw yn thuanaw lanpaw nin te ccyh kha na ny khyh oh keiccuze phang la ngaw oh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Ryalahtu Lu Thum Tousenaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 19:11-27">Luk 19.11-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Vaawlang peenaw tuh ccungccaw lu kheit nynh asawnaw ram lang khuaccong lan noukuh zah a see hae kha ko hae zah a uccaw hae kha a rinsah hae paw hawte nynh athua. <verse number="15" style="v" />Mih cyi khonaw ciate a pyasya hae, lu kheit kha talent ccangpangaw a pya, lu kheit kha ccangning a pya, lu kheit kha ccangkheit a pya; tukoute khuaccong lan a cceih. <verse number="16" style="v" />Talent ccangpangaw a muepaw nynh cceih kangmaw zah kungku zah ccangpaw talent ccangpangaw amia a mue. <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuhawte talent ccangning a muepaw nynh mah ccangpaw talent ccangning amia a mue. <verse number="18" style="v" />Thuasalama talent ccangkheit a muepaw nynh cceih zah laephi kha thae zah a bawipaw phua kha zya a thuruh. <verse number="19" style="v" />“Ccyh khaw aro koute tuh-e see hae mih bawipaw tuh yn thua zah minmin ryte ccazing a tua hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Phua talent ccangpangaw a muepaw nynh yn thua zah ccangpaw talent ccangpangaw kha yn ccyngbia zah, ‘Bawipaw, kae kha talent ccangpangaw nae pya; dotua, amia talent ccangpangaw ka mue chih,’ a cipya. <verse number="21" style="v" />A bawipaw nynh tuh-e paw tuh, ‘Ahoy, a lungzipaw see hoypaw, uccaw beihtarawpaw kya na lungzi keiccuze uccaw patae a rintu lang kae nung cih, na bawipaw kya-e lungtuanaw lungkhu lang teebua,’ a cipya. <verse number="22" style="v" />Talent ccangning a muepaw mah yn thua zah, ‘Bawipaw, kae kha talent ccangning nae pya; dotua, ccangpaw talent ccangning amia ka mue,’ a cipya. <verse number="23" style="v" />A bawipaw nynh, ‘Ahoy, a lungzipaw see hoypaw, uccaw beihtarawpaw kya nang tuh na lungzi keiccuze uccaw patae a rintu lang kae nung cih; na bawipaw kya-e lungtuanaw lungkhu lang teebua,’ a cipya. <verse number="24" style="v" />Te talent ccangkheit a muepaw nynh yn thua zah, ‘Bawipaw, nang tuh myarya a reipaw ccungccaw, na ccouku leinaw kya na ruekuhpaw te ccacii na vuaku leinaw kya na ruekuhpaw nynh na thua cipaw ka ny. <verse number="25" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ka rih, te ka cceih zah na phua kha laephi kya ka thuruh; dotua, na uccaw tuh hein kya phang a um,’ a cipya. <verse number="26" style="v" />A bawipaw nynh, ‘Seethya seeruhpaw te thawnawpaw! Ka ccouku leinaw kya ka ruekupaw te ccacii ka vua leinaw kya ka ruepaw kha na nyh tou? <verse number="27" style="v" />Tukeiccuze nang nynh ka phua kha ban kya na nung lan accan, tuhteze tuh he kae thua te ka phua tuh ato ryte ka mue cih. <verse number="28" style="v" />Tukeiccuze phua kha a kyate lah oh lah phua talent ccanghaw a hoipaw kha pya oh. <verse number="29" style="v" />Pawccecize a hoipaw ccungccaw miakaw kha pyachih athua cih zah patae a hoi cih; thuasalama a hoi leipaw ccungccaw kya-e a hoi thypaw kha heize lawpya athua cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25.29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:12">Mat 13.12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:25">Mar 4.25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:18">Luk 8.18</ref></char></note> <verse number="30" style="v" />Nanning nynh ccungkia leipaw see kha rawnaw te hawzynaw a umnaw atolang mohnaw lungkhu lang dae vua oh,’ a cipya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25.30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 8:12">Mat 8.12</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 22:13">22.13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:28">Luk 13.28</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Tuu te Miaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Ccungccaw Ccapaw tuh a vaaw hae balyn ryte a phu-enaw te he yn rung te, a phu-enaw bawitungkhung kya yn haung cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25.31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:27">Mat 16.27</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 19:28">19.28</ref></char></note> <verse number="32" style="v" />Te minphuin hae balyn kha a malang khe yn pum cih hae; tuurinpaw nynh a tuu hae kha miaa hae kyate a phia hawte aning nynh minmin kha yn phia cih hae. <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuu hae kha a ranglang yn nung cih hae zah miaa hae kha a voilang yn nung cih hae. <verse number="34" style="v" />Tukoute siapharan nynh a ranglang um hae paw kha, ‘Ka Paaw kya-e lungtua hae paw nanning, rang oh; laephi athonaw aleihpaw kyate nae hanlan paccynpaw peenaw rho hynh ccou oh. <verse number="35" style="v" />Pawccecize ka vuelaw lya looh nae dang oh, ka tuihaw lya tui nae niasah oh, mikhia lang ka tang lya innccong nae ua oh; <verse number="36" style="v" />Ka sasete ka um lya boeining nae pya oh, ka cci lya nae do-oih oh, thonginn ka um lya nae via oh,’ yn cipah cih hae. <verse number="37" style="v" />Miding hae nynh, ‘Bawipaw, hohtuh lya mou na vuelawpaw kae muih zah looh kae dang; na tuihawpaw kae muih zah nia lanpaw kae pya? <verse number="38" style="v" />Hohtuh lya mou mikhia lang na tangpaw kha kae muih zah kae inn kae thuasah; na sasete na um zah boeining kae pya? <verse number="39" style="v" />Hohtuh lya mou na ccipaw te thonginn na umpaw kha kae muih zah kae via?’ cite oun khung cih hae. <verse number="40" style="v" />Siapharan nynh, ‘Byaccaccing kae hopya oh, e ka uno hae kyaze adih huapaw lu kheit tungvaw na cyi oh paw miakaw tuh ka tungvaw na cyi oh paw nynh thua,’ a cipah cih hae. <verse number="41" style="v" />Te a voilang um hae paw kha mah, ‘Thyalaw athua hae paw nanning, ka kyate cceih oh lah, Satan te a vaaw hae hanlan paccynpyapaw zungzae aruapaw maee lungkhu langkhe cceih oh. <verse number="42" style="v" />Pawccecize ka vuelaw lya looh nae dang khyh oh, ka tuihaw lya nia lanpaw nae pya khyh oh. <verse number="43" style="v" />Mikhia lang ka tang lya nae inn nae thuasah khyh oh; ka sasete ka um lya boeining nae pya khyh oh; ka cci lya te thonginn ka um lya nae via khyh oh,’ cite yn ci cih hae. <verse number="44" style="v" />Tetuh minmin nynh, ‘Bawipaw, hohtuh lya mou na vuelawpaw, na tuihawpaw, mikhia lang na tangpaw, sasete na umpaw, na ccipaw, thonginn na umpaw kha kae muih zah do-oih leite kae um?’ cite oun khung cih hae. <verse number="45" style="v" />Tetuh siapharan nynh, ‘Byaccaccing kae hopya oh, e hae lakuze adih huapaw lu kheit tungvaw na cyi khyh oh paw miakaw kha ka tungvaw na cyi khyh oh paw nynh thua,’ cite yn khung cih hae. <verse number="46" style="v" />E hae tuh zungzae detahnaw lungkhu lang a cceih cih hae, thuasalama miding hae tuh zungzae hiinnaw lungkhu lang a cceih cih hae,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25.46: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:2">Dan 12.2</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Jesu Chia lan Pheenaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mar 14.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk 22.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Joh 11.45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesu nynh e bya hae balyn hynh a ho koute a zuitu hae kha, <verse number="2" style="v" />“Nin ning koute Kawtaw Poi a um cih cipaw na ny oh, Ccungccaw Ccapaw tuh vaelantung kya khiade khylan ap athua cih,” a cipya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Exo 12.1-27</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tetuh ranpibawi lepaw hae te piccan hae tuh Kaiafas a ci hae paw ranpibawi lupi inn kya oun tungkuh hae zah, <verse number="4" style="v" />Jesu kha aruh lante kyng lan zah chia lan cite khua a khanku hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Thuasalama, “Ccungccaw hae oun pokuh sei cih hae, poi nin tuh chia lei lan,” a ci hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Bethani kya Zimuin A Thuh hae</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mar 14.3-9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Joh 12.1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jesu tuh Bethani khua kya vaethyakaepaw Simon inn kya a um lyakhe, <verse number="7" style="v" />nopinung lu kheit nynh myarya amee rupaw zimuin alabasta lung rawpaw bu kheit kha Jesu kalan yn ccyng zah ae lan cite a haung lyakhe a lu kya a bu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 7:37-38">Luk 7.37-38</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v" />A zuitu hae nynh a muih hae tuh mih thinria zah, “Pawccemou e hynh alakaw lan a tangsah han? <verse number="9" style="v" />Pawccecize e zimuin hynh phua patae lang zuate ryachi hae kha pya lanpaw,” a ci hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuh-e tuh Jesu nynh he a nyh tuh minmin kha, “Pawccemou nopinung kha vawsaw na pya oh? Aning nynh ka tungvaw ahoypaw rya kha a law vae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Pawccecize ryachi hae tuh nae kya zungzae a um hae, thuasalama kae tuh nae kya zungzae ka um lan khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 15:11">Deu 15.11</ref></char></note> <verse number="12" style="v" />Pawccecize ka pyn kya hynh-e zimuin yn bupaw tuh ka rhua ccynaw elang a paccynpaw nynh thua. <verse number="13" style="v" />Byaccaccing kae hopya oh, laephi pynpi kya hynh-e thehoypaw a honaw hae miakaw kya hynh-e nopinung nynh a cyipaw hynh amaw liathui nawlan hobia athua cih,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Judas Iskariot nynh A Nawccaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Mar 14.10-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luk 22.3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Zuitu lu haw lae ning kyaze lu kheit athuapaw, Judas Iskariot a ci hae paw nynh ranpibawi lepaw hae kalan cceih zah, <verse number="15" style="v" />“Jesu kha nae kalan kae ap oh ze pawmou nae pya cih oh?” cite a khia hae. Minmin nynh ngunphua sung thum kha ria hae zah a pya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 11:12">Zek 11.12</ref></char></note> <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuin ccyh kyate Judas nynh Jesu phee lanpaw ccyhhoy kha a ccung vae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Bawipaw Zerya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mar 14.12-21</ref>; Luk 22.7-13, 21-23; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Joh 13.21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ransi phing leipaw Sanlou Poi masaty nin khe zuitu hae nynh Jesu kalan oun cceih hae zah, “Kawtaw Poi na ae nawlan pawkyamou kae la paccynpah cih?” cite a khia hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Jesu nynh, “Khua lungkhu lang la cceih oh lah ccungccapaw lu kheit kha, ‘Sazaepaw nynh ka ccyh anae vae, ka zuitu hae ryte na inn kya Kawtaw Poi kae mang cih, a ci,’ cite la hopah oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Jesu nynh a hopya hae hawte zuitu hae nynh cyih hae zah Kawtaw Poi zerya kha a paccyn hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Zete ccyh yn thua te Jesu tuh lu haw lae ning ryte ae lan a haung hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />A ae lya hae khe Jesu nynh, “Byaccaccing kae hopya oh, nanning laku e lu kheit nynh kae hynh yn phee cih,” a ci. <verse number="22" style="v" />Tetuh minmin tuh myaryamaw mih ngaethah zah, “Bawipaw, tuh-e paw tuh kae ka thua khyh khaw?” cite lu kheit koute lu kheit nynh a khia hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Jesu nynh, “Kae te pake kya kae pukheihpaw nynh yn phee cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 41:9">Sam 41.9</ref></char></note> <verse number="24" style="v" />Ccathyaa kya amaw kong azeiku thyhte Ccungccaw Ccapaw tuh a chih cih; thuasalama Ccungccaw Ccapaw a pheetupaw hanlan ngaethya lan kou um! Tuh-e paw tuh a la pui khyh ze amaw hanlan ahoyhua cih paw,” a cipya hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Te amaw a pheetu Judas nynh, “Sazae, kamaw tou ka thua?” a ci. Jesu nynh, “Phe na ho vae latu,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Zete zerya a mang lya hae khe Jesu nynh sanlou kha lah zah lungtuabya a ho koute eih zah a zuitu hae kha a pya hae; te, “Lawkuh oh lah ae oh, e tuh ka pyn nynh thua,” a cipya hae. <verse number="27" style="v" />Tukoute banang kha lah zah lungtuabya a ho koute minmin kha pya hae zah, “Nae balynte e hynh neih oh; <verse number="28" style="v" />pawccecize e tuh ccungccaw patae seingaethyanaw hanlan ka laepaw, byakin thawpaw te asekuhpaw ka chiise nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:8">Exo 24.8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:31-34">Jer 31.31-34</ref></char></note> <verse number="29" style="v" />Nanning kha kae hopya oh, ka Paaw peenaw kya nanning ryte misutui thawpaw ah niakheih mawlaezung oh, hynhcihawpaw misutui hynh ka neih boi vae lan khyh,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hlaw hlakheit a sah kou hae te Oliv Mua lang a cceih hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Peter nynh A Vua lanpaw A Hoty</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mar 14.27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk 22.31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Joh 13.36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jesu nynh minmin kha, “Atu khuazi kya nae balynte nae ccuetaw cih oh; pawccecize Ccathya kyaze,</para>
  <para style="q1">‘Tuurinpaw kha ka bua cih zah</para>
  <para style="q2">tuuphu kya-e tuu hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">pong a phiakuh cih hae,’ cite azeikuh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 13:7">Zek 13.7</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Thuasalama ka thoothui koute nae malang Galilee lang ka la cceih ty cih,” a cipya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:16">Mat 28.16</ref></char></note> <verse number="33" style="v" />Peter nynh Jesu kha, “Ming hae balyn nynh ae ccuetaw hae zemah kae tuh kharouh kae ccuetaw lan khyh,” a cipya. <verse number="34" style="v" />Jesu nynh Peter kha, “Byaccaccing kae hopya, atu khuazi aw a khua mawze vae thum nae vua cih,” a cipya. <verse number="35" style="v" />Peter nynh, “Nang te chikheih lan accan zemah nang kha kae vua lan khyh,” a cipya. Tuh-e hawte zuitu hae balyn nynh mah a cibua hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Kethsemane kya Jesu Sawsang</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mar 14.32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luk 22.39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Jesu tuh zuitu hae ryte Kethsemane a ci hae paw hmin kya thua hae zah minmin kyakhe, “Khuhlang khuin ka la cceih cih zah saw ka sang loukaw hein kya la haung hin oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="37" style="v" />Peter te Zebedi ccaaw hae lu ning kha a hoeibua hae; te a ngaethah zah a lungvawsaw takaw vae. <verse number="38" style="v" />Minmin kyakhe, “Chikhaeku lan ciate myaryamaw ka lungriathae; hein kya um oh lah kamaw ryte ngaw oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="39" style="v" />Te takyh asawnaw lang a cceih koute laekhu kya bakhung zah, “Pou ka Paaw, athua kho ze e banang nynh kae hynh yn kawtaw sah; thuasalama kae ka ry hawte thua nan sah, na ry hawte thua sah,” cite saw a sang. <verse number="40" style="v" />Te zuitu hae kalan thua zah a ih hae paw kha a muih, te Peter kha, “Pawte! Suimilan ccangkheit san nae ngaw kho khyh oh tou? <verse number="41" style="v" />Tuhounaw lungkhu lang na ccaw khyh nawlan oh sawsangte ngaw oh; thinlung nynh tuh a ry ccaccing, thuasalama pynsaw tuh a thawzya,” a cipya. <verse number="42" style="v" />Vae ningnaw bua cceih zah, “Ka Paaw, hynh-e banang hynh kae nynh nia leite athua kho khyh ze na rynaw hawte cyihkuh sah,” cite saw a sang. <verse number="43" style="v" />Tukoute a zuitu hae kalan bua yn thua zah mih mit tuh daekuh vae khyh zah a ih hae paw kha a muih. <verse number="44" style="v" />Minmin kha bua cciataw hae zah a cceih koute sawsang zah a homaepaw kha bua aho. <verse number="45" style="v" />Tukoute a zuitu hae kalan yn thua zah minmin kha, “Na ih ung oh zah na haeung ung oh tou? Dotua oh, Ccungccaw Ccapaw tuh misei hae kuih kalan pyanaw ccyh yn thua vae. <verse number="46" style="v" />Tho oh, cceih ccavae oh sih; dotua oh, kae yn pheepaw tuh yn thua vae,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu Kyngnaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mar 14.43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk 22.47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Joh 18.3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Jesu nynh bya a ho cciamang lyakhe lu haw lae ning kyaze lu kheit athuapaw Judas tuh ranpibawi lepaw hae te piccan hae nynh oun saw hae paw ccungccaw zapi ryte thaloi te tungbang ccyngkute oun thua vae hae. <verse number="48" style="v" />Te amaw a pheetupaw nynh syntawnaw pya hae zah, “Kae nynh kae myngpaw tuh na kyng ry oh paw ccungccaw kha thua zah nae kyng cih oh,” cite a hopya hae. <verse number="49" style="v" />Judas tuh Jesu kalan palou yn cceih zah, “Sazae, na tungvaw daenaw um sah!” cite byabeih zah a myng. <verse number="50" style="v" />Jesu nynh, “Ka ban, cyi lan na paccynkupaw kha cyih ccaleih,” a cipya. Te minmin nynh oun thua hae zah Jesu kha kyng hae zah a he hae. <verse number="51" style="v" />Tetuh Jesu te a umkheih hae paw lu kheitpaw nynh a thaloi kha thuaakuh zah ranpibawi lupi seepaw kha a nakua thoh pae lan a bae. <verse number="52" style="v" />Jesu nynh tuh-e paw kha, “Na thaloi kha a bu lungkhu lang sang; pawccecize thaloi a kyngpaw balyn tuh thaloi te a chih cih hae. <verse number="53" style="v" />Ka Paaw nynh vaaw hae kha rhawkawphu haw lae ning lae alung lan palou yn sawpya nawlan ka Paaw kalan ngiakuh kho lan khyh cite tou na tua? <verse number="54" style="v" />Thuasalama tuhte a la thua lanze, Ccathyaa nynh, ‘Hynhte acyikuh cih,’ a cipaw kha pawtemou accing vae cih?” a cipya. <verse number="55" style="v" />Tuin ccyh kyakhe Jesu nynh ccungccaw zapi kha, “Kae hynh miruh hawte kyng khylan thaloi te, tungbang te nae ccianua oh tou? Beikinn kya ka haung zah nin takyh kae ccangpya lya oh ze nae kyng khyh oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.55: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 19:47">Luk 19.47</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 21:37">21.37</ref></char></note> <verse number="56" style="v" />Thuasalama profeh hae kya-e Ccathyaa accing nawlan nynh hynh-e balyn hynh acyiku,” a cipya hae. Tetuh zuitu hae balyn nynh amaw kha cciataw hae zah a ccuetaw vae hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Ranpibawi Lupi malang Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:53-65">Mar 14.53-65</ref>; Luk 22.54-55, 63-71; Joh 18.13-14, 19-24)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />A kyngtu hae nynh Jesu kha kawbya sazae hae te piccan hae a sueluakunaw hae ranpibawi lupi Kaiafas kalan a cciakhae hae. <verse number="58" style="v" />Peter nynh ranpibawi lupi maepaw kyacia asawnaw te amaw kha a zui; maepaw langkhe teebua zah nyathyakou pawtemah yn cyiku cipaw muih khylan rhawviatu hae kyakhe a haungbua. <verse number="59" style="v" />Ranpibawi lepaw hae te kungsi hae balyn nynh Jesu kha chia khylan ahme leipaw ccaekia kha a ccungpya hae, <verse number="60" style="v" />thuasalama muih khyh hae; ahme leipaw ccaekia patae oun thua hae zemah a seinaw kha muih khyh hae. Nyathyakou kya ahme leipaw ccaekia lu ning oun thua hae zah, <verse number="61" style="v" />“E paw nynh, ‘Pachia beikinn hynh ka phou cih zah nin thum lungkhu ka sakthui kho cih,’ a ci,” cite a ho hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.61: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:19">Joh 2.19</ref></char></note> <verse number="62" style="v" />Ranpibawi lupi nynh thadyn zah Jesu kha, “Kaw kheit san na khung khyh hae rei, ccaekia ae khangnua hae paw hynh pawtemou athua?” a cipya. <verse number="63" style="v" />Thuasalama Jesu tuh yccae khyh. Te ranpibawi lupi nynh, “A hiinpaw Pachia min phyate thyalawkute bya na kinkuh cih; nang hynh Pachia Ccapaw Messiah na thua tou, na thua khyh tou oun hopya tua,” a cipya. <verse number="64" style="v" />Jesu nynh, “Nang nynh phe na ho vae latu. Thuasalama kae hopya oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">Atu koute Ccungccaw Ccapaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">Alesaepaw a ranglang</para>
  <para style="q1">a haungpaw te vaawlang e</para>
  <para style="q2">maeking kyate yn rungpaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">nae muih cih oh,” a cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.64: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan 7.13</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Te ranpibawi lupi nynh a boeining kha seii zah, “Pachia saryanaw bya kha a ho vae! Ccangpaw ccaekia ho vae khyh. Pachia saryanaw bya a hopaw kha atu phe na thae vae oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.65-66: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:16">Lev 24.16</ref></char></note> <verse number="66" style="v" />Pawte na tua oh?” a cipya hae. Minmin nynh, “Aning tuh chi lan accan,” a ci hae. <verse number="67" style="v" />Te a mae kha thoi hae zah a thung hae, abang nynh mih kuihphe te bia hae zah,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.67: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 50:6">Isa 50.6</ref></char></note> <verse number="68" style="v" />“Messiah, hummou ae bia? Profehbya te oun hopya tua!” a ci hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Peter nynh Jesu A vua</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Mar 14.66-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luk 22.56-62</ref>; Joh 18.15-18, 25-27)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />Peter tuh atolang maepaw kya a haung lyakhe ryalawpahtunung lu kheit nynh a kalan yn cceih zah, “Nang hynh mah Galilee paw Jesu ryte na umkheih oh paw khaw?” a cipya. <verse number="70" style="v" />Thuasalama Peter nynh mih balyn malang khe pheikuh zah, “Paw kong nynh na ho cipaw ka nyh khyh,” a cipya. <verse number="71" style="v" />Te Peter tuh maepaw sakoih kalan he a cceih te, ccangpaw ryalawpahtunung nynh muih zah tuin kya a um hae paw kyakhe, “E paw hynh Nazareth paw Jesu ryte a umkheih hae paw nynh thua,” cite a hopya hae. <verse number="72" style="v" />Thuasalama Peter nynh thyalawkute, “Tuh-e paw tuh ka nyh khyh,” cite bua a pheiku. <verse number="73" style="v" />Sosoh acih te tuin kya a thadyn hae paw nynh Peter kalan oun thua hae zah, “Thanccingte nang hynh mah minmin kya a mungkuh buapaw lu kheit nynh na thua, pawccecize na byange nynh phe ae phy,” a ci hae. <verse number="74" style="v" />Peter nynh, “Tuh-e paw tuh ka nyh khyh,” cite thyalawkuh zah bya a kinku. Tuh ccyh lyakhe aw yn khua vae. <verse number="75" style="v" />Jesu nynh, “Aw a khua mawze vae thum cia nae vua cih,” cite a hopyapaw bya kha Peter nynh a liathui vae. Te atolang pou zah thawmawte a rah.</para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Pilat kalan Jesu Cciakhaenaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:1">Mar 15.1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-2">Luk 23.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-32">Joh 18.28-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Awkhua takaw khe ranpibawi lepaw hae te piccan hae balyn nynh Jesu kha chia lante khua a khan hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Jesu kha a he kou hae te cciakhae hae zah ram uktu Pilat kalan a pya hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Judas nynh Amaw A Chiaku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jesu a pheetupaw Judas nynh Jesu kha chia lan seibe vae hae cipaw he a nyh tuh ngaesikuh zah ngunphua sung thum kha ranpibawi lepaw hae te piccan hae kalan bua ccyng zah,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.3-8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:18-19">Loc 1.18-19</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v" />“Seinaw a hoi leipaw ccungccaw chii kha ka pheepaw tuh phe ka sei vae,” a cipya hae. Minmin nynh, “Tuh-e tuh kaening te pawmou asekuh? Na ry hawte la cyih,” a ci hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Judas nynh ngunphua tuh beikinn lungkhu dae vua zah a cciataw; te cceih zah amaw te amaw a nging okuh zah a chih. <verse number="6" style="v" />Te ranpibawi lepaw hae nynh ngunphua kha khuin hae zah, “E phua hynh chiise mee athua keiccuze Beikinn sisua ccynaw kya nung lan ccan khyh,” a ci hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Minmin nynh khuakhan hae zah ramccang hae uu nawlan cite ang raetupaw loo kha tuh-e phua te a re hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Tukeiccuze tuh-e loo tuh, ‘Chii Loo’ cite atunin cia a ko hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuhcite profeh Jeremiah nynh, “Israel ccungccaw hae nynh amee a khya hae paw ccungccapaw mee ngunphua sung thum kha lah hae zah,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.9-10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 11:12-13">Zek 11.12-13</ref></char></note> <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawipaw nynh kaw yn pya thyhte tuh-e phua tuh ang raetupaw loo mee lang a pya hae,” cite a hopaw bya tuh yn ccing vae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Pilat malang Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:2-5">Mar 15.2-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:3-5">Luk 23.3-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:33-38">Joh 18.33-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jesu tuh ram uktu malang thadyn zah ram uktu nynh, “Nang hynh Judah hae Siapharan na thua tou?” cite a khia. Jesu nynh, “Na ho hawte nynh thua,” a cipya. <verse number="12" style="v" />Thuasalama ranpibawi lepaw hae te piccan hae nynh amaw kha seibe hae zah kaw kheit san khung khyh hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Pilat nynh, “Minmin nynh seinaw patae ae be hae paw tuh na thae khyh tou?” a cipya. <verse number="14" style="v" />Jesu nynh bya kaw kheit san khung khyh, tukeiccuze ram uktu tuh myarya a ngaeangthua.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu Chia lan Byapia hae</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mar 15.6-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk 23.13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:6">Joh 18.39—19.6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kawtaw Poi vae ze ccungccaw zapi nynh pousah lan a ry hae paw thongccahpaw lu kheit kha ram uktu nynh leih a sawpya hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuh ccyh lyakhe Barabbas a ci hae paw a minthaanpaw thongccahpaw lu kheit a um. <verse number="17" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ccungccaw zapi tuh he oun pumkuh hae te Pilat nynh minmin kha, “Nanning nynh hummou nae sawsah ry oh? Barabbas tou, tuhkhyhze Messiah cikuhpaw Jesu tou?” cite a khia hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Pawccecize ranpibawi lepaw hae nynh mih eiung keiccu nynh Jesu kha a ap hae cipaw Pilat nynh phe a ny. <verse number="19" style="v" />Pilat tuh byapianaw tungkhung vawlan he a haung tuh, a zu nynh ccungccaw yn saw zah, “Khah-e midingpaw kha pawpaw mah la cyih nan; pawccecize khah-e paw keiccuze atazi ka maan kya myarya ka teing,” cite bya a taw. <verse number="20" style="v" />Ranpibawi lepaw hae te piccan hae nynh Barabbas a lue nawlan ngia lan zah Jesu kha chiasah lan cite ccungccaw zapi kha a hyy hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Ram uktu nynh, “Hynh-e lu ning hae kyaze hum hynh mou nae hanlan nae sawsah ry oh?” cite minmin kha a khia hae. Minmin nynh, “Barabbas,” a ci hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Pilat nynh, “Tuhteze Messiah cikuhpaw Jesu hynh pawtemou ka cyih cih?” cite a khia hae. Minmin balyn nynh, “Aning tuh vaelantung kya khiade thua sah,” a ci hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Te ram uktu nynh, “Pawccemou, paw seinaw mou a rae?” cite a khia hae. Thuasalama minmin nynh, “Aning tuh vaelantung kya khiade thua sah,” cite houh a sia hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pilat nynh pawpawte mah ka tae kho vae lan khyh hae, keisukeilae houh yn um vae cih hae cipaw kha he a muih tuh tui kha lawkuh zah ccungccaw zapi malang a kuih kha singkuh zah, “E midingpaw chiise kyahin kae tuh ka thyaa, e tuh naemaw nynh cyih oh,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 21:6-9">Deu 21.6-9</ref></char></note> <verse number="25" style="v" />Ccungccaw balyn nynh, “E paw chiise tuh kae tungvaw te kae ccaaw hae tungvaw kya ccah vae sah,” a ci hae. <verse number="26" style="v" />Te Pilat nynh Barabbas kha mih kalan a sawpya hae. Jesu kha buasah hae zah vaelantung kya khiade lan a ap vae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Rhawkaw hae nynh A Sarya hae</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:16-20">Mar 15.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Joh 19.2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Te ram uktu a rhawkaw hae nynh Jesu kha ram uktu inn langkhe cciakhae hae zah rhawkawphu phu kheit kha abalynte Jesu pe khe a pum hae. <verse number="28" style="v" />A boeining kha phae hae zah boei sepaw kha a zingsaku hae. <verse number="29" style="v" />Hinpaw kha lukhung lang a khepah kou hae te a lu vawlan a khungsah hae, a ranglang kuih kya phaeku kha a ccyngsah hae; a malang khe mih ccukharutung hae zah, “Judah hae Siapharan tuh a she sae vae sah!” cite a sarya hae. <verse number="30" style="v" />Mih tuing te a thoi hae, phaeku kha lawkuh hae zah a lu kha a bua hae. <verse number="31" style="v" />Jesu kha a sarya kou hae te boei sepaw kha khah hae zah amaw a boeining kha bua a lawsahku hae, te vaelantung kya khiade lan a cciakhae hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu Khiadenaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mar 15.21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk 23.26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Joh 19.17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Minmin nynh a ccia lya hae khe Sairen khuapaw Simon cikuhpaw kha he muih hae tuh Jesu vaelantung kha puih lan a riase hae. <verse number="33" style="v" />Luru Hmin a ci hae paw Golgotha cikuhpaw hmin kya he a thua hae te, <verse number="34" style="v" />akhahpaw te apykuhpaw misutui ariapaw kha nia lan a pya hae; Jesu nynh taangtua zah neih ry khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:21">Sam 69.21</ref></char></note> <verse number="35" style="v" />Jesu kha vaelantung kya a khiade kou hae te, a boeining kha ccungthydungte a neeku hae;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Sam 22.18</ref></char></note> <verse number="36" style="v" />tukoute tuin kya haung hae zah Jesu kha phang a ngaw hae. <verse number="37" style="v" />“E paw tuh Judah hae Siapharan Jesu nynh thua,” cite sei a benaw hae paw ccaw kha zei hae zah a lu luki khe a taw hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Damiah hae lu ning kha Jesu ryte a ranglang lu kheit, a voilang lu kheit vaelantung kya a khiade hae. <verse number="39" style="v" />Laanpi kya a cceih bungthung hae paw nynh amaw kha a sarya hae, mih lu thuhpah hae zah,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:7">Sam 22.7</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 109:25">109.25</ref></char></note> <verse number="40" style="v" />“Beikinn kha phou zah nin thum lungkhu a sakthuipaw nang, namaw te namaw kha khumku tua! Pachia Ccapaw na thua ze vaelantung kyate yn rungtua!” a ci hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:61">Mat 26.61</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:19">Joh 2.19</ref></char></note> <verse number="41" style="v" />Tuhawte kawbya sazae hae, piccan hae te ranpibawi lepaw hae nynh mah sarya hae zah, <verse number="42" style="v" />“Aning nynh ming hae ze khum hae zah amaw ze khumkuh kho khyh. Aning tuh Israel Siapharan nynh thua; atumaw vaelantung kyate yn rungtua sah lah amaw kha kae zyn cih. <verse number="43" style="v" />Aning tuh Pachia kha a doliakuh, Pachia nynh a ry ze atumaw luesah tua sah; pawccecize, ‘Kae tuh Pachia Ccapaw nynh ka thua,’ a ciku,” a ci hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.43: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:8">Sam 22.8</ref></char></note> <verse number="44" style="v" />Amaw ryte vaelantung kya a khiade hae paw damiah hae nynh mah tuhawte a saryabua hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu A Chih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mar 15.33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk 23.44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Joh 19.28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Ninthuccynglyn kyate zete suimilan ccangthum cia ram balyn tuh pong amoh. <verse number="46" style="v" />Zete suimilan ccangthum loukaw khe Jesu nynh, “Eli, Eli, lama sabakthani,” cite thawte a sia. Asuilan tuh, ‘Ka Pachia, ka Pachia, pawccemou nae vua?’ cipaw nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.46: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:1">Sam 22.1</ref></char></note> <verse number="47" style="v" />Tuin kya a thadyn hae paw abang nynh tuh-e tuh thae hae zah, “E paw nynh Elijah kha a ko,” a ci hae. <verse number="48" style="v" />Minmin lakuze lu kheit nynh ccue kangmaw zah boeipuepaw kha lah zah misutui ariapaw kyakhe a dung koute ccungngue dung khe heede zah nia lan a pya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.48: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:21">Sam 69.21</ref></char></note> <verse number="49" style="v" />Tuhlae hae nynh, “Umtua hin, e paw khum khylan Elijah tuh yn thua ta, yn thua khyh ta dotua hin oh sih,” a ci hae. <verse number="50" style="v" />Jesu tuh thawte bua a sia koute a hy athang vae. <verse number="51" style="v" />Tuh ccyh lyatuin beikinn lungkhu a zo hae paw boei tuh alu te alia cia zung ning lang aseiikuh. Innrysuekuh zah lungpi hae akoi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.51: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 26:31-33">Exo 26.31-33</ref></char></note> <verse number="52" style="v" />Shaw hae hungkuh zah a ih hae paw mithyaa hae pyn patae tuh a thoo hae. <verse number="53" style="v" />Jesu a thoothui koute shaw hae kyate oun pou hae zah khua thyaapaw lungkhu lang tee hae zah ccungccaw patae kya a langkuh hae. <verse number="54" style="v" />Jesu a rin hae paw rhawbawipaw te a umkheih hae paw nynh innry asuekupaw te acyihkuhpaw balyn kha he a muih hae tuh myarya rih hae zah, “E paw tuh Pachia Ccapaw ccaccing nynh thua,” a ci hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Galilee ram kyate Jesu kha bawm hae zah a zui hae paw nopi hae patae mah tuin kya umbua hae zah arua te a dobua hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.55-56: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 8:2-3">Luk 8.2-3</ref></char></note> <verse number="56" style="v" />Tuh-e hae kyakhe Magdala khuanung Mary, James te Josef mih nung Mary te Zebedi ccaaw hae mih nung mah a umbua hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu Rhua Ccynaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mar 15.42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23.50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Joh 19.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Zetesang tuh Arimathea khuapaw a min Josef a ci hae paw mihoipaw yn thua, aning tuh Jesu zuitupaw nynh athuabua. <verse number="58" style="v" />Tuh-e paw nynh Pilat kalan cceih zah Jesu rhua kha a ngia; Pilat nynh Jesu rhua kha Josef kalan pya lan kaw a pya hae. <verse number="59" style="v" />Josef nynh Jesu rhua kha lawkuh zah athyaapaw boei rawpaw nebaleihpaw te a lung, <verse number="60" style="v" />amaw shaw lang cite lung a karynkupaw shaw thawpaw kyakhe a uu; tukoute myarya lepaw lung kha tounua zah athuhfu lang a hu koute a cciataw. <verse number="61" style="v" />Te Magdala khuanung Mary te ccangpaw Mary tuh shaw te ahawiliakuh lante tuin kya a haung hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Shaw Rhawvia hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Paccynku nin koute, awkhualan nin kya ranpibawi lepaw hae te Farasi hae tuh Pilat malang sueluakuh hae zah, <verse number="63" style="v" />“Bawipaw, e mihynpaw nynh a hiin lyaze, ‘Nin thum koute ka thoothui cih,’ cite a hopaw kha kae syntaw.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.63: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:21">Mat 16.21</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 17:23">17.23</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 20:19">20.19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:31">Mar 8.31</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 9:31">9.31</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 10:33-34">10.33-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22">Luk 9.22</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 18:31-33">18.31-33</ref></char></note> <verse number="64" style="v" />Tukeiccuze nin thum abia makhia shaw kha varyng rin lan kawpya hae, tuhkhyhze tuh a zuitu hae nynh khuazi khe oun cceih cih hae zah phe oun ruh cih hae, te ccungccaw hae kha, ‘Aning tuh chinaw kyate phe thoo vae,’ oun cipah cih hae; tukeiccuze nyathyakou e hynbya tuh masaty e laeze houh yn seihua vae cih,” cite a hopya hae. <verse number="65" style="v" />Pilat nynh, “Rhawviatu rhawkaw hae phang na hoi oh, la cceih oh lah na cyi kho oh thyhte shaw kha la khynsah oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="66" style="v" />Tukeiccuze cceih hae zah lung kha tazeih a khia kou hae te rhawviatu hae kha nungsya hae zah shaw kha a ngawsah hae.</para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Jesu Thoothuinaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:1-10">Mar 16.1-10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk 24.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Joh 20.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sabbath nin koute lonaw naw kheit kyaze masaty nin awkhua khuadaetakaw khe Magdala khuanung Mary te ccangpaw Mary tuh shaw do lan a cceih hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Vaekheihmawte myarya rupaw innry yn suekuh; pawccecize Bawipaw vaawpaw nynh vaawlang te yn rung zah shaw athuhfu kha a nue koute a vawlan khe a haung. <verse number="3" style="v" />A muinsan tuh khozaw te lokuh zah a boeining tuh vuiraw hawte araw. <verse number="4" style="v" />Shaw a rintu hae tuh tuh-e paw raw a ri hae keiccuze thyngkuh hae zah, kharouh chihpaw hawte nynh athua hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Vaawpaw nynh nopi hae kha, “Rih nan oh, nanning nynh a khiade hae paw Jesu kha nynh na ccung oh cipaw ka ny. <verse number="6" style="v" />Aning tuh hein kya um vae khyh, a ho hawte a thoothui vae. Rang oh lah a ccynaw hae hmin hynh oun dotua oh. <verse number="7" style="v" />Arangte la cceih oh lah a zuitu hae kyakhe, ‘Aning tuh chinaw kyate a thoothui vae; Galilee ram lang nae malang phe cceih vae cih, tuin kya amaw kha na la muih cih oh,’ cite la hopah oh. Nanning kha kae hopya vae oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Tukeiccuze nopi hae tuh ri biate, lungtuanaw alepi te shaw kyate rangsakute cceih hae zah a zuitu hae kha hopya khylan a ccue hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeipite Jesu nynh minmin kha yn tungkuh hae zah, “Nae kya daenaw um sah!” a cipya hae. Minmin nynh amaw kalan cceih hae zah a ccu kha pom hae zah a beik hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Jesu nynh minmin kha, “Rih nan oh; cceih oh lah ka uno hae kha Galilee lang ccia lan la hopah oh, tuin kya minmin nynh kae kha yn muih cih hae,” cite a hopya hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Shaw Rintu hae kyate Thaesahnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuh-e nopi hae a ccia lya hae khe, shaw rintu hae abang nynh khuapi lungkhu lang cceih hae zah acyihkuhpaw balyn kha ranpibawi lepaw hae kya a hopya hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Ranpibawi lepaw hae tuh piccan hae ryte tungkuh hae zah khua a khan kou hae te, rhawkaw hae kha phua patae pya hae zah, <verse number="13" style="v" />“Nanning nynh, ‘Khuazi marya kae itheih lyakhe a zuitu hae nynh oun cceih hae zah a rhua kha phe ru hae,’ nae ci cih oh. <verse number="14" style="v" />E kong hynh ram uktu nynh yn thae ze kaemaw nynh kae soihbia cih zah vawsaw kae tungsah lan khyh oh,” cite a hopya hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Tukeiccuze minmin nynh phua kha lawkuh hae zah a hopya hae thyhte a cyi hae; e kong hynh Judah hae nynh atunin cia a ho ung hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Zuitu hae Ryalaw Nawnaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:15-18">Mar 16.15-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Zuitu hae lu haw lae kheit tuh Jesu nynh a hopya sya hae paw Galilee ram e mua langkhe a cceih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:32">Mat 26.32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:28">Mar 14.28</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v" />Amaw kha he a muih hae te a beik hae; thuasalama abang tuh lunghiinnaw a hoi hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Jesu nynh yn thua zah, “Vaawlang te laephi vawlan e kawhoinaw balyn tuh kamaw kalan pya athua vae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Tukeiccuze la cceih oh lah minphuin hae balyn kha zuitu lang la rae oh, Paaw, Ccapaw te Thyaa Muisaw min te baptisma la pya oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28.19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:8">Loc 1.8</ref></char></note> <verse number="20" style="v" />Kaw kae pya oh paw balyn kha a zui nawlan hae la ccangpah oh; laephi she athang cia nae kya tyty ka um,” cite a zuitu hae kha a hopya hae. Amen.</para>
</usx>